<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="2SA" style="id">2SA</book>
  <para style="h">II Samuel</para>
  <para style="toc1">II SAMUEL</para>
  <para style="toc2">II Samuel</para>
  <para style="toc3">II Sam</para>
  <para style="mt1">II SAMUEL</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="2SA 1"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2SA 1:1"/>Alò, li te vin rive ke lè Saül te fin mouri, e David te retounen soti nan <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:1 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1SA 30:1-26">I Sam 30:1-26</ref></char></note>masak a Amalekit yo, ke David te rete pandan de jou nan Tsiklag. <verse eid="2SA 1:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2SA 1:2"/>Nan twazyèm jou a, vwala, yon mesye te sòti nan kan an kote Saül la. <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:2 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1SA 4:12">I Sam 4:12</ref></char></note>Rad li te chire epi te gen pousyè sou tèt li. Lè li te parèt a David, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:2 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1SA 25:23">I Sam 25:23</ref></char></note>li te tonbe atè; li te kouche plat nèt pou fè respè.<verse eid="2SA 1:2"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="2SA 1:3"/>Alò, David te di li: “Depi ki kote ou sòti?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2SA 1:3">Li te reponn: “Mwen te chape soti nan kan Israël la.”<verse eid="2SA 1:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="2SA 1:4"/>David te di li: <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:4 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1SA 4:16">I Sam 4:16</ref></char></note>“Se kijan bagay yo te sòti? Souple, fè m konnen.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2SA 1:4">Konsa, li te di: “Moun yo gen tan sove ale kite batay la, e anplis, anpil nan moun yo tonbe mouri. Epi Saül avèk Jonathan, fis li a te mouri tou.”<verse eid="2SA 1:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="2SA 1:5"/>Konsa, David te di a jennonm nan ki te pale li a: “Kijan ou fè konnen ke Saül avèk fis li, Jonathan mouri?”<verse eid="2SA 1:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="2SA 1:6"/>Jennonm ki te pale li a te di: “Pa aza mwen te sou Mòn Guilboa, e gade byen, Saül t ap apiye sou frenn li an. Epi gade, cha yo avèk chevalye yo t ap kouri rèd sou li. <verse eid="2SA 1:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2SA 1:7"/>Lè l te gade dèyè li, li te wè m e te rele mwen. Epi mwen te di: ‘Men mwen’. <verse eid="2SA 1:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2SA 1:8"/>Li te di mwen: ‘Se ki moun ou ye?’ Epi mwen te reponn li: <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:8 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1SA 15:3">I Sam 15:3</ref></char></note> ‘Mwen se yon Amalekit’. <verse eid="2SA 1:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2SA 1:9"/>Alò li te di mwen: ‘Souple, kanpe akote mwen pou touye mwen; paske gwo doulè gen tan sezi mwen akoz lavi m toujou rete nan mwen.’ <verse eid="2SA 1:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2SA 1:10"/>Konsa, mwen te kanpe akote li <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:10 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JDG 9:54">Jij 9:54</ref></char></note>pou te touye li; paske mwen te konnen ke li pa t kab viv lè l te fin tonbe a. Epi mwen te pran kouwòn ki te sou tèt li a, ak braslè ki te nan bra li a, e mwen te mennen yo isit la kote mèt mwen.”<verse eid="2SA 1:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="2SA 1:11"/>Alò, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:11 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2CH 34:27">II Kwo 34:27</ref></char></note>David te sezi rad li, te chire yo, menm jan tout mesye ki te avè l yo te fè. <verse eid="2SA 1:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2SA 1:12"/>Yo te fè dèy e te kriye <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:12 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2SA 3:35">II Sam 3:35</ref></char></note>fè jèn pou Saül avèk fis li a, Jonathan, pou pèp SENYÈ a e pou lakay Israël jis rive nan aswè, akoz yo te tonbe pa nepe.<verse eid="2SA 1:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="2SA 1:13"/>David te di a jennonm ki te pale li a: “Se kibò ou sòti?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2SA 1:13">Epi li te reponn: <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:13 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2SA 1:8">II Sam 1:8</ref></char></note>“Mwen se fis a yon etranje, yon Amalekit.”<verse eid="2SA 1:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="2SA 1:14"/>Alò, David te di li: “Kijan sa ye ke ou pa t pè lonje men ou pou detwi onksyone a SENYÈ a?” <verse eid="2SA 1:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2SA 1:15"/>Epi David te rele youn nan jennonm yo e te di: “Ale, koupe l fè l desann.” <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:15 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2SA 4:10-12">II Sam 4:10-12</ref></char></note>Konsa, li te frape li e li te mouri. <verse eid="2SA 1:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2SA 1:16"/>David te di li: “San ou sou pwòp tèt pa w; paske <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:16 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2SA 1:10">II Sam 1:10</ref></char></note>bouch ou te fè temwayaj kont ou menm e te di: ‘Mwen te touye onksyone a SENYÈ a.’”<verse eid="2SA 1:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="2SA 1:17"/>Alò, David te <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:17 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2CH 35:25">II Kwo 35:25</ref></char></note>chante lamantasyon sila sou Saül avèk fis li a, Jonathan. <verse eid="2SA 1:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2SA 1:18"/>Epi li te di yo pou montre fis a Juda yo chan ki rele Banza a. Gade byen, li ekri nan <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:18 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOS 10:13">Jos 10:13</ref></char></note>liv a Jaschar a.<verse eid="2SA 1:18"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="2SA 1:19"/>
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">1:19 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="2SA 1:25-27">II Sam 1:25-27</ref>
      </char>
    </note>“Bèlte ou, O Israël, detwi sou wo plas ou yo!</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="2SA 1:19">O kijan glwa ou yo te tonbe sou wo plas yo!<verse eid="2SA 1:19"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="2SA 1:20"/>
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">1:20 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="1SA 31:8-13">I Sam 31:8-13</ref> </char>
    </note>Pa pale sa nan Gath,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="2SA 1:20">ni pwoklame sa nan lari Askalon yo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="2SA 1:20">sof fi Filisten yo ta rejwi;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="2SA 1:20">fi a ensikonsi yo ta egzalte,<verse eid="2SA 1:20"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="2SA 1:21"/>
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">1:21 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="1SA 31:1">I Sam 31:1</ref> </char>
    </note>O mòn a Guilboa yo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="2SA 1:21">pa kite lawouze ni lapli vin tonbe sou nou,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="2SA 1:21">ni sou chanm ofrann yo;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="2SA 1:21">paske pwisan yo te tonbe,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="2SA 1:21">paske la, boukliye pwisan an te vin sal.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="2SA 1:21">Boukliye Saül te pedi lwil onksyon an.<verse eid="2SA 1:21"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="2SA 1:22"/>Soti nan san a sila ki te mouri yo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="2SA 1:22">soti nan grès a pwisan yo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="2SA 1:22">
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">1:22 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="1SA 18:4">I Sam 18:4</ref>
      </char>
    </note>banza a Jonathan an pa t fè bak,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="2SA 1:22">ni nepe a Saül la pa t retounen vid.<verse eid="2SA 1:22"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="2SA 1:23"/>Saül avèk Jonathan,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="2SA 1:23">byen emab e byeneme pandan vi pa yo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="2SA 1:23">epi nan mò yo, yo pa t vin separe.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="2SA 1:23">Yo te pi rapid ke èg yo.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="2SA 1:23">Yo te pi pwisan pase lyon yo.<verse eid="2SA 1:23"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="2SA 1:24"/>O fi Israël yo, kriye pou Saül,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="2SA 1:24">ki te fè nou abiye byen bèl ak twal wouj,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="2SA 1:24">ki te mete òneman an lò sou vètman nou.<verse eid="2SA 1:24"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="2SA 1:25"/>Kijan pwisan yo vin tonbe nan mitan batay la!</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="2SA 1:25">Jonathan vin touye sou wo plas nou yo.<verse eid="2SA 1:25"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="2SA 1:26"/>Mwen twouble pou ou, frè m Jonathan.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="2SA 1:26">Ou te konn fè m byen kontan.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="2SA 1:26">
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">1:26 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="1SA 18:1-4">I Sam 18:1-4</ref> </char>
    </note>Lanmou ou te yon bèl bagay.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="2SA 1:26">Lanmou ou te pi presye ke lanmou a yon fanm.<verse eid="2SA 1:26"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="2SA 1:27"/>Kijan pwisan yo te tonbe</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="2SA 1:27">e <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:27 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 13:5">És 13:5</ref></char></note>zam lagè yo te vin peri!”<verse eid="2SA 1:27"/></para>
  <chapter eid="2SA 1"/>
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="2SA 2"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2SA 2:1"/>Alò, li te vin rive apre, ke David te fè demand a SENYÈ a, e te di: “Èske Mwen dwe monte nan youn nan vil Juda yo?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2SA 2:1">Epi SENYÈ a te di li: “Monte!”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2SA 2:1">Konsa David te di: “Se kibò pou m ta monte?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2SA 2:1">Epi Li te di: <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:1 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOS 14:13">Jos 14:13</ref></char></note>“Nan Hébron.”<verse eid="2SA 2:1"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="2SA 2:2"/>Pou sa, David te monte la ansanm ak<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:2 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1SA 25:42-43">I Sam 25:42-43</ref></char></note>de madanm li yo tou, Achinoam, Jizreyelit la, avèk Abigaïl, Kamelit la, fanm a Nabal la. <verse eid="2SA 2:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2SA 2:3"/>Epi <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:3 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1SA 30:9">I Sam 30:9</ref></char></note>David te fè monte mesye ki te avèk li yo, yo chak avèk pwòp lakay pa yo, e yo te rete nan vil Hébron yo. <verse eid="2SA 2:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2SA 2:4"/>Alò, mesye Juda yo te parèt e se la, yo te <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:4 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1SA 16:13">I Sam 16:13</ref></char></note>onksyone David wa sou kay Juda a. Epi yo te pale David, e te di: “Se te mesye a Jabés Galaad ki te antere Saül yo.” <verse eid="2SA 2:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2SA 2:5"/>David te voye mesaje yo bò kote mesye Jabés Galaad yo. Li te di yo: <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:5 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1SA 23:21">I Sam 23:21</ref></char></note>“Ke nou beni pa SENYÈ a akoz nou te montre bonte nou anvè Saül, mèt nou an, e nou te antere li. <verse eid="2SA 2:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2SA 2:6"/>Alò, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:6 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 34:6">Egz 34:6</ref></char></note>ke SENYÈ a montre bonte avèk verite Li a nou menm. Konsa, mwen tou, mwen va montre nou bonte sa a akoz nou te fè bagay sa a. <verse eid="2SA 2:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2SA 2:7"/>Pou sa, kite men nou rete fò e plen kouraj. Paske mèt nou an, Saül mouri e anplis, kay Juda a te onksyone mwen kòm wa sou yo menm”.<verse eid="2SA 2:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="2SA 2:8"/>Men <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:8 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1SA 14:50">I Sam 14:50</ref></char></note>Abner, fis a Ner a, te pran Isch-Boscheth, fis a Saül la e te mennen li antre Mahanaïm. <verse eid="2SA 2:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2SA 2:9"/>Li te fè li wa sou <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:9 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOS 22:9">Jos 22:9</ref></char></note>Galaad, sou Gechouryen yo, sou Jizreel, sou Ephraïm ak sou Benjamin, menm sou tout Israël la. <verse eid="2SA 2:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2SA 2:10"/>Isch-Boscheth, fis a Saül la te gen karant ane lè l te devni wa sou Israël, e li te wa pandan dezan. Men, lakay Juda te swiv David. <verse eid="2SA 2:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2SA 2:11"/><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:11 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2SA 5:5">II Sam 5:5</ref></char></note>Fòs tan ke David te wa nan Hébron sou Juda a se te sèt ane avèk si mwa.<verse eid="2SA 2:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="2SA 2:12"/>Alò, Abner, fis a Ner a te sòti Mahanaïm kote <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:12 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOS 10:12">Jos 10:12</ref></char></note>Gabaon avèk sèvitè a Isch-Boscheth yo, fis a Saül la. <verse eid="2SA 2:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2SA 2:13"/>Konsa, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:13 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2SA 8:16">II Sam 8:16</ref></char></note>Joab, fis a Tseruja a avèk sèvitè a David yo te sòti pou rankontre yo akote sous Gabaon an. Yo te chita konsa, youn nan yon bò sous la e lòt la nan lòtbò sous la. <verse eid="2SA 2:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2SA 2:14"/>Abner te di a Joab: “Alò, kite jennonm yo leve <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:14 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2SA 2:16-17">II Sam 2:16-17</ref></char></note>fè yon kou batay devan nou la a.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2SA 2:14">Joab te reponn: “Kite yo leve.” <verse eid="2SA 2:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2SA 2:15"/>Konsa, yo te leve travèse ak kontwòl, douz pou Benjamin avèk Isch-Boscheth, fis a Saül yo e douz pou sèvitè a David yo. <verse eid="2SA 2:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2SA 2:16"/>Chak te sezi advèsè li nan tèt e te fonse nepe li nan akote advèsè li a; konsa, yo te tonbe atè ansanm. Pou sa, yo te rele plas sa a Helkath-Hatsurim chanm a lam nepe yo ki nan Gabaon. <verse eid="2SA 2:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2SA 2:17"/>Nan jou sa a, batay la te trè sevè e <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:17 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2SA 3:1">II Sam 3:1</ref></char></note>Abner avèk mesye Israël yo te kale devan sèvitè David yo. <verse eid="2SA 2:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2SA 2:18"/>Alò, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:18 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1CH 2:16">I Kwo 2:16</ref></char></note>twa fis a Tseruja yo te la, Joab avèk Abschaï avèk Asaël te vit sou pye yo tankou yon gazèl mawon nan chan. <verse eid="2SA 2:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="2SA 2:19"/>Asaël te kouri dèyè Abner e pa t vire ni adwat ni agoch nan kouri dèyè Abner.<verse eid="2SA 2:19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="2SA 2:20"/>Alò, Abner te gade dèyè li, e te di: “Èske se ou, Asaël?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2SA 2:20">Epi li te reponn: “Se mwen.”<verse eid="2SA 2:20"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="2SA 2:21"/>Konsa, Abner te di li: “Vire vè adwat oswa agoch, pran youn nan jennonm yo pou kont ou e pran pou ou menm nan piyaj la.” Men Asaël pa t dakò pou vire pa swiv li. <verse eid="2SA 2:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="2SA 2:22"/>Abner te repete ankò a Asaël: “Vire pa swiv mwen Poukisa mwen ta frape ou pou jiskaske ou rive atè? <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:22 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2SA 3:27">II Sam 3:27</ref></char></note>Konsa, kijan mwen ta kapab leve figi mwen a frè ou a, Joab?” <verse eid="2SA 2:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="2SA 2:23"/>Sepandan, li te refize vire akote; pou sa, Abner te frape li nan vant avèk frenn li jiskaske li te parèt nan do li Epi li te tonbe la menm e te mouri sou lye a. Epi li te vin rive ke tout moun ki te vini kote <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:23 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2SA 20:12">II Sam 20:12</ref></char></note>Asaël te mouri an, te kanpe an plas.<verse eid="2SA 2:23"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="2SA 2:24"/>Men Joab avèk Abischaï te kouri dèyè Abner e pandan solèy la t ap bese, yo te rive nan ti mòn a Amma a, ki devan Guiach pa chemen dezè a Gabaon an. <verse eid="2SA 2:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="2SA 2:25"/>Fis Benjamin yo te rasanble ansanm dèyè Abner e te devni yon sèl ekip; epi yo te kanpe sou tèt a yon sèten ti mòn. <verse eid="2SA 2:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="2SA 2:26"/>Alò, Abner te rele Joab e te di: “Èske epe a va devore tout tan? Èske ou pa konprann ke alafen, sa ap vin anmè? Pou konbyen de tan ou va refize di pèp la sispann kouri dèyè frè yo?”<verse eid="2SA 2:26"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="2SA 2:27"/>Joab te di: “Jan Bondye viv la, si ou pa t pale; byensi, pèp la t ap kite sa maten an e chak moun t ap sispann swiv frè yo.” <verse eid="2SA 2:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="2SA 2:28"/>Epi Joab te soufle twonpèt la. Konsa, tout pèp la te sispann e yo pa t kouri dèyè Israël ankò, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:28 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2SA 3:1">II Sam 3:1</ref></char></note>ni yo pa t kontinye goumen ankò. <verse eid="2SA 2:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="2SA 2:29"/>Alò, Abner avèk mesye pa li yo te mache nan dezè Araba a tout nwit lan. Yo te travèse Jourdain an, yo te mache tout maten an pou te vini <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:29 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2SA 2:8">II Sam 2:8</ref></char></note>Mahanaïm.<verse eid="2SA 2:29"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="2SA 2:30"/>Alò, Joab te retounen soti swiv Abner. Lè li te fin rasanble tout pèp la ansanm, diz-nèf nan sèvitè David yo anplis ke Asaël te manke. <verse eid="2SA 2:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="2SA 2:31"/>Men sèvitè David yo te touye anpil nan mesye Benjamin yo avèk Abner yo, jiskaske te rive twa-san-swasant moun te mouri. <verse eid="2SA 2:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="2SA 2:32"/>Yo te pran Asaël e te antere li <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:32 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 47:29-30">Jen 47:29-30</ref></char></note>nan tonm papa li ki te Bethléhem. Epi Joab avèk mesye pa l yo te ale tout nwit lan jiskaske li te vin fè jou kote Hébron.<verse eid="2SA 2:32"/></para>
  <chapter eid="2SA 2"/>
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="2SA 3"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2SA 3:1"/>Alò, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:1 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1KI 14:30">I Wa 14:30</ref></char></note>te gen yon gè byen long antre lakay Saül ak lakay David. David te vin pi pwisan, men lakay Saül, ofiyamezi, te vin pi fèb. <verse eid="2SA 3:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2SA 3:2"/><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:2 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1CH 3:1-3">I Kwo 3:1-3</ref></char></note>Fis te ne a David an Hébron: premye ne li a se te Amnon, pa Achinoam, Jizreyelit la; <verse eid="2SA 3:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2SA 3:3"/>epi dezyèm li a, Kileab, pa Abigaïl la, vèv a Nabal la, Kamalit la; epi twazyèm nan, Absalom, fis <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:3 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1SA 27:8">I Sam 27:8</ref></char></note>Maaca a, fi a Talmaï a, wa a Gueschur; <verse eid="2SA 3:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2SA 3:4"/>epi katriyèm nan, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:4 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1KI 1:5">I Wa 1:5</ref></char></note>Adonija, fis a Haggith la e senkyèm nan, Schephathia, fis a Abithal la; <verse eid="2SA 3:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2SA 3:5"/>epi sizyèm nan, Jithream, pa Égla a, madanm a David.<verse eid="2SA 3:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="2SA 3:6"/>Li te vin rive ke pandan te gen lagè antre lakay Saül ak lakay David, ke <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:6 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2SA 2:8-9">II Sam 2:8-9</ref></char></note>Abner t ap ranfòse pozisyon li lakay Saül. <verse eid="2SA 3:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2SA 3:7"/>Alò, Saül te gen yon ti mennaj ki te rele <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:7 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2SA 21:8-11">II Sam 21:8-11</ref></char></note>Ritspa, fi a Ajja a. Konsa, Isch-Boscheth te di a Abner: “Poukisa ou te antre nan ti mennaj papa m nan?”<verse eid="2SA 3:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="2SA 3:8"/>Alò, Abner te byen fache akoz pawòl a Isch-Boscheth yo e te di: <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:8 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1SA 24:14">I Sam 24:14</ref></char></note>“Èske mwen se tèt yon chen ki pou Juda? Jodi a, mwen montre favè a lakay papa ou, a frè li yo, a zanmi li yo e mwen pa t livre ou nan men David. Epi malgre sa, jodi a, ou akize mwen kòm koupab nan afè fanm nan. <verse eid="2SA 3:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2SA 3:9"/><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:9 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1KI 19:2">I Wa 19:2</ref></char></note>Ke Bondye fè sa a Abner, e menm plis toujou, si jan SENYÈ a te sèmante a David la, mwen pa akonpli sa pou li, <verse eid="2SA 3:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2SA 3:10"/><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:10 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1SA 15:28">I Sam 15:28</ref> </char></note>pou fè wayòm nan kite lakay Saül pou vin etabli sou twòn David sou Israël ak sou Juda, soti nan Dan, jis rive Beer-Schéba.”<verse eid="2SA 3:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="2SA 3:11"/>Epi li pa t kab reponn Abner ankò, akoz li te pè li.<verse eid="2SA 3:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="2SA 3:12"/>Alò Abner te voye mesaje yo kote David nan plas li, e te di: “Pou kilès peyi a ye? Fè akò ou avèk mwen; epi pou sa, men m va avèk ou pou mennen tout Israël bò kote ou.”<verse eid="2SA 3:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="2SA 3:13"/>Li te di: “Sa bon! Mwen va fè yon akò avèk ou, men mwen ap fè yon sèten demann a ou menm. Konsa, ou p ap menm wè figi m sof ke ou mennen <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:13 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1SA 18:20">I Sam 18:20</ref></char></note>premyèman Mical, fi a Saül la, lè ou vin wè mwen.” <verse eid="2SA 3:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2SA 3:14"/>Konsa, David te voye mesaje yo kote Isch-Boscheth, fis a Saül la, e te di: “Ban mwen madanm mwen Mical, avèk sila mwen te fiyanse <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:14 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1SA 18:25-27">I Sam 18:25-27</ref></char></note>pou yon santèn prepuce moun ki sòti nan Filisten yo.”<verse eid="2SA 3:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="2SA 3:15"/>Isch-Boscheth te voye retire li de mari li, Paithiel, fis a Laïsch la. <verse eid="2SA 3:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2SA 3:16"/>Men mari li te ale avèk li. Li t ap kriye pandan li t ap prale e te swiv li jis rive <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:16 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2SA 16:5">II Sam 16:5</ref></char></note>Bachurim. Epi Abner te di li: “Ale, retounen!” Konsa, li te retounen.<verse eid="2SA 3:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="2SA 3:17"/>Alò, Abner te fè konsiltasyon avèk <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:17 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1SA 8:4">I Sam 8:4</ref></char></note>ansyen Israël yo e te di: “Nan tan pase yo, nou te chache fè David vin wa sou nou. <verse eid="2SA 3:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2SA 3:18"/>Alò konsa, annou fè l. Paske SENYÈ a te pale a David e te di: ‘Pa men a sèvitè Mwen an, David, Mwen va sove pèp Mwen an, Israël soti nan men a Filisten yo ak nan men a tout lènmi pa yo.’”<verse eid="2SA 3:18"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="2SA 3:19"/>Abner osi te pale nan zòrèy a moun Benjamin yo. Anplis, Abner te ale fè rapò a David nan Hébron ke tout sa te parèt bon pou Israël, tout lakay Israël la ak a <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:19 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1SA 10:20-21">I Sam 10:20-21</ref></char></note>tout lakay Benjamin an. <verse eid="2SA 3:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="2SA 3:20"/>Alò, Abner avèk ven mesye avèk li te vin kote David nan Hébron. David te fè yon gwo fèt pou Abner avèk mesye ki te avèk li yo. <verse eid="2SA 3:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="2SA 3:21"/>Abner te di a David: “Kite mwen leve pou m ale <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:21 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1SA 3:10-12">I Sam 3:10-12</ref></char></note>rasanble tout Israël la kote mèt mwen an, wa a, pou yo kapab fè yon akò avèk ou e pou ou kapab devni wa sou tout sa ke nanm ou dezire yo.” Konsa, David te voye Abner ale e li te ale anpè.<verse eid="2SA 3:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="2SA 3:22"/>Epi vwala, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:22 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1SA 27:8">I Sam 27:8</ref></char></note>sèvitè a David yo avèk Joab te antre sòti nan yon atak piyaj e yo te pote anpil piyaj avèk yo. Men Abner pa t avèk David nan Hébron; paske li te voye li ale e li te sòti anpè. <verse eid="2SA 3:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="2SA 3:23"/>Lè Joab avèk tout lame ki te avèk li a te rive, yo te pale Joab e te di: “Abner, fis a Ner a te rive vè wa a, li te voye li ale e li te sòti anpè.”<verse eid="2SA 3:23"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="2SA 3:24"/>Alò, Joab te vini vè wa a e te di: “Se kisa ou te fè la a? Gade, Abner te vin kote ou. Alò, poukisa ou te voye li ale sòti deja? <verse eid="2SA 3:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="2SA 3:25"/>Ou konnen Abner, fis a Ner a, ke li te antre pou twonpe ou, pou aprann jan ou sòti ak jan ou antre, pou dekouvri tout sa w ap fè.”<verse eid="2SA 3:25"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="2SA 3:26"/>Lè Joab te sòti kote David, li te voye mesaje yo dèyè Abner. Yo te mennen li retounen soti nan pwi Sira a; men David pa t konnen. <verse eid="2SA 3:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="2SA 3:27"/>Konsa, lè Abner te retounen Hébron, Joab te pran li akote mitan pòtay la, konsi, pou pale avèk li an prive, epi la, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:27 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2SA 2:23">II Sam 2:23</ref></char></note>li te frennen li nan vant jiskaske li te mouri akoz san Asaël, frè li a. <verse eid="2SA 3:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="2SA 3:28"/>Apre, lè David te tande sa, li te di: “Mwen avèk wayòm mwen an inosan devan SENYÈ a jis pou tout tan sou afè san Abner a, fis a Ner a. <verse eid="2SA 3:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="2SA 3:29"/><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:29 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 21:6-9">Det 21:6-9</ref></char></note>Konsa, san sa a vin tonbe sou tèt Joab avèk tout lakay papa li. Epi pou ta genyen toujou lakay li yon moun ki gen ekoulman, oswa lalèp, oswa ki oblije mache ak baton, oswa ki tonbe pa nepe, oswa ki manke pen.” <verse eid="2SA 3:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="2SA 3:30"/>Konsa, Joab avèk Abischaï te touye Abner <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:30 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2SA 2:23">II Sam 2:23</ref></char></note>akoz li te mete frè yo a lanmò nan batay Gabaon an.<verse eid="2SA 3:30"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="2SA 3:31"/>Alò, David te di a Joab avèk tout moun ki te avèk li yo: <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:31 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 37:34">Jen 37:34</ref></char></note>“Chire rad nou e abiye nou an sak pou fè lamantasyon devan Abner.” Epi Wa David te mache dèyè sèkèy la. <verse eid="2SA 3:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="2SA 3:32"/>Konsa, yo te antere Abner Hébron. Wa a te leve vwa li pou te kriye akote <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:32 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOB 31:28-29">Job 31:28-29</ref></char></note>tonm Abner a, e tout moun te kriye. <verse eid="2SA 3:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="2SA 3:33"/><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:33 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2SA 1:17">II Sam 1:17</ref></char></note> Wa a te chante yon lamantasyon pou Abner, e te di: “Èske Abner ta dwe mouri tankou yon moun fou ta mouri? <verse eid="2SA 3:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="2SA 3:34"/>Men ou pa t mare, ni pye ou pa t anchene. Tankou yon moun ki tonbe devan mechan yo, ou te tonbe.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2SA 3:34">Epi tout moun te kriye ankò sou li. <verse eid="2SA 3:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="2SA 3:35"/>Alò, tout pèp la te vini pou konvenk David manje pen pandan li te toujou nan lajounen, men David te fè ve e te di: “Ke Bondye fè m sa e menm plis, si mwen goute pen oswa nenpòt lòt bagay <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:35 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2SA 1:12">II Sam 1:12</ref></char></note>avan solèy la vin kouche.”<verse eid="2SA 3:35"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="2SA 3:36"/>Alò, tout pèp la te remake afè sa a, e li te fè yo plezi, jis jan ke tout sa ke wa a te fè te fè tout pèp la plezi. <verse eid="2SA 3:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="2SA 3:37"/>Konsa, tout pèp la ak tout Israël te konprann nan jou sa a ke li pa t volonte a wa a pou mete Abner, fis a Ner a lanmò. <verse eid="2SA 3:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="2SA 3:38"/>Epi wa a te pale ak sèvitè li yo: “Èske nou pa konnen ke yon prens, yon gran òm vin tonbe nan jou sa a an Israël? <verse eid="2SA 3:38"/><verse number="39" style="v" sid="2SA 3:39"/>Mwen fèb jodi a, malgre m onksyone kòm wa. Mesye sila yo, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:39 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2SA 19:5-7">II Sam 19:5-7</ref></char></note>fis a Tseruja yo twò difisil pou mwen! <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:39 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1KI 2:32-34">I Wa 2:32-34</ref></char></note>Ke SENYÈ a rekonpanse malfektè a selon mechanste li a.”<verse eid="2SA 3:39"/></para>
  <chapter eid="2SA 3"/>
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="2SA 4"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2SA 4:1"/>Alò, lè Isch-Boscheth, fis a Saül la, te tande ke <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:1 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2SA 3:27">II Sam 3:27</ref></char></note>Abner te mouri Hébron, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:1 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZR 4:4">Esd 4:4</ref></char></note>li te pèdi kouraj e tout Israël te twouble. <verse eid="2SA 4:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2SA 4:2"/>Fis a Saül la te gen de mesye ki te kòmandan a bann sòlda yo. Non a youn se te Baana e lòt la te Récab, fis a Rimmon Beéroth yo, ki apatyen a fis Benjamin yo (paske Beéroth te konsidere kòm yon pati nan Benjamin. <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:2 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOS 9:17">Jos 9:17</ref>; <ref loc="JOS 18:25">Jos 18:25</ref></char></note> <verse eid="2SA 4:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2SA 4:3"/>Tout Beyewotyen yo te sove ale pou rive <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:3 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NEH 11:33">Né 11:33</ref></char></note>Guitthaïm e te rete la kòm etranje jis rive jodi a).<verse eid="2SA 4:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="2SA 4:4"/>Alò, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:4 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2SA 9:3-6">II Sam 9:3-6</ref></char></note>Jonathan, fis a Saül la, te gen yon fis ki te kokobe nan pye li. Li te konsa akoz lè li te gen laj a senk ane lè rapò a Saül avèk Jonathan te rive soti Jizréel, fanm nouris li an te pran fis la pou te sove ale. Epi nan kouri sòti, li te tonbe e te vin kokobe. Non li se te Méphiboscheth.<verse eid="2SA 4:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="2SA 4:5"/>Konsa fis a Rimmon yo, Beyewotyen an, Récab, avèk Banna te pati pou te rive lakay <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:5 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2SA 2:8">II Sam 2:8</ref></char></note>Isch-Boscheth nan chalè lajounen an pandan li t ap pran repo midi a. <verse eid="2SA 4:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2SA 4:6"/>Yo te rive nan mitan kay la kòmsi yo t ap pran ble e <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:6 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2SA 2:23">II Sam 2:23</ref></char></note>yo te frape li nan vant. Epi Récab avèk Banna, frè li yo te chape ale. <verse eid="2SA 4:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2SA 4:7"/>Alò, lè yo te vin rive anndan kay la, pandan li te kouche sou kabann li nan chanm a dòmi li an, yo te frape li e te touye li. Yo te koupe tèt li e yo te <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:7 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2SA 2:29">II Sam 2:29</ref></char></note>vwayaje ak li nan chemen Araba a tout nwit lan. <verse eid="2SA 4:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2SA 4:8"/>Konsa, yo te mennen tèt a Isch-Boscheth kote David nan Hébron e yo te di a wa a: “Men gade, tèt a Isch-Boscheth, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:8 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1SA 24:4">I Sam 24:4</ref></char></note>fis a Saül la, lènmi pa w la, ki te chache lavi ou a. Konsa, nan jou sa a, SENYÈ a te bay mèt mwen an, wa a, vanjans sou Saül avèk desandan li yo.”<verse eid="2SA 4:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="2SA 4:9"/>David te reponn Récab avèk Banna, frè li, fis a Rimmon yo, Beyewotyen an, e te di yo: “Jan SENYÈ a viv la, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:9 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1KI 1:29">I Wa 1:29</ref></char></note>ki te peye racha lavi m soti nan tout twoub yo, <verse eid="2SA 4:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2SA 4:10"/><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:10 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2SA 1:2-15">II Sam 1:2-15</ref></char></note>lè yon moun te pale m e te di: ‘Gade, Saül mouri’ e te panse ke se bòn nouvèl ke li te pote, mwen te sezi li e te touye li Tsiklag, kòm rekonpans pou nouvèl la. <verse eid="2SA 4:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2SA 4:11"/>Alò, konbyen anplis, lè moun mechan yo vin touye yon nonm ladwati nan pwòp kay li sou kabann li! Èske se pa ke m ta oblije mande san li nan men nou e rache nou sou fas tè a?” <verse eid="2SA 4:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2SA 4:12"/>Alò, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:12 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2SA 1:15">II Sam 1:15</ref></char></note>David te pase lòd sou jennonm yo. Yo te touye yo, yo te koupe men yo avèk pye yo, e te pann yo akote sous Hébron an. Men yo te pran tèt a Isch Boscheth <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:12 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2SA 3:32">II Sam 3:32</ref></char></note> e yo te antere li nan tonm Abner a nan Hébron.<verse eid="2SA 4:12"/></para>
  <chapter eid="2SA 4"/>
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="2SA 5"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2SA 5:1"/>
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">5:1 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="2SA 1:2-15">II Sam 1:2-15</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Alò, tout tribi Israël yo te vin kote David Hébron e te di: “Gade byen, nou se pwòp <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:1 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2SA 19:13">II Sam 19:13</ref></char></note>zo ou ak chè ou. <verse eid="2SA 5:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2SA 5:2"/>Avan, lè Saül te wa sou nou, se te ou menm sèl ki te mennen Israël antre, sòti. Epi SENYÈ a te di ou: ‘Ou va bèje pèp Mwen an, Israël e ou va yon <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:2 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1SA 25:30">I Sam 25:30</ref></char></note>chèf sou Israël.’” <verse eid="2SA 5:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2SA 5:3"/>Konsa, tout ansyen Israël yo te vin kote wa a Hébron e Wa David <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:3 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2SA 3:21">II Sam 3:21</ref></char></note>te fè yon akò avèk yo devan SENYÈ a Hébron. Epi <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:3 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1SA 16:13">I Sam 16:13</ref></char></note>yo te onksyone David wa sou Israël.<verse eid="2SA 5:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="2SA 5:4"/>David te gen laj a <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:4 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NUM 4:3">Nonb 4:3</ref></char></note>trantan lè l te devni wa. Li te renye pandan karantan. <verse eid="2SA 5:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2SA 5:5"/>Nan Hébron, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:5 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2SA 2:11">II Sam 2:11</ref></char></note>li te renye sou Juda pandan sèt ane, si mwa e nan Jérusalem, li te renye pandan trann-twazan sou tout Israël avèk Juda.<verse eid="2SA 5:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="2SA 5:6"/>
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">5:6 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="1CH 11:4-9">I Kwo 11:4-9</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Alò, wa a avèk moun pa li yo te ale Jérusalem kont Jebizyen yo, moun ki te rete nan peyi a. Men yo te di a David: “Ou p ap antre isit la, men menm avèg yo avèk bwate yo va fè ou vire ale”. Paske yo te panse ke: “David p ap kab antre la.” <verse eid="2SA 5:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2SA 5:7"/>Sepandan, David te kaptire fòterès Sion an, sa vle di, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:7 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2SA 6:12-16">II Sam 6:12-16</ref></char></note>“vil David la”. <verse eid="2SA 5:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2SA 5:8"/>David te di nan jou sa a: “Nenpòt moun ki va frape Jebizyen yo, kite li rive kote bwate yo avèk avèg yo, ki rayi pa nanm David, pa kanal dlo a.” Akoz sa, yo konn di: “Avèg ak bwate p ap antre nan kay la.”<verse eid="2SA 5:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="2SA 5:9"/>Konsa, David te rete nan fò a e li te rele li “Vil David la”. Epi David te bati toutotou soti nan sitadèl Milo a jis rive anndan. <verse eid="2SA 5:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2SA 5:10"/><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:10 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2SA 3:1">II Sam 3:1</ref></char></note>David te devni gran e pi gran, paske SENYÈ a, Bondye dèzame yo te avèk li. <verse eid="2SA 5:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2SA 5:11"/><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:11 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1KI 5:1-18">I Wa 5:1-18</ref></char></note>Alò, Hiram, wa a Tyr la, te voye mesaje yo kote David avèk bwa sèd avèk chapant ak mason k ap kraze wòch; epi yo te bati yon kay pou David. <verse eid="2SA 5:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2SA 5:12"/>Konsa, David te vin wè ke SENYÈ a te etabli li kòm wa sou Israël, ke Li te egzalte wayòm li an pou koz pèp Li a, Israël.<verse eid="2SA 5:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="2SA 5:13"/>Antretan, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:13 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 17:17">Det 17:17</ref></char></note>David te pran plis ti mennaj avèk madanm soti Jérusalem lè l fin kite Hébron; epi plis fis avèk fi te fèt pou David. <verse eid="2SA 5:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2SA 5:14"/>Alò, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:14 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1CH 3:5-8">I Kwo 3:5-8</ref></char></note>sila yo se non a sila ki te fèt pou li Jérusalem yo: Schammua, Schobab, Nathan, Salomon, <verse eid="2SA 5:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2SA 5:15"/>Jibhar, Élishua, Népheg, Japhia, <verse eid="2SA 5:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2SA 5:16"/>Élischama, Éliada, Éliphéleth.<verse eid="2SA 5:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="2SA 5:17"/>Lè Filisten yo te tande ke yo te onksyone David wa sou Israël, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:17 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1SA 29:1">I Sam 29:1</ref></char></note>tout Filisten yo te monte pou chache jwenn David. Lè David te tande sa, li te desann nan fò a. <verse eid="2SA 5:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2SA 5:18"/>Alò, Filisten yo te vin gaye yo nan <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:18 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 14:5">Jen 14:5</ref></char></note>vale Rephaïm nan. <verse eid="2SA 5:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="2SA 5:19"/>Konsa, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:19 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1SA 23:2">I Sam 23:2</ref></char></note>David te mande konsèy a SENYÈ a. Li te mande: “Èske mwen dwe monte kont Filisten yo? Èske Ou va livre yo nan men mwen?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2SA 5:19">SENYÈ a te reponn a David: “Monte, paske vrèman, Mwen va livre Filisten yo nan men ou.”<verse eid="2SA 5:19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="2SA 5:20"/>Konsa, David te vini <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:20 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1CH 14:11">I Kwo 14:11</ref></char></note>Baal-Peratism e te bat yo la. Li te di: “SENYÈ a te antre sou lènmi mwen yo devan m tankou yon dlo k ap kase.” Pou sa, li te rele plas sa a Baal-Peratsim. <verse eid="2SA 5:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="2SA 5:21"/>Yo te abandone zidòl yo la. Pou sa, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:21 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1CH 14:12">I Kwo 14:12</ref></char></note>David avèk mesye li yo te pote yo ale.<verse eid="2SA 5:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="2SA 5:22"/>Alò, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:22 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2SA 5:18">II Sam 5:18</ref></char></note>Filisten yo te monte yon fwa ankò. Yo te gaye yo nan vale Rephaïm nan. <verse eid="2SA 5:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="2SA 5:23"/>Lè <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:23 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2SA 5:19">II Sam 5:19</ref></char></note>David te mande konsèy a SENYÈ a, Li te di: “Ou pa pou monte. Ansèkle jis pa dèyè yo e vini sou yo pa devan pye sikomò yo. <verse eid="2SA 5:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="2SA 5:24"/>Li va rive, ke lè ou tande son mache a sou tèt bwa yo; alò, ou va aji vit, paske se nan lè sa a ke <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:24 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JDG 4:14">Jij 4:14</ref></char></note>SENYÈ a ap gen tan sòti devan ou pou frape lame Filisten an.”<verse eid="2SA 5:24"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="2SA 5:25"/>Alò, David te fè konsa, jis jan ke SENYÈ a te kòmande li a, e li te bat Filisten yo soti Guéba, pou jis rive Guézer.<verse eid="2SA 5:25"/></para>
  <chapter eid="2SA 5"/>
  <chapter number="6" style="c" sid="2SA 6"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2SA 6:1"/>
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">6:1 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="1CH 13:5-14">I Kwo 13:5-14</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Alò, David te ankò ranmase tout mesye chwazi an Israël yo nan kantite trant-mil. <verse eid="2SA 6:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2SA 6:2"/>Li te leve pou te ale avèk tout moun ki te avèk li yo Baalé-Juda, pou fè monte soti la, lach Bondye ki rele pa <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6:2 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LEV 24:16">Lev 24:16</ref></char></note>Non an, vrè non dirèk SENYÈ dèzame yo ki enstale sou twòn anwo cheriben an. <verse eid="2SA 6:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2SA 6:3"/>Yo te plase lach Bondye a sou yon <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6:3 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NUM 7:4-9">Nonb 7:4-9</ref></char></note>kabwa tounèf pou yo te kab mennen li soti lakay Abinadab ki te sou ti kolin nan. Se te Uzza avèk Achjo, fis Abinadab la, ki te mennen kabwèt nèf la. <verse eid="2SA 6:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2SA 6:4"/>Konsa, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6:4 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1SA 18:6-7">I Sam 18:6-7</ref></char></note>yo te mennen li avèk lach Bondye a soti lakay Abinadab, ki te sou ti kolin nan. Achjo t ap mache devan lach la. <verse eid="2SA 6:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2SA 6:5"/>Antretan, David avèk tout lakay SENYÈ a <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6:5 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1SA 18:6-7">I Sam 18:6-7</ref></char></note>t ap selebre devan SENYÈ a <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6:5 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1CH 13:8">I Kwo 13:8</ref></char></note>avèk tout kalite enstriman ki fèt an bwa pichpen, avèk lap, gita, tanbouren, ak kastanèt ak senbal.<verse eid="2SA 6:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="2SA 6:6"/>Men lè yo te rive nan glasi Nacon an, Uzza te <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6:6 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NUM 4:15-20">Nonb 4:15-20</ref></char></note>lonje men l vè lach Bondye a pou te kenbe li, paske bèf kabwèt yo te manke tonbe. <verse eid="2SA 6:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2SA 6:7"/>Konsa, kòlè SENYÈ a te brile kont Uzza, epi <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6:7 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1SA 6:19">I Sam 6:19</ref></char></note>Bondye te frape li la pou mank respè li a. Li te mouri la akote lach BONDYE a. <verse eid="2SA 6:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2SA 6:8"/>David te vin fache akoz kòlè SENYÈ a kont Uzza e plas sa a te vin rele Pérets-Uzza (kase antre a Uzza) jis rive jodi a. <verse eid="2SA 6:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2SA 6:9"/>Konsa, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6:9 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 119:120">Sòm 119:120</ref></char></note>David te pè SENYÈ a nan jou sa a. Li te di: “Kijan lach SENYÈ a kapab rive kote mwen?” <verse eid="2SA 6:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2SA 6:10"/>Konsa, David pa t dakò pou deplase lach la antre nan vil David la avèk li; men David te mennen li akote, pou l rive kay <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6:10 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1CH 26:4-8">I Kwo 26:4-8</ref></char></note>Obed-Édom, Gatyen an. <verse eid="2SA 6:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2SA 6:11"/>Konsa, lach SENYÈ a te rete lakay Obed-Édom an, Gatyen an, pandan twa mwa e SENYÈ a te beni Obed-Édom avèk tout lakay li. <verse eid="2SA 6:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2SA 6:12"/>Alò, yo te pale a wa David, e te di: “SENYÈ a te beni lakay Obed-Édom avèk tout sa ki pou li akoz lach Bondye a.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2SA 6:12">
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">6:12 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="1CH 15:25-29">I Kwo 15:25-29</ref> </char>
    </note>Konsa, David te ale monte lach Bondye a soti lakay Obed-Édom pou antre nan vil David la avèk kè kontan. <verse eid="2SA 6:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2SA 6:13"/>Lè <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6:13 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NUM 4:15">Nonb 4:15</ref></char></note>pòtè lach SENYÈ a yo te fin fè sis pa, li te fè sakrifis a yon bèf kabwèt avèk yon jenn bèf gra. <verse eid="2SA 6:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2SA 6:14"/>Epi David t ap danse devan SENYÈ a avèk tout fòs li e David te <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6:14 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 19:5">Egz 19:5</ref></char></note>abiye avèk yon efòd fèt ak len. <verse eid="2SA 6:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2SA 6:15"/>Konsa, David avèk tout kay Israël la t ap mennen lach SENYÈ a monte avèk gwo kri lajwa e avèk son twonpèt.<verse eid="2SA 6:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="2SA 6:16"/>Li te vin rive ke lè lach SENYÈ a te antre nan vil David la, ke Mical, fi a Saül la, te gade nan fenèt la e te wè Wa David t ap vòltije danse devan SENYÈ a. Epi li te meprize li nan kè l. <verse eid="2SA 6:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2SA 6:17"/>Konsa, yo te mennen lach SENYÈ a e te mete li <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6:17 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1CH 15:1">I Kwo 15:1</ref></char></note>nan plas li anndan tant ke David te fè monte pou li a. Epi David te ofri ofrann brile avèk ofrann lapè devan SENYÈ a. <verse eid="2SA 6:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2SA 6:18"/>Lè David te fin ofri ofrann brile avèk ofrann lapè yo, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6:18 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1KI 8:14-15">I Wa 8:14-15</ref></char></note>li te beni pèp la nan non SENYÈ dèzame a. <verse eid="2SA 6:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="2SA 6:19"/>Anplis, li te fè separe bay a tout pèp la, yon gato pen, youn ak fwi dat e youn avèk rezen pou chak moun. Apre, tout pèp la te pati, chak moun nan pwòp kay yo.<verse eid="2SA 6:19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="2SA 6:20"/>Men lè David te retounen pou beni lakay li, Mical, fi a Saül la, te vin parèt pou rankontre David e te di: “Men kijan wa Israël la te onore pwòp tèt li jodi a! Li te dekouvri li menm jodi a nan zye a tout bòn kay ak sèvitè li yo kòm yon nonm ensanse san wont ta vin dekouvri kò li.”<verse eid="2SA 6:20"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="2SA 6:21"/>Konsa, David te di a Mical: “Devan SENYÈ a<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6:21 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1SA 13:14">I Sam 13:14</ref></char></note>ki te chwazi mwen an olye de papa ou e olye de tout kay li a, pou vin dezinye mwen chèf sou pèp SENYÈ a, sou Israël; pou sa, mwen va selebre devan SENYÈ a. <verse eid="2SA 6:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="2SA 6:22"/>Mwen va vin konte pa lòt moun kòm pi lejè ke sa, e mwen va vin enb nan pwòp zye m, men avèk bòn sila ke ou te pale yo; avèk yo, mwen va vin onore.”<verse eid="2SA 6:22"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="2SA 6:23"/>Mical, fi a Saül la, pa t fè pitit jis rive jou ke li te mouri an.<verse eid="2SA 6:23"/></para>
  <chapter eid="2SA 6"/>
  <chapter number="7" style="c" sid="2SA 7"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2SA 7:1"/>
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">7:1 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="1CH 17:1-27">I Kwo 17:1-27</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Alò, li te vin rive ke pandan wa a te rete lakay li a, e SENYÈ a te ba li repo tout kote sou lènmi li yo, <verse eid="2SA 7:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2SA 7:2"/>ke wa a te vin di a Nathan, pwofèt la: “Gade koulye a, Mwen menm rete nan <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:2 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2SA 5:11">II Sam 5:11</ref></char></note>yon kay ki fèt ak bwa sèd; men lach Bondye a <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:2 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 26:1">Egz 26:1</ref></char></note>rete anndan yon tant ki fèt ak rido.”<verse eid="2SA 7:2"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="2SA 7:3"/>Nathan te di a wa a: <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:3 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1KI 8:17-18">I Wa 8:17-18</ref></char></note>“Ale, fè tout sa ki nan tèt ou, paske SENYÈ a avèk ou.”<verse eid="2SA 7:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="2SA 7:4"/>Men nan menm nwit lan, pawòl SENYÈ a te vini a Nathan e te di: <verse eid="2SA 7:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2SA 7:5"/>“Ale e pale a sèvitè Mwen an, David: ‘Se konsa SENYÈ a pale, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:5 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1KI 5:3-4">I Wa 5:3-4</ref></char></note>“Èske se ou menm ki ta dwe bati yon kay pou Mwen ta vin rete ladann? <verse eid="2SA 7:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2SA 7:6"/>Paske Mwen pa t rete nan yon kay depi jou ke M te mennen fè sòti fis Israël yo an Égypte, jis rive jodi a. Men Mwen te konn deplase patou nan yon <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:6 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 40:18-34">Egz 40:18-34</ref></char></note>tant, menm yon tabènak. <verse eid="2SA 7:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2SA 7:7"/><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:7 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LEV 26:11-12">Lev 26:11-12</ref></char></note>Nenpòt kote ke M te ale avèk tout fis Israël yo, èske M te pale yon sèl pawòl avèk youn nan tribi a Israël yo, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:7 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2SA 5:2">II Sam 5:2</ref></char></note>ke M te kòmande pou fè bèje a pèp Mwen an, Israël, pou di: ‘Poukisa ou pa t bati pou Mwen yon kay ki fèt an sèd?’ <verse eid="2SA 7:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2SA 7:8"/>Alò pou sa, konsa ou va di a sèvitè Mwen an, David: ‘Konsa pale SENYÈ dèzame yo; <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:8 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1SA 16:11-12">I Sam 16:11-12</ref></char></note>Mwen te pran ou soti nan patiraj la, soti nan swiv mouton, pou devni yon chèf sou pèp Mwen an, Israël. <verse eid="2SA 7:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2SA 7:9"/>Mwen te toujou avèk ou nenpòt kote ou te ale, e Mwen <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:9 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 18:37-42">Sòm 18:37-42</ref></char></note>te retire lènmi ou yo soti devan ou. Konsa, Mwen va fè de ou yon gwo non, tankou non a gwo moun ki sou latè yo. <verse eid="2SA 7:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2SA 7:10"/>Mwen va, osi, etabli yon plas pou pèp Mwen an, Israël. Mwen <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:10 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 15:17">Egz 15:17</ref></char></note>va plante yo, pou yo kab viv nan pwòp plas yo e pou yo pa vin deranje ankò, ni pou mechan pa aflije yo ankò tankou lontan, <verse eid="2SA 7:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2SA 7:11"/>menm soti nan jou ke M te kòmande jij yo pou vin sou pèp Mwen an, Israël. Epi <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:11 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2SA 7:1">II Sam 7:1</ref></char></note>Mwen va ba ou repo sou tout lènmi ou yo. SENYÈ a va osi deklare a ou menm ke SENYÈ a va fè yon kay pou ou. <verse eid="2SA 7:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2SA 7:12"/>Lè jou ou yo fin pase e ou kouche avèk zansèt ou yo, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:12 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1KI 8:20">I Wa 8:20</ref></char></note>Mwen va fè vin leve desandan apre ou, ki va vin sòti nan ou menm e Mwen va etabli wayòm li. <verse eid="2SA 7:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2SA 7:13"/><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:13 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1KI 6:12">I Wa 6:12</ref></char></note>Li va bati yon kay pou non Mwen e Mwen va etabli twòn wayòm li a jis pou tout tan. <verse eid="2SA 7:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2SA 7:14"/><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:14 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 89:26-27">Sòm 89:26-27</ref></char></note>Mwen va yon papa a li menm e li va yon fis pou Mwen. <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:14 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1KI 11:34">I Wa 11:34</ref></char></note>Lè li fè inikite, Mwen va korije li avèk baton lòm nan, ak kout fwèt a fis a lòm yo. <verse eid="2SA 7:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2SA 7:15"/>Men mizerikòd Mwen p ap sòti sou li <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:15 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1SA 15:23">I Sam 15:23</ref></char></note>jan Mwen te retire li sou Saül, ke Mwen te fè vin retire devan ou an. <verse eid="2SA 7:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2SA 7:16"/><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:16 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2SA 7:13">II Sam 7:13</ref></char></note>Lakay ou ak wayòm ou va dire devan Mwen pou tout tan. Twòn ou an va etabli pou tout tan.”’” <verse eid="2SA 7:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2SA 7:17"/>An akò avèk tout pawòl sila yo, tout vizyon sila yo, Nathan te pale avèk David.<verse eid="2SA 7:17"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="2SA 7:18"/>Epi David, wa a, te antre chita devan SENYÈ a. Li te di: <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:18 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 3:11">Egz 3:11</ref></char></note>“Se kilès mwen ye, O Mèt BONDYE e se kisa lakay mwen ye, pou Ou te mennen mwen jis rive isit la? <verse eid="2SA 7:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="2SA 7:19"/>Epi anplis, sa te yon ti bagay nan zye Ou, O Mèt BONDYE, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:19 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2SA 7:11-16">II Sam 7:11-16</ref></char></note>paske Ou te pale osi pa lakay sèvitè Ou a, de avni byen lwen an. Epi <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:19 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 55:8-9">És 55:8-9</ref></char></note>sa se koutim a lòm, O Mèt BONDYE <verse eid="2SA 7:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="2SA 7:20"/>Ankò, ki bagay anplis David kab di Ou? Paske <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:20 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1SA 16:7">I Sam 16:7</ref></char></note>Ou konnen sèvitè Ou a, O Mèt, BONDYE! <verse eid="2SA 7:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="2SA 7:21"/><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:21 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1CH 17:19">I Kwo 17:19</ref></char></note>Pou koz a pawòl Ou e selon pwòp kè Ou, Ou te fè tout gwo bagay sila yo pou fè sèvitè Ou konnen. <verse eid="2SA 7:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="2SA 7:22"/>Pou rezon sa a, Ou gran, O Mèt BONDYE; paske <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:22 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 15:11">Egz 15:11</ref></char></note>nanpwen lòt tankou Ou menm e nanpwen lòt dye sof ke Ou menm, selon tout sa ke nou te tande avèk pwòp zòrèy nou. <verse eid="2SA 7:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="2SA 7:23"/>Epi ki lòt <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:23 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 4:32-38">Det 4:32-38</ref></char></note>nasyon sou latè ki tankou pèp Ou a, Israël, ke Bondye te ale peye ranson pou Li menm kòm yon pèp, e pou fè yon non pou Li menm; pou fè yon gran bagay pou Ou ak bagay mèvèy pou peyi Ou a, devan pèp ke Ou te peye ranson pou kont Ou sòti an Égypte la, nan mitan nasyon yo, avèk dye pa yo. <verse eid="2SA 7:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="2SA 7:24"/>Paske <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:24 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 32:6">Det 32:6</ref></char></note>Ou te etabli pou kont Ou, pèp Ou a, Israël kòm pèp Ou pou tout tan, e Ou menm, O SENYÈ a te devni Bondye pa yo.<verse eid="2SA 7:24"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="2SA 7:25"/>“Pou sa, koulye a, O SENYÈ Bondye, pawòl ke Ou te pale konsènan sèvitè Ou avèk lakay li a, konfime nèt e fè jan Ou te pale a. <verse eid="2SA 7:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="2SA 7:26"/><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:26 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 72:18-19">Sòm 72:18-19</ref></char></note>Kite non Ou kapab vin resevwa glwa jis pou tout tan, pou di: ‘SENYÈ dèzame a se Bondye sou Israël la; epi pou lakay a sèvitè Ou a kapab vin etabli devan Ou.’ <verse eid="2SA 7:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="2SA 7:27"/>Paske Ou menm, O SENYÈ, Bondye a Israël la, te fè yon revelasyon a sèvitè Ou a e te di: <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:27 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2SA 7:13">II Sam 7:13</ref></char></note> ‘Mwen va bati yon kay pou ou’. Pou sa, sèvitè Ou a te jwenn kouraj pou fè priyè sila a, a Ou menm.<verse eid="2SA 7:27"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="2SA 7:28"/>“Alò, O Senyè BONDYE, Ou se Bondye. <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:28 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 34:6">Egz 34:6</ref></char></note>Pawòl Ou se verite e Ou te pwomèt bon bagay sila a a sèvitè pa Ou a. <verse eid="2SA 7:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="2SA 7:29"/>Alò, pou sa, pou li kapab fè Ou plezi pou beni lakay sèvitè pa Ou a, pou li kapab kontinye pou tout tan devan Ou. Paske Ou menm, O Senyè BONDYE, te pale; epi <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:29 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NUM 6:24-26">Nonb 6:24-26</ref></char></note>avèk benediksyon pa Ou, pou lakay sèvitè Ou a kapab beni pou tout tan.”<verse eid="2SA 7:29"/></para>
  <chapter eid="2SA 7"/>
  <chapter number="8" style="c" sid="2SA 8"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2SA 8:1"/>
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">8:1 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="1CH 18">I Kwo 18</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Konsa, li te vin rive ke David te bat Filisten yo e te mete yo anba lòd. David te pran kontwòl a vil prensipal la soti nan men a Filisten yo. <verse eid="2SA 8:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2SA 8:2"/><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8:2 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NUM 24:17">Nonb 24:17</ref></char></note>Li te bat <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8:2 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1SA 22:3-4">I Sam 22:3-4</ref></char></note>Moab, li te mezire kaptif yo avèk yon lign. Konsa li te fè yo kouche atè, li te mezire longè de lign pou mete yo a lanmò, ak yon lign antye pou lèse yo viv. Epi Moabit yo te devni sèvitè a David e yo te pote peye taks obligatwa.<verse eid="2SA 8:2"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="2SA 8:3"/>Alò, David te bat Hadadézer, fis a Rehob la, wa a Tsoba, pandan <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8:3 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2SA 10:15-19">II Sam 10:15-19</ref></char></note>li te nan wout pou reprann kontwòl li nan Rivyè Euphrate la. <verse eid="2SA 8:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2SA 8:4"/>David te kaptire soti nan men li, mil-sèt-san chevalye avèk ven-mil sòlda a pye. <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8:4 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOS 11:6-9">Jos 11:6-9</ref></char></note>Li te koupe jarèt a cheval cha yo, men li te konsève kont nan yo pou rale yon santèn cha. <verse eid="2SA 8:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2SA 8:5"/>Lè <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8:5 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1KI 11:22-35">I Wa 11:22-35</ref></char></note>Siryen a Damas yo te vini pou bay sekou a Hadadézer, wa a Tsoba a, David te touye venn-de-mil Siryen. <verse eid="2SA 8:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2SA 8:6"/>Epi David te mete anplasman sòlda pami Siryen Damas yo. <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8:6 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2SA 8:2">II Sam 8:2</ref></char></note>Siryen yo te vin soumèt a David e te pote taks obligatwa. Epi SENYÈ a te ede David tout kote li te ale. <verse eid="2SA 8:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2SA 8:7"/>David te pran boukliye fèt an lò ki te pote pa sèvitè a Hadadézer yo e li te mennen yo Jérusalem. <verse eid="2SA 8:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2SA 8:8"/>Soti nan Béthach avèk Bérothaï, vil a Hadadézer yo, Wa David te pran yon gran kantite bwonz.<verse eid="2SA 8:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="2SA 8:9"/>Alò lè Thoï, wa a <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8:9 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1KI 8:65">I Wa 8:65</ref></char></note>Hamath la te tande ke David te bat tout lame a Hadadézer a. <verse eid="2SA 8:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2SA 8:10"/>Konsa, Thoï te voye Joram, fis li a kote Wa David pou salye li e fè li felisitasyon akoz li te goumen kont Hadadézer e te bat li. Paske Hadadézer t ap fè lagè avèk Thoï. Epi Joram te mennen avèk li bagay fèt an ajan, an lò, e an bwonz. <verse eid="2SA 8:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2SA 8:11"/>Wa David te <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8:11 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1KI 7:51">I Wa 7:51</ref></char></note>dedye sa yo osi a SENYÈ a, avèk ajan ak lò ke li te dedye soti nan tout nasyon ke Li te soumèt anba li menm yo: <verse eid="2SA 8:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2SA 8:12"/>Soti nan Syrie avèk <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8:12 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2SA 8:2">II Sam 8:2</ref></char></note>Moab, fis a Ammon yo, Filisten yo avèk Amalekit yo, ak piyaj ki te soti osi nan Hadadézer, fis a Thoï a, wa a Tsoba a.<verse eid="2SA 8:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="2SA 8:13"/>Konsa, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8:13 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2SA 7:9">II Sam 7:9</ref></char></note>David te vin fè yon non byen koni pou kont li, lè li te retounen soti nan touye dizui-mil Siryen nan <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8:13 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2KI 14:7">II Wa 14:7</ref></char></note>Vale Sèl la. <verse eid="2SA 8:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2SA 8:14"/>Li te etabli anplasman militè yo nan Édom. Nan tout Édom, li te fè anplasman militè e tout <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8:14 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 27:37-40">Jen 27:37-40</ref></char></note>Edomit yo te devni sèvitè a David. Konsa, SENYÈ a te ede David tout kote li te ale.<verse eid="2SA 8:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="2SA 8:15"/>David te renye sou tout Israël. Li te administre lajistis avèk ladwati pou tout pèp li a. <verse eid="2SA 8:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2SA 8:16"/><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8:16 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1CH 11:6">I Kwo 11:6</ref></char></note>Joab, fis Tseruja a te sou lame a e Josaphat, fis a Achilud la te <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8:16 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2KI 18:18-37">II Wa 18:18-37</ref></char></note>grefye a. <verse eid="2SA 8:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2SA 8:17"/><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8:17 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1CH 6:4-8">I Kwo 6:4-8</ref></char></note>Tsadok, fis a Achithub la avèk Achilémec, fis a Abithar a te prèt e Tseriah te sekretè. <verse eid="2SA 8:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2SA 8:18"/>Benaja, fis a Jehojada a te chèf sou <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8:18 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2SA 15:18">II Sam 15:18</ref></char></note>Keretyen avèk Peletyen yo; epi fis a David yo te chèf ministè leta yo.<verse eid="2SA 8:18"/></para>
  <chapter eid="2SA 8"/>
  <chapter number="9" style="c" sid="2SA 9"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2SA 9:1"/>Konsa, David te di: “Èske genyen toujou yon moun ki te rete pou lakay Saül, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:1 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1SA 20:14-42">I Sam 20:14-42</ref></char></note>pou m ta kab montre li favè pou koz Jonathan?” <verse eid="2SA 9:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2SA 9:2"/>Alò, te genyen yon sèvitè lakay Saül ki te rele Tsiba. Konsa yo te rele li kote David, e wa a te di li:</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2SA 9:2">“Èske ou se <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:2 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2SA 16:1-4">II Sam 16:1-4</ref></char></note>Tsiba?” Epi li te reponn: “Men sèvitè ou.”<verse eid="2SA 9:2"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="2SA 9:3"/>Wa a te di: “Èske pa gen moun toujou lakay Saül pou mwen ta kab montre favè Bondye?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2SA 9:3">Epi Tsiba te di a wa a: <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:3 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2SA 4:4">II Sam 4:4</ref></char></note>“Genyen toujou yon fis a Jonathan ki kokobe nan tou de pye li.”<verse eid="2SA 9:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="2SA 9:4"/>Konsa, wa a te di li: “Se kibò li ye?” Epi Tsiba te di a wa a: “Gade byen, li <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:4 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2SA 17:27-29">II Sam 17:27-29</ref></char></note>nan kay Makir a, fis Ammiel la nan Lodebar.”<verse eid="2SA 9:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="2SA 9:5"/>Epi Wa David te voye mennen li soti lakay Makir, fis a Ammiel la nan Lodebar. <verse eid="2SA 9:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2SA 9:6"/><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:6 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2SA 16:4">II Sam 16:4</ref></char></note>Méphiboscheth, fis a Jonathan an, fis a Saül, te vini a David. Li te tonbe sou figi li bese atè nèt. Epi David te di: “Méphiboscheth?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2SA 9:6">Epi li te di: “Men mwen, sèvitè ou!”<verse eid="2SA 9:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="2SA 9:7"/>David te di li: “Pa pè, paske anverite, mwen va montre ou ladousè pou koz papa ou, Jonathan, e mwen <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:7 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2SA 12:8">II Sam 12:8</ref> </char></note>va restore a ou menm tout tè a granpapa ou, Saül. Epi, konsa, ou va manje tout tan sou tab mwen.”<verse eid="2SA 9:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="2SA 9:8"/>Ankò, li te bese atè, e te di: “Se kisa ke sèvitè ou ye pou ou ta dwe gade <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:8 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2SA 15:9">II Sam 15:9</ref> </char></note>yon chen mouri tankou mwen?”<verse eid="2SA 9:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="2SA 9:9"/>Konsa, wa a te rele sèvitè a Saül la, Tsiba. Li te di li: <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:9 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2SA 16:4">II Sam 16:4</ref> </char></note>“Tout sa ki te pou Saül ak pou lakay li yo, mwen te vin bay yo a gran pitit a mèt ou a. <verse eid="2SA 9:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2SA 9:10"/>Ou menm avèk fis ou yo avèk sèvitè ou yo va kiltive tè a pou li, e ou va rekòlte jis pou pitit a mèt ou a kapab genyen manje. Sepandan, Méphiboscheth, gran fis a mèt ou a, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:10 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2SA 19:28">II Sam 19:28</ref></char></note>va manje tout tan sou tab mwen.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2SA 9:10">Alò, Tsiba te gen kenz fis ak ven sèvitè. <verse eid="2SA 9:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2SA 9:11"/>Epi Tsiba te di a wa a: “Selon <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:11 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2SA 16:1-4">II Sam 16:1-4</ref></char></note>tout sa ke mèt mwen, wa a, kòmande sèvitè li a, konsa sèvitè ou a va fè.” Konsa, Méphiboscheth te manje sou tab David la, tankou youn nan fis a wa yo. <verse eid="2SA 9:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2SA 9:12"/>Méphiboscheth te gen yon jèn fis ki te rele Mica. Epi tout sila ki te rete lakay Tsiba yo te sèvitè a Méphiboscheth. <verse eid="2SA 9:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2SA 9:13"/>Konsa, Méphiboscheth te rete Jérusalem, paske li te manje sou tab a wa a tout tan. Alò, li te kokobe nan toude pye li.<verse eid="2SA 9:13"/></para>
  <chapter eid="2SA 9"/>
  <chapter number="10" style="c" sid="2SA 10"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2SA 10:1"/>
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">10:1 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="1CH 19:1-19">I Kwo 19:1-19</ref>
      </char>
    </note> Li te vin rive apre ke wa a Amoreyen an te mouri e Hanun, fis li a, te devni wa nan plas li. <verse eid="2SA 10:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2SA 10:2"/>Konsa, David te di: “Mwen va montre bòn volonte mwen a Hanun, fis a <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:2 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1SA 11:1">I Sam 11:1</ref></char></note>Nachasch la, jis jan ke papa li te montre m bòn volonte a.” Konsa, David te voye kèk nan sèvitè li yo pou konsole li konsènan papa li. Konsa, sèvitè a David yo te rive nan peyi Amonit yo.<verse eid="2SA 10:2"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="2SA 10:3"/>Men prens a Amonit yo te di a Hanun, mèt pa yo a: “Èske ou kwè ke David ap onore papa ou akoz li te voye moun konsole ou? <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:3 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 42:9-16">Jen 42:9-16</ref></char></note>Èske David pa t pito voye sèvitè li yo kote ou pou fè ankèt vil la, pou espyone ak boulvèse li?”<verse eid="2SA 10:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="2SA 10:4"/>Konsa, Hanun te pran sèvitè a David yo, li te pase razwa sou mwatye bab yo, li te <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:4 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 20:4">És 20:4</ref></char></note>koupe manto yo jis rive nan mitan kote kwis yo, e li te voye yo ale. <verse eid="2SA 10:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2SA 10:5"/>Lè yo te pale David sa, li te voye rankontre yo, paske mesye yo te imilye anpil. Epi wa a te di: “Rete Jéricho jiskaske bab nou vin pouse e konsa, retounen.”<verse eid="2SA 10:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="2SA 10:6"/>Alò, lè fis a Ammon yo te wè ke <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:6 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 34:30">Jen 34:30</ref></char></note>yo te vin rayisab devan David, fis a Ammon yo te voye anplwaye Siryen yo Beth-Rehob e Siryen yo a Tsoba, ven-mil sòlda a pye, wa Macca avèk mil lòm e mesye a Tob yo avèk douz-mil lòm. <verse eid="2SA 10:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2SA 10:7"/>Lè David te tande sa, li te voye Joab avèk tout lame mesye vanyan yo. <verse eid="2SA 10:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2SA 10:8"/>Fis a Ammon yo te vin parèt. Yo te ranje yo nan chan batay la <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:8 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1CH 19:9">I Kwo 19:9</ref></char></note>devan antre vil la, pandan Siryen a Tsoba yo avèk Rehob, mesye a Tob yo avèk Maaca pou kont yo te nan chan an. <verse eid="2SA 10:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2SA 10:9"/>Alò, lè Joab te wè ke batay la te ranje kont li pa devan kon pa dèyè, li te seleksyone pami mesye pi chwazi an Israël yo pou te ranje yo kont Siryen yo. <verse eid="2SA 10:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2SA 10:10"/>Men rès nan pèp la, li te plase yo nan men Abischaï, frè li a e li te ranje yo kont fis Ammon yo. <verse eid="2SA 10:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2SA 10:11"/>Li te di: “Si Siryen yo twò fò pou mwen, alò, ou va ban m sekou; men si fis a Ammon yo twò fò pou ou, alò, mwen va vin ede ou. <verse eid="2SA 10:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2SA 10:12"/>Pran kouraj e kite nou parèt ak tout fòs nou pou koz a pèp nou an e pou vil Bondye pa nou an. <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:12 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1SA 3:18">I Sam 3:18</ref></char></note>Ke SENYÈ a kapab fè sa ki bon nan zye Li.” <verse eid="2SA 10:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2SA 10:13"/>Konsa, Joab avèk moun ki te avèk li yo te rapwoche nan batay la kont Siryen yo e <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:13 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1KI 20:13-21">I Wa 20:13-21</ref></char></note>yo te sove ale devan yo. <verse eid="2SA 10:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2SA 10:14"/>Lè fis a Ammon yo te wè ke Siryen yo te sove ale, yo osi te sove ale devan Abischaï e te antre nan vil la. Alò, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:14 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2SA 11:1">II Sam 11:1</ref></char></note>Joab te retounen sispann goumen kont fis a Ammon yo pou te rive kote Jérusalem.<verse eid="2SA 10:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="2SA 10:15"/>Lè Siryen yo te wè ke yo te fin bat pa Israël, yo te vin rasanble ansanm. <verse eid="2SA 10:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2SA 10:16"/><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:16 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2SA 8:3-8">II Sam 8:3-8</ref></char></note>Epi Hadarézer te voye chache Siryen ki te pi lwen Rivyè Euphrate la pou yo te vini Hélam. Schobac, Kòmandan a lame a Hadarézer a te sou tèt yo. <verse eid="2SA 10:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2SA 10:17"/>Alò, lè sa te pale a David, li te rasanble tout Israël ansanm e te travèse Jourdain an pou te rive vè Hélam. Konsa, Siryen yo te alinye yo pou rankontre David e te goumen kont li. <verse eid="2SA 10:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2SA 10:18"/>Men Siryen yo te sove ale devan Israël. David te touye <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:18 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1CH 19:18">I Kwo 19:18</ref></char></note>sèt-san mèt a cha Siryen, karant-mil chevalye e te frape fè desann Schobac, kòmandan lame pa yo a, e li te mouri la. <verse eid="2SA 10:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="2SA 10:19"/>Lè tout wa yo, sèvitè a Hadarézer yo te wè ke yo te pèdi devan Israël, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:19 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2SA 8:6">II Sam 8:6</ref></char></note>yo te fè lapè avèk Israël pou te sèvi yo. Konsa, Siryen yo te vin gen krent pou ede fis a Ammon yo ankò.<verse eid="2SA 10:19"/></para>
  <chapter eid="2SA 10"/>
  <chapter number="11" style="c" sid="2SA 11"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2SA 11:1"/>
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">11:1 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="1CH 20:1">I Kwo 20:1</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Alò, li te fèt pandan prentan an, lè ke wa yo konn sòti batay, ke David te voye Joab, ansanm avèk sèvitè li yo ak tout Israël. Yo te detwi fis a Ammon yo e yo te fè syèj nan Rabba, men David te rete Jérusalem. <verse eid="2SA 11:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2SA 11:2"/>Epi lè lannwit te vin rive, David te leve nan kabann li. Li te mache antoure <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:2 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 24:17">Mat 24:17</ref></char></note>twati kay wa a, soti nan twati a, li te wè yon fanm ki t ap benyen. Epi fanm nan te byen bèl nan aparans li. <verse eid="2SA 11:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2SA 11:3"/>Konsa, David te voye mande konsèy sou fanm sa a. Epi youn te di: “Èske sa se pa Bath-Schéba, fis a Éliam nan, fanm a Urie a, Itit la?”<verse eid="2SA 11:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="2SA 11:4"/>David te voye mesaje pran li. Lè li te parèt kote li, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:4 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JAS 1:14-15">Jc 1:14-15</ref></char></note>li te kouche avèk li ( paske li te fin pirifye tèt li de salte a). Epi li te retounen lakay li. <verse eid="2SA 11:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2SA 11:5"/>Fanm nan te vin ansent. Li te voye di David: <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:5 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LEV 20:10">Lev 20:10</ref></char></note>“Mwen ansent.”<verse eid="2SA 11:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="2SA 11:6"/>Konsa, David te voye kote Joab. Li te di: “Voye ban mwen Urie, Itit la.” Konsa, Joab te voye Urie kote David. <verse eid="2SA 11:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2SA 11:7"/>Lè Urie te vin kote li, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:7 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 37:14">Jen 37:14</ref></char></note>David te mande pa sikonstans a Joab avèk tout pèp la ak jan lagè a te mache a. <verse eid="2SA 11:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2SA 11:8"/>Alò, David te di a Urie: “Desann lakay ou pou <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:8 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 43:24">Jen 43:24</ref></char></note>lave pye ou.” Epi Urie te desann sòti lakay wa, a e yon kado soti nan men wa a te voye ba li. <verse eid="2SA 11:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2SA 11:9"/>Men Urie te dòmi <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:9 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1KI 14:27-28">I Wa 14:27-28</ref></char></note>kote pòt lakay wa a avèk tout sèvitè a mèt li yo. Li pa t desann lakay li. <verse eid="2SA 11:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2SA 11:10"/>Alò, lè yo te di David: “Urie pa t desann lakay li,” David te di a Urie: “Èske ou pa t fenk fin fè yon vwayaj? Poukisa konsa ou pa t desann lakay ou?”<verse eid="2SA 11:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="2SA 11:11"/>Urie te di a David: “Lach la menm avèk Israël avèk Juda ap rete nan tant yo; epi mèt mwen, Joab avèk sèvitè a mèt mwen yo ap fè kan nan chan louvri. Konsa, kijan mwen kapab ale lakay mwen pou manje bwè e kouche avèk madanm mwen? Pa lavi ou ak lavi nanm ou menm, mwen p ap fè bagay sa a.”<verse eid="2SA 11:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="2SA 11:12"/>Alò, David te di a Urie: <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:12 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOB 20:12-14">Job 20:12-14</ref> </char></note>“Rete isit la jodi a tou e demen mwen va kite ou ale.” Konsa, Urie te rete Jérusalem nan jou sa a ak pwochen jou a. <verse eid="2SA 11:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2SA 11:13"/>Alò David te rele li, li te manje bwè devan li e li te <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:13 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PRO 20:1">Pwov 20:1</ref> </char></note>fè li sou. Epi nan aswè, li te sòti pou kouche sou kabann li avèk sèvitè a mèt li yo, men li pa t desann lakay li. <verse eid="2SA 11:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2SA 11:14"/>Alò, nan maten, David <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:14 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1KI 21:8-10">I Wa 21:8-10</ref></char></note>te ekri yon lèt a Joab pou te voye li nan men Urie. <verse eid="2SA 11:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2SA 11:15"/>Li te ekri nan lèt la, e te di: “Mete Urie pa devan nan chan kote batay la pi rèd la e retounen kite li, pou l kab <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:15 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2SA 12:9">II Sam 12:9</ref></char></note> tonbe mouri.”<verse eid="2SA 11:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="2SA 11:16"/>Konsa, se te pandan Joab t ap veye vil la, ke li te mete Urie nan plas kote li te konnen lènmi an te gen mesye vanyan yo. <verse eid="2SA 11:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2SA 11:17"/>Mesye vil yo te sòti goumen kont Joab, kèk nan moun pami sèvitè a David yo te tonbe. Epi <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:17 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2SA 1:21">II Sam 1:21</ref></char></note>Urie, Itit la te mouri tou. <verse eid="2SA 11:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2SA 11:18"/>Alò, Joab te voye bay rapò a David selon tout evenman lagè a. <verse eid="2SA 11:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="2SA 11:19"/>Li te kòmande mesaje a, e te di: “Lè ou fin pale tout afè lagè yo a wa a, <verse eid="2SA 11:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="2SA 11:20"/>epi li vin rive ke kòlè leve nan wa a e li di ou: ‘Poukisa ou te pwoche pre vil la konsa pou goumen? Èske ou pa t konnen ke yo ta tire soti sou miray la? <verse eid="2SA 11:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="2SA 11:21"/>Se kilès ki te <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:21 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JDG 9:50-54">Jij 9:50-54</ref></char></note>frape Abimélec, fis a Jerubbéscheth la? Èske se pa yon fanm ki te jete yon wòch moulen sou li soti nan miray ki fè l mouri Thébets la? Poukisa ou te pwoche pre miray la?’ epi ou va di: ‘Sèvitè ou a Urie, Itit la, te mouri tou.’”<verse eid="2SA 11:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="2SA 11:22"/>Konsa, mesaje a te pati pou te vin bay rapò a David, de tout sa ke Joab te voye li pale yo. <verse eid="2SA 11:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="2SA 11:23"/>Mesaje a te di a David: “Mesye yo te genyen sou nou e te sòti kont nou nan chan an; men nou te peze yo rèd jis rive nan antre pòtay la. <verse eid="2SA 11:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="2SA 11:24"/>Anplis, mesye banza yo te tire sou sèvitè ou yo soti nan miray la. Konsa, kèk nan sèvitè ou yo mouri, e sèvitè ou a, Urie, Etyen an mouri osi.”<verse eid="2SA 11:24"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="2SA 11:25"/>Alò David te di a mesaje a: “Konsa ou va pale Joab, ‘Pa kite bagay sa a fè ou mal, paske nepe a devore youn menm jan ke yon lòt. Fè batay ou kont vil la vin pi rèd pou boulvèse li’. Se konsa pou ankouraje li.”<verse eid="2SA 11:25"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="2SA 11:26"/>Alò, lè madanm a Urie te tande ke Urie, mari li a, te mouri, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:26 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 34:8">Det 34:8</ref></char></note>li te kriye pou mari li. <verse eid="2SA 11:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="2SA 11:27"/>Lè tan kriye a te fini, David te voye mennen li lakay li, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:27 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2SA 12:9">II Sam 12:9</ref></char></note>li te devni madanm li, e li te fè yon fis pou li. Men <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:27 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 51:4-5">Sòm 51:4-5</ref></char></note>bagay ke David te fè a te mal nan zye SENYÈ a.<verse eid="2SA 11:27"/></para>
  <chapter eid="2SA 11"/>
  <chapter number="12" style="c" sid="2SA 12"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2SA 12:1"/>Alò, SENYÈ a te voye <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:1 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2SA 7:2-17">II Sam 7:2-17</ref></char></note>Nathan kote David. Li te vin kote li e te di: “Te genyen de mesye nan yon vil, youn te rich e lòt la te pòv. <verse eid="2SA 12:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2SA 12:2"/>Nonm rich la te gen anpil bann mouton avèk twoupo, <verse eid="2SA 12:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2SA 12:3"/>men pòv la, pa t gen anyen sof ke <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:3 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2SA 11:3">II Sam 11:3</ref></char></note>yon sèl ti mouton femèl, ke li te achte e li te nouri. Konsa, li te vin gran ansanm avèk li menm avèk pitit li yo. Li ta manje nan pen li, bwè nan tas li, kouche sou vant li e se te tankou yon fi pou li. <verse eid="2SA 12:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2SA 12:4"/>Alò, yon vwayajè te vin kote nonm rich la e li pa t dakò retire nan pwòp bann mouton ak twoupo pa li yo, pou fè pwovizyon pou li. Sof ke sa, li te pran mouton femèl a pòv sila pou prepare pou nonm ki te rive kote li a.”<verse eid="2SA 12:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="2SA 12:5"/>Alò, kòlè a David te brile fò kont nonm nan, e li te di a Nathan: “Jan SENYÈ a viv la, anverite, mesye ki te fè sa a <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:5 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1SA 26:16">I Sam 26:16</ref></char></note>merite lanmò. <verse eid="2SA 12:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2SA 12:6"/>Fòk li bay rekonpans pou ti mouton an <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:6 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 22:1">Egz 22:1</ref></char></note>kat fwa; paske li te fè bagay sa a san pitye.”<verse eid="2SA 12:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="2SA 12:7"/>Alò, Nathan te di David: <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:7 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1KI 20:42">I Wa 20:42</ref></char></note>“Mesye a se ou menm! Konsa di SENYÈ a, Bondye a Israël la: <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:7 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1SA 16:3">I Sam 16:3</ref></char></note>‘Se Mwen ki te onksyone ou kòm wa sou Israël e se mwen ki te delivre ou soti nan men a Saül. <verse eid="2SA 12:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2SA 12:8"/>Se Mwen menm tou ki te ba ou <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:8 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2SA 9:7">II Sam 9:7</ref></char></note>lakay mèt ou a ak madanm a mèt ou yo pou ou ta pran swen e Mwen te ba ou lakay Israël la avèk Juda. Epi si sa te twò piti, mwen t ap menm ajoute ba ou ankò anpil lòt bagay tankou sila yo! <verse eid="2SA 12:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2SA 12:9"/>Poukisa ou <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:9 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1SA 15:23-26">I Sam 15:23-26</ref></char></note>te meprize pawòl SENYÈ a e fè mal devan zye Li? Ou te fè tonbe Urie, Itit la avèk nepe, ou te pran madanm li kòm madanm ou e ou te touye li avèk nepe a fis Ammon yo. <verse eid="2SA 12:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2SA 12:10"/>Koulye a, pou sa, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:10 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2SA 13:28">II Sam 13:28</ref></char></note>nepe p ap janm kite lakay ou, akoz ou te meprize Mwen e te pran madanm a Urie, Itit la pou devni madanm ou.’<verse eid="2SA 12:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="2SA 12:11"/>“Konsa pale SENYÈ a: ‘Gade byen, Mwen va fè leve mal kont ou soti nan pwòp kay ou. <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:11 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 28:30">Det 28:30</ref></char></note>Mwen va menm pran madanm ou yo devan zye ou e bay a zanmi parèy ou e li va kouche avèk madanm ou yo gwo lajounen. <verse eid="2SA 12:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2SA 12:12"/>Anverite, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:12 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2SA 11:4-15">II Sam 11:4-15</ref></char></note>ou te fè l an sekrè; men <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:12 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2SA 16:22">II Sam 16:22</ref></char></note>Mwen va fè bagay sa a devan tout Israël ak anba solèy la.’”<verse eid="2SA 12:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="2SA 12:13"/>Epi David te di a Nathan: <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:13 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1SA 15:24-30">I Sam 15:24-30</ref></char></note>“Mwen te peche kont SENYÈ a.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2SA 12:13">Nathan te di a David: “SENYÈ a, anplis, te retire peche ou; ou p ap mouri. <verse eid="2SA 12:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2SA 12:14"/>Malgre sa, akoz zak sa a, ke ou te bay okazyon a lènmi a SENYÈ yo pou fè blasfèm, pitit la ki va fèt a ou menm nan va anverite, mouri.” <verse eid="2SA 12:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2SA 12:15"/>Konsa, Nathan te ale lakay li.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2SA 12:15">Epi SENYÈ a te frape pitit ke vèv Urie te fè pou David la, jiskaske li te vin byen malad. <verse eid="2SA 12:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2SA 12:16"/>Pou sa, David te mande Bondye pou pitit la. Li te <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:16 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NEH 4:1">Né 4:1</ref></char></note>fè jèn e li te ale <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:16 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2SA 13:31">II Sam 13:31</ref></char></note>kouche tout nwit lan atè. <verse eid="2SA 12:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2SA 12:17"/><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:17 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 24:2">Jen 24:2</ref></char></note>Ansyen lakay li yo te kanpe akote li pou leve li atè a, men li pa t dakò e li pa t manje avèk yo. <verse eid="2SA 12:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2SA 12:18"/>Konsa, li te vin rive nan setyèm jou a ke pitit la te vin mouri. Epi sèvitè a David yo te krent pou di l ke pitit la te mouri, paske yo te di: “Gade byen, pandan pitit la te vivan an, nou te pale avèk li e li pa t tande vwa nou. Konsa, kòman nou kab di li ke pitit la mouri, paske li kab fè tèt li mal?”<verse eid="2SA 12:18"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="2SA 12:19"/>Men lè David te wè ke sèvitè li yo t ap pale an kachèt ansanm, David te apèsi ke pitit la te mouri. Pou sa, David te di a sèvitè li yo: “Èske pitit la mouri?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2SA 12:19">Yo te di: “Li mouri.”<verse eid="2SA 12:19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="2SA 12:20"/>Konsa, David te leve soti atè a. <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:20 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="RUT 3:3">Rt 3:3</ref></char></note>Li te lave tèt li, li te onksyone kò l, e li te chanje rad li. Konsa, li te antre lakay SENYÈ a pou te adore. Epi li te vin nan pwòp kay li. Lè li te mande, yo te mete manje devan li pou l te manje. <verse eid="2SA 12:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="2SA 12:21"/>Sèvitè li yo te di li: “Se ki bagay sa ou te fè a? Pandan pitit la te vivan an, ou te fè jèn e te kriye, men lè pitit la te mouri, ou te leve pou te manje.”<verse eid="2SA 12:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="2SA 12:22"/>Li te di: “Pandan pitit la te vivan an, mwen te fè jèn e te kriye; paske mwen te di: <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:22 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JON 3:9">Jon 3:9</ref></char></note>‘Kilès ki te kab konnen, SENYÈ a ta kab petèt fè m gras, pou pitit la te kab viv.’ <verse eid="2SA 12:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="2SA 12:23"/>Men koulye a, li fin mouri. Poukisa mwen ta fè jèn? Èske mwen kapab fè l retounen ankò? Mwen va ale jwenn li, men <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:23 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOB 7:8-10">Job 7:8-10</ref></char></note>li p ap retounen kote mwen.”<verse eid="2SA 12:23"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="2SA 12:24"/>Konsa, David te rekonfòte madanm li, Bath-Schéba. Li te antre nan li e li te kouche avèk li. Li te bay nesans a yon fis e li <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:24 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1CH 22:9">I Kwo 22:9</ref></char></note>te rele li Salomon. Alò, SENYÈ a te renmen li. <verse eid="2SA 12:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="2SA 12:25"/>Li te voye nouvèl la pa Nathan, pwofèt la e Nathan te rele li Jedidja pou koz SENYÈ a.<verse eid="2SA 12:25"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="2SA 12:26"/>
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">12:26 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="1CH 20:1-3">I Kwo 20:1-3</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Alò, Joab te goumen kont Rabba, moun nan fis Ammon yo, e li te kaptire vil wayal la. <verse eid="2SA 12:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="2SA 12:27"/>Joab te voye mesaje yo a David. Li te di: “Mwen te goumen kont Rabba e te kaptire vil dlo yo. <verse eid="2SA 12:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="2SA 12:28"/>Pou sa, rasanble rès pèp la, e fè kan kont vil la oswa, ma pran pou kont mwen pou l gen non pa m nan.”<verse eid="2SA 12:28"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="2SA 12:29"/>Konsa, David te rasanble tout pèp la pou te ale Rabba. Li te goumen kont li e te kaptire li. <verse eid="2SA 12:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="2SA 12:30"/><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:30 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1CH 20:2">I Kwo 20:2</ref></char></note>Li te pran kouwòn a wa pa yo a soti nan tèt li. Li te peze yon talan (anviwon trann-kat kilo) an lò, e ladann yon kantite pyè presye. Yo te mete li sou tèt David. Epi li te mennen piyaj la deyò vil la an gran kantite. <verse eid="2SA 12:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="2SA 12:31"/>Anplis, li te mennen moun ki te ladann l deyò. Li te <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:31 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1CH 20:3">I Kwo 20:3</ref></char></note>fè yo travay ak si, avèk pikwa, ak rach an fè, e te fè yo travay nan fou brik. Se konsa li te fè a tout vil ki te pou fis Ammon yo. Epi David avèk tout moun li yo te retounen Jérusalem.<verse eid="2SA 12:31"/></para>
  <chapter eid="2SA 12"/>
  <chapter number="13" style="c" sid="2SA 13"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2SA 13:1"/>Pi tà, apre sa <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13:1 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2SA 3:2-3">II Sam 3:2-3</ref></char></note> Absalom, fis a David la te gen yon sè byen bèl ki te rele Tamar e Amnon, fis a David la te renmen li. <verse eid="2SA 13:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2SA 13:2"/>Amnon te tèlman fristre akoz sè li, Tamar, ke sa te fè li vin malad, paske li te vyèj e li te sanble difisil pou Amnon fè yon bagay ak li. <verse eid="2SA 13:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2SA 13:3"/>Men Amnon te gen yon zanmi ki te rele Jonadab, fis a <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13:3 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1SA 16:9">I Sam 16:9</ref></char></note>Schimea a, frè David. Epi Jonadab te yon nonm byen rize. <verse eid="2SA 13:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2SA 13:4"/>Li te di li: “O fis a wa a, poukisa ou deprime maten apre maten konsa? Èske ou p ap di m sa?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2SA 13:4">Epi Amnon te di li: “Mwen tonbe nan renmen avèk Tamar, sè a frè m nan, Absalom.”<verse eid="2SA 13:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="2SA 13:5"/>Alò, Jonadab te di li: “Kouche sou kabann ou e fè kòmsi ou malad. Lè papa ou vin wè ou, di li: ‘Souple, kite sè m nan, Tamar vin ban m manje. Kite li prepare manje a devan zye m, pou mwen kapab wè li e manje manje a soti nan men li.’”<verse eid="2SA 13:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="2SA 13:6"/>Konsa, Amnon te kouche e te fè tankou li te malad. Lè wa a te vin wè li, Amnon te di a wa a: “Souple, kite sè m nan, Tamar vini <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13:6 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 18:6">Jen 18:6</ref> </char></note>fè kèk gato devan zye m, pou m kab manje nan men li.”<verse eid="2SA 13:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="2SA 13:7"/>Alò, David te voye lakay pou Tamar. Li te di: “Ale koulye a lakay frè ou a, Amnon e prepare manje pou li.” <verse eid="2SA 13:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2SA 13:8"/>Konsa, Tamar te ale lakay Amnon pandan li te kouche a. Li te pran boul pen an, li te fwote l, li te fè gato devan zye li e te kwit gato yo. <verse eid="2SA 13:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2SA 13:9"/>Li te pran chodyè a pou te lonje mete yo devan li, men li te refize manje. Epi Amnon te di: <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13:9 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 45:1">Jen 45:1</ref></char></note>“Fè tout moun sòti devan m.” Konsa tout moun te sòti devan li. <verse eid="2SA 13:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2SA 13:10"/>Alò, Amnon te di a Tamar: “Mennen manje a nan chanm dòmi mwen an, pou m kab manje li nan men ou.” Konsa, Tamar te pran gato ke li te fè yo e te mennen yo antre nan chanm dòmi kote frè li a, Amnon. <verse eid="2SA 13:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2SA 13:11"/>Lè li te mennen kote li pou manje, Amnon te <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13:11 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 39:12">Jen 39:12</ref></char></note>kenbe li e te di li: “Vin kouche avè m, sè mwen.”<verse eid="2SA 13:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="2SA 13:12"/>Men li te reponn li: “Non, frè mwen, pa vyole mwen! Paske bagay konsa yo pa fèt an Israël. Pa fè dega sila a! <verse eid="2SA 13:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2SA 13:13"/>Pou mwen menm, kote mwen ta kab livre a wont sa a? Epi pou ou menm, ou va tankou yon moun ranpli avèk foli an Israël. Pou sa, souple, pale avèk wa a, paske <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13:13 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 20:12">Jen 20:12</ref></char></note>li p ap anpeche ou pran m.”<verse eid="2SA 13:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="2SA 13:14"/>Sepandan, li pa t koute li. <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13:14 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LEV 18:9">Lev 18:9</ref></char></note>Akoz Amnon te pi fò pase li, li te vyole li, e te kouche avèk li. <verse eid="2SA 13:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2SA 13:15"/>Epi Amnon te vin rayi li avèk yon trè gwo rayisman. Rayisman avèk sila li te rayi li a te pi gran pase renmen avèk sila li te renmen li an. Amnon te di li: “Leve, sòti!”<verse eid="2SA 13:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="2SA 13:16"/>Men li te di a li: “Non, paske mal sa a ke w ap fè nan voye m ale a pi mal pase lòt ke ou te fè m nan!”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2SA 13:16">Men li pa t koute li. <verse eid="2SA 13:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2SA 13:17"/>Alò, li te rele jennonm ki t ap okipe li a, e te di: “Koulye a, jete fanm sa deyò prezans mwen e kadnase pòt la dèyè l.”<verse eid="2SA 13:17"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="2SA 13:18"/>Alò, li te genyen yon <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13:18 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 37:3-23">Jen 37:3-23</ref></char></note>rad avèk manch long, paske se te konsa fi vyèj a wa yo te konn abiye an manto. Epi sèvitè l te mennen Tamar deyò e te kadnase pòt la dèyè li. <verse eid="2SA 13:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="2SA 13:19"/><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13:19 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EST 4:1">Est 4:1</ref></char></note>Tamar te mete sann yo sou tèt li e te <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13:19 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2SA 1:11">II Sam 1:11</ref></char></note>chire manch long yo nan rad sou li a. Li te mete men li sou tèt li, li te sòti e t ap kriye fò pandan li prale a. <verse eid="2SA 13:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="2SA 13:20"/>Alò, Absalom, frè li a te di li: “Èske Amnon, frè ou a te avèk ou? Men koulye a, rete an silans, sè mwen, li se frè ou. Pa mete afè sa a sou kè.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2SA 13:20">Pou sa, Tamar te rete e te dezole lakay Absalom, frè li a. <verse eid="2SA 13:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="2SA 13:21"/>Alò, lè David te tande tout koze sila yo, li te vin byen fache. <verse eid="2SA 13:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="2SA 13:22"/>Men Absalom pa t pale ak Amnon anyen, ni bon, ni mal; paske <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13:22 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LEV 19:17">Lev 19:17</ref></char></note>Absalom te rayi Amnon akoz li te vyole sè li a, Tamar.<verse eid="2SA 13:22"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="2SA 13:23"/>Alò, li te vin rive apre dezan nèt ke Absalom <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13:23 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1SA 25:7">I Sam 25:7</ref></char></note>te gen moun pou taye lenn mouton Baal-Hatsor ki toupre Ephraïm, e Absalom te envite tout fis a wa yo. <verse eid="2SA 13:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="2SA 13:24"/>Absalom te vin kote wa a e te di: “Gade byen, sèvitè ou a genyen moun k ap taye lenn mouton. Souple, kite wa a avèk sèvitè li yo ale avèk sèvitè ou.”<verse eid="2SA 13:24"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="2SA 13:25"/>Men wa a te di a Absalom: “Non, fis mwen, se pa tout moun ki pou ale, paske nou va yon fado pou ou.” Malgre li te ankouraje li, li pa t ale, men li te beni li.<verse eid="2SA 13:25"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="2SA 13:26"/>Alò, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13:26 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2SA 3:27">II Sam 3:27</ref></char></note>Absalom te di: “Si se pa sa, souple kite frè m nan, Amnon, ale avèk nou.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2SA 13:26">Epi wa a te di li: “Poukisa li dwe ale avèk ou?”<verse eid="2SA 13:26"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="2SA 13:27"/>Men lè Absalom te ankouraje li, li te kite Amnon avèk tout fis a wa yo ale avèk li. <verse eid="2SA 13:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="2SA 13:28"/>Absalom te kòmande sèvitè li yo. Li te di: “Gade koulye a, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13:28 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JDG 19:6-22">Jij 19:6-22</ref></char></note>lè kè Amnon kontan avèk diven an, lè mwen di nou: ‘Frape Amnon’, alò, mete li a lanmò. Pa pè! Èske se pa mwen menm ki kòmande nou? Pran kouraj e rete brav.”<verse eid="2SA 13:28"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="2SA 13:29"/>Sèvitè a Absalom yo te fè Amnon jis jan ke <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13:29 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2SA 18:9">II Sam 18:9</ref></char></note>Absalom te kòmande a. Epi tout fis a wa yo te leve monte milèt pa yo e te sove ale.<verse eid="2SA 13:29"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="2SA 13:30"/>Alò, se te pandan ke yo te nan wout la yon rapò te rive kote David ki te di: “Absalom te frape fè tonbe tout fis a wa yo e nanpwen youn nan yo ki te rete.”<verse eid="2SA 13:30"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="2SA 13:31"/>Konsa, wa a te leve. Li <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13:31 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2SA 1:11">II Sam 1:11</ref></char></note>te chire rad li e te kouche atè, epi tout sèvitè li yo te kanpe akote avèk rad yo chire. <verse eid="2SA 13:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="2SA 13:32"/><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13:32 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2SA 13:3-5">II Sam 13:3-5</ref></char></note>Jonadab, fis a Schimea a, frè David la, te reponn: “Pa kite mèt mwen an sipoze ke yo te mete a lanmò tout jennonm yo, fis a wa yo. Se sèl Ammon ki mouri. Se sa ki te entansyon Absalom. Afè sa a te vin detèmine depi jou ke li te vyole sè li a, Tamar. <verse eid="2SA 13:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="2SA 13:33"/>Alò pou sa, pa kite mèt mwen, wa a, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13:33 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2SA 19:19">II Sam 19:19</ref></char></note>pran rapò sa a a kè, ki vle di ‘tout fis a wa yo mouri’, paske se sèl Amnon ki mouri.” <verse eid="2SA 13:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="2SA 13:34"/>Alò, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13:34 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2SA 13:37-38">II Sam 13:37-38</ref></char></note>Absalom te sove ale deja. Epi jennonm ki te gadyen an te leve zye li gade e vwala, anpil moun t ap vini soti nan wout la dèyè li akote baz mòn nan. <verse eid="2SA 13:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="2SA 13:35"/>Jonadab te di a wa a: “Gade byen, men fis a wa yo gen tan vini! Menm jan avèk pawòl sèvitè ou a, se konsa sa fèt.” <verse eid="2SA 13:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="2SA 13:36"/>Depi li fin pale a, vwala, fis a wa yo te vini e te leve vwa yo pou te kriye. Konsa, wa la menm, avèk tout sèvitè li yo te kriye byen anmè.<verse eid="2SA 13:36"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="2SA 13:37"/>Men Absalom te sove ale e te ale kote <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13:37 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2SA 3:3">II Sam 3:3</ref></char></note>Talmaï, fis a Ammihur a, wa a <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13:37 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2SA 14:23-32">II Sam 14:23-32</ref></char></note>Gueschur a. David te kriye fè lamantasyon pou fis li a chak jou. <verse eid="2SA 13:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="2SA 13:38"/><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13:38 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2SA 13:34">II Sam 13:34</ref></char></note>Konsa, Absalom te sove ale nan Gueschur e te rete la, pandan twazan. <verse eid="2SA 13:38"/><verse number="39" style="v" sid="2SA 13:39"/>Wa David te byen vle ale kote Absalom, paske <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13:39 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2SA 12:19-23">II Sam 12:19-23</ref></char></note>li te pran rekonfò konsènan Amnon, akoz li te mouri.<verse eid="2SA 13:39"/></para>
  <chapter eid="2SA 13"/>
  <chapter number="14" style="c" sid="2SA 14"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2SA 14:1"/>Alò Joab, fis a <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">14:1 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2SA 13:39">II Sam 13:39</ref></char></note>Tseruja a te vin apèsi ke kè David te apiye anvè Absalom. <verse eid="2SA 14:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2SA 14:2"/>Pou sa, Joab te voye kote <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">14:2 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2SA 23:26">II Sam 23:26</ref></char></note>Tekoa e te fè rive yon fanm avèk sajès soti la. Li te di li: “Souple, fè kòmsi se yon moun ki andèy. Mete sou ou vètman andèy depi koulye a. Pa onksyone ou avèk lwil, men fè tankou yon fanm ki te deja andèy pou mò a soti anpil jou. <verse eid="2SA 14:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2SA 14:3"/>Apre, ale kote wa a, e pale avèk li konsa”. Epi Joab te mete <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">14:3 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2SA 14:19">II Sam 14:19</ref></char></note>pawòl nan bouch li pou pale.<verse eid="2SA 14:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="2SA 14:4"/>Alò, lè fanm a Tekoa a te pale a wa a, li te vin tonbe sou figi li e te <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">14:4 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1SA 25:23">I Sam 25:23</ref></char></note>kouche atè nèt, Li te di: “Sekou, O wa.”<verse eid="2SA 14:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="2SA 14:5"/>Wa a te di li: “Ki pwoblèm ou?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2SA 14:5">Li te reponn: “Anverite, se yon vèv ke mwen ye, paske mari mwen mouri. <verse eid="2SA 14:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2SA 14:6"/>Sèvant ou an gen de fis. Men yo de te goumen nan chan an e yo pa t gen pèsòn pou separe yo. Konsa, youn te frape lòt e te touye li. <verse eid="2SA 14:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2SA 14:7"/>Koulye a, gade byen, tout fanmi an gen tan leve kont sèvant ou an. Y ap mande m lonje ba yo sila ki te frape frè li a, pou nou kab mete li a lanmò pou lavi a frè l ke li te touye a, e <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">14:7 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 21:38">Mat 21:38</ref></char></note> vin detwi eritye a tou. Konsa, yo va etenn sèl chabon limen ki rete a, pou kite mari mwen san non, san rès sou fas tè a.”<verse eid="2SA 14:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="2SA 14:8"/>Alò, wa a te di a fanm nan: “Ale lakay ou e mwen va bay lòd pou ou menm.”<verse eid="2SA 14:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="2SA 14:9"/>Fanm Tekoa a te di wa a: “O mèt mwen, wa a, inikite a sou mwen avèk lakay papa m; men kite <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">14:9 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1KI 2:33">I Wa 2:33</ref></char></note>wa a avèk twòn li an pa koupab.”<verse eid="2SA 14:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="2SA 14:10"/>Konsa, wa a te di: “Nenpòt moun ki pale avè w, mennen li bò kote m e li p ap touche ou ankò.”<verse eid="2SA 14:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="2SA 14:11"/>Alò, li te di: “Souple, kite wa a sonje SENYÈ a, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">14:11 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NUM 35:19-21">Nonb 35:19-21</ref></char></note>pou vanjè san an pa kontinye detwi, sof ke sa, y ap detwi fis mwen an.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2SA 14:11">Epi li te di: “Jan SENYÈ a viv la, nanpwen menm yon grenn cheve a fis ou a k ap tonbe atè.”<verse eid="2SA 14:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="2SA 14:12"/>Alò, fanm nan te di: “Souple kite sèvant ou an pale yon mo ak mèt mwen, wa a.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2SA 14:12">Li te di: “Pale”. <verse eid="2SA 14:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2SA 14:13"/>Fanm nan te di: “Alò, poukisa ou te fè yon move plan konsa kont pèp Bondye a? Paske nan pale pawòl sila a, se wa a ki koupab, kòmsi wa a pa mennen retounen <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">14:13 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2SA 13:37-38">II Sam 13:37-38</ref></char></note>sila li te ekzile a. <verse eid="2SA 14:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2SA 14:14"/>Paske anverite, nou va mouri. Se tankou dlo ki gaspiye atè e ki p ap kab ranmase ankò. <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">14:14 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NUM 35:15-28">Nonb 35:15-28</ref></char></note>Men Bondye pa retire lavi, men toujou fè plan pou sila ki ekzile a pa vin jete deyò nèt de Li menm.” <verse eid="2SA 14:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2SA 14:15"/>Alò, rezon pou sila ke m vini pou pale pawòl sa a de mèt mwen an, wa a, se ke pèp la te fè m pè; pou sa sèvant pa ou a te di a: ‘Kite mwen pale avèk wa a. Petèt wa a va akonpli demann lan a sèvant li an.’ <verse eid="2SA 14:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2SA 14:16"/>Paske wa a va tande e delivre sèvant li an soti nan men a nonm ki ta detwi ni mwen, ni fis mwen an sou <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">14:16 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 32:9">Det 32:9</ref></char></note>eritaj Bondye a. <verse eid="2SA 14:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2SA 14:17"/>Alò, sèvant ou an te di: ‘Souple kite pawòl a mèt mwen an, wa a, vin rekonfòte mwen, paske tankou <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">14:17 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1SA 29:9">I Sam 29:9</ref></char></note>zanj Bondye a, se konsa mèt mwen an, wa a, ye pou distenge sa ki bon avèk sa ki mal. Epi ke SENYÈ a, Bondye pa ou a, kapab avèk ou.’”<verse eid="2SA 14:17"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="2SA 14:18"/>Wa a te reponn e te di a fanm nan: “Souple, pa kache pou mwen anyen ke m prè pou mande ou la a.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2SA 14:18">Epi fanm nan te di: “Kite mèt mwen an, wa a, pale, souple.”<verse eid="2SA 14:18"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="2SA 14:19"/>Alò, wa a te reponn e te di: “Èske men Joab mele avèk ou nan tout sa?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2SA 14:19">Epi fanm nan te reponn: “Jan nanm ou viv la, mèt mwen an, wa a, pèsòn pa kab vire ni adwat ni agoch nan anyen ke mèt mwen an, wa a, te pale a. <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">14:19 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2SA 14:3">II Sam 14:3</ref></char></note>Anverite, se te sèvitè ou a, Joab ki te kòmande mwen. Epi se te li ki te mete tout pawòl sa yo nan bouch sèvant ou an, <verse eid="2SA 14:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="2SA 14:20"/>pou l te kab chanje aparans a bagay yo, sèvitè Joab la te fè bagay sa a. Men mèt mwen an saj, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">14:20 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2SA 14:17">II Sam 14:17</ref></char></note>tankou sajès a zanj Bondye a, pou konnen tout sa ki sou tè a.”<verse eid="2SA 14:20"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="2SA 14:21"/>Alò, wa a te di Joab: “Gade byen, anverite, mwen va fè bagay sa a. Pou sa, ale mennen fè tounen jennonm nan, Absalom.”<verse eid="2SA 14:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="2SA 14:22"/>Joab te tonbe figi atè, kouche nèt e te beni wa a. Epi Joab te di: “Jodi a, sèvitè ou konnen ke li twouve favè nan zye ou, O mèt mwen, wa a, akoz wa a te akonpli demann lan a sèvitè li a.”<verse eid="2SA 14:22"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="2SA 14:23"/>Konsa, Joab te leve ale <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">14:23 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 3:14">Det 3:14</ref></char></note>Gueschur pou te mennen Absalom Jérusalem. <verse eid="2SA 14:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="2SA 14:24"/>Men wa a te di: “Pa kite li wè figi mwen.” <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">14:24 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2SA 13:20">II Sam 13:20</ref> </char></note>Konsa, Absalom te vire kote pwòp lakay pa li, e li pa t wè figi a wa a. <verse eid="2SA 14:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="2SA 14:25"/>Alò, nan tout Israël, pa t gen lòt moun ki te pi bo ke Absalom, ki te resevwa lwanj tankou li. Soti nan <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">14:25 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOB 2:7">Job 2:7</ref></char></note>talon pye li jis rive anwo tèt li, pa t gen defo menm. <verse eid="2SA 14:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="2SA 14:26"/>Lè l te konn <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">14:26 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZK 14:20">Éz 14:20</ref></char></note>taye cheve li (ki te fèt nan fen chak ane ke li te koupe li; paske li te lou sou li e pou sa, li te koupe l), li te peze cheve a tèt li nan pèz de-san sik selon balans a wa a. <verse eid="2SA 14:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="2SA 14:27"/>Pou Absalom te ne twa fis ak yon fi ki te rele <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">14:27 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2SA 13:1">II Sam 13:1</ref></char></note>Tamar. Se te yon fanm ki te byen bèl. <verse eid="2SA 14:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="2SA 14:28"/>Alò, Absalom te viv pandan dezan konplè Jérusalem e pa t wè figi a wa a. <verse eid="2SA 14:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="2SA 14:29"/>Apre, Absalom te voye dèyè Joab, pou l ta voye li kote wa a, men Joab te refize vin kote li. Konsa, li te voye ankò yon dezyèm fwa, men li pa t vini. <verse eid="2SA 14:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="2SA 14:30"/>Pou sa, li te pale a sèvitè yo pa li menm: “Gade, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">14:30 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JDG 15:3-5">Jij 15:3-5</ref></char></note>chan Joab la akote pa m nan ki gen sereyal lòj. Ale mete dife ladann”. Konsa sèvitè Absalom yo te mete dife nan chan an.<verse eid="2SA 14:30"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="2SA 14:31"/>Alò, Joab te leve rive kote Absalom lakay li a. Li te di li: “Poukisa sèvitè ou yo te lage dife nan chan mwen an?”<verse eid="2SA 14:31"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="2SA 14:32"/>Absalom te reponn Joab: “Gade, mwen te voye dèyè ou, e mwen te di: ‘Vin isit la pou m kab voye ou kote wa a pou mande l: “Poukisa mwen te kite Gueschur? Li ta pi bon pou mwen si m te toujou la.”’ Pou sa, kite mwen wè figi a wa a, e <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">14:32 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1SA 20:8">I Sam 20:8</ref></char></note> si gen inikite nan mwen, kite li mete m a lanmò.”<verse eid="2SA 14:32"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="2SA 14:33"/>Konsa, lè Joab te rive kote wa a e te pale li, li te rele Absalom. Konsa, li te rive a wa a e te bese li ba avèk figi li atè devan wa a e <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">14:33 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 33:4">Jen 33:4</ref></char></note>wa a te bo Absalom.<verse eid="2SA 14:33"/></para>
  <chapter eid="2SA 14"/>
  <chapter number="15" style="c" sid="2SA 15"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2SA 15:1"/>Alò, li te rive apre sa ke Absalom te fè pwovizyon pou tèt li yon cha avèk cheval ak senkant mesye pou kouri devan li. <verse eid="2SA 15:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2SA 15:2"/>Absalom te konn leve granmmaten e <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">15:2 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="RUT 4:1">Rt 4:1</ref></char></note>kanpe akote chemen an devan pòtay la. Konsa, lè yon moun ta gen yon pwosè, e te vin kote wa a pou jijman, Absalom te rele li e di: “Nan ki vil ou sòti?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2SA 15:2">Epi li ta di: “Sèvitè ou a sòti nan youn nan tribi Israël yo.”<verse eid="2SA 15:2"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="2SA 15:3"/>Alò, Absalom ta di a li: “Ou wè, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">15:3 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PRO 12:2">Pwov 12:2</ref></char></note>ka ou yo bon e jis; men nanpwen pèsòn ki pou koute ou nan non a wa a.” <verse eid="2SA 15:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2SA 15:4"/>Anplis, Absalom te di: “Oswa ke yon moun ta chwazi mwen jij nan peyi a;<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">15:4 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JDG 9:29">Jij 9:29</ref></char></note> alò, konsa chak moun ki te gen yon ka oswa yon pwosè ta kapab vin kote mwen e mwen ta ba li jistis.” <verse eid="2SA 15:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2SA 15:5"/>Epi lè yon mesye ta vin kote li pou bese li menm devan li, li ta lonje men li, kenbe li e <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">15:5 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2SA 14:33">II Sam 14:33</ref></char></note> bo li. <verse eid="2SA 15:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2SA 15:6"/>Nan jan sa a, Absalom te konn aji avèk tout Israël lè yo te pwoche wa a pou jijman. <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">15:6 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ROM 16:18">Wo 16:18</ref></char></note> Konsa, Absalom te vòlè kè a mesye Israël yo.<verse eid="2SA 15:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="2SA 15:7"/>Alò, li te rive ke nan fen <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">15:7 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2SA 3:2-3">II Sam 3:2-3</ref></char></note> karant ane ke Absalom te di a Wa a: “Souple, kite mwen ale peye ve ke m te fè a SENYÈ a, nan Hébron. <verse eid="2SA 15:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2SA 15:8"/>Paske sèvitè ou a te fè yon ve pandan mwen t ap viv Gueschur Aram, e li te di: <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">15:8 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 28:20-21">Jen 28:20-21</ref></char></note> ‘Si SENYÈ a va vrèman mennen mwen retounen Jérusalem; alò, mwen va sèvi SENYÈ a’”.<verse eid="2SA 15:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="2SA 15:9"/>Wa a te di li: “Ale anpè.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2SA 15:9">Konsa, li te leve ale Hébron. <verse eid="2SA 15:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2SA 15:10"/>Men Absalom te voye espyon toupatou pami tout tribi Israël yo. Li te di: <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">15:10 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1KI 1:34">I Wa 1:34</ref></char></note> “Depi ou tande son a twonpèt la, alò, ou va di: ‘Absalom se wa nan Hébron.’”<verse eid="2SA 15:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="2SA 15:11"/>Konsa, de-san mesye yo te ale avèk Absalom soti Jérusalem. <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">15:11 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1SA 9:13">I Sam 9:13</ref></char></note>Yo te envite; yo te ale nan inosans, san yo pa konnen anyen. <verse eid="2SA 15:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2SA 15:12"/>Epi Absalom te voye pou <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">15:12 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2SA 15:31">II Sam 15:31</ref></char></note> Achitophel, Gilonit lan, konseye David, soti nan vil pa li nan Guilo, pandan li t ap ofri sakrifis yo. Konplo a te fò, paske <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">15:12 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 3:1">Sòm 3:1</ref></char></note>moun avèk Absalom yo te kontinye vin plis. <verse eid="2SA 15:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2SA 15:13"/>Alò, yon mesaje te vin kote David. Li te di: <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">15:13 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JDG 9:3">Jij 9:3</ref></char></note> “Kè a mesye Israël yo avèk Absalom.”<verse eid="2SA 15:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="2SA 15:14"/>Konsa, David te di a tout sèvitè ki te avèk li yo Jérusalem: <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">15:14 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2SA 12:11">II Sam 12:11</ref></char></note>“Leve e annou sove ale, paske si se pa sa, nanpwen nan nou ki va chape de Absalom. Ale vit, oswa li va rive sou nou byen vit, fè gwo malè rive sou nou e frape vil la avèk lam nepe.”<verse eid="2SA 15:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="2SA 15:15"/>Alò, sèvitè a wa yo te di a wa a: “Gade, sèvitè ou yo va fè nenpòt sa ke wa a vle.”<verse eid="2SA 15:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="2SA 15:16"/>Konsa, wa a te sòti avèk tout manm lakay li avèk li. Men <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">15:16 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2SA 16:21-22">II Sam 16:21-22</ref></char></note> wa a te kite dis nan ti mennaj li yo pou pran swen kay la. <verse eid="2SA 15:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2SA 15:17"/>Wa a te sòti e tout pèp la avèk li, e yo te rete nan dènye kay la. <verse eid="2SA 15:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2SA 15:18"/>Alò, tout sèvitè li yo te pase akote li, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">15:18 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2SA 8:18">II Sam 8:18</ref></char></note> tout Keretyen yo avèk tout Peletyen yo ak tout Gatyen yo, sis-san moun ki te vini avèk li soti Gath, te pase devan wa a.<verse eid="2SA 15:18"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="2SA 15:19"/>Alò, wa a te di a <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">15:19 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2SA 18:2">II Sam 18:2</ref></char></note> Ittaï, Gatyen an: “Poukisa ou ta ale avèk nou tou? Retounen rete avèk wa a; paske ou se yon etranje e yon egzile de pwòp plas ou. <verse eid="2SA 15:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="2SA 15:20"/>Ayè ou te vini e èske, jodi a, mwen ta dwe fè ou mache egare avèk nou <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">15:20 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1SA 23:13">I Sam 23:13</ref></char></note> pandan mwen prale kote mwen prale a? Retounen reprann frè ou yo. Ke <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">15:20 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2SA 2:6">II Sam 2:6</ref> </char></note>gras avèk verite kapab avèk ou.”<verse eid="2SA 15:20"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="2SA 15:21"/>Men Ittaï te reponn wa a. Li te di: “Jan SENYÈ a viv la, anverite, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">15:21 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="RUT 1:16-17">Rt 1:16-17</ref></char></note> nenpòt kote ke mèt mwen an, wa a, ye, kit pou mouri, kit pou viv, se la tou sèvitè ou a va ye.”<verse eid="2SA 15:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="2SA 15:22"/>Pou sa, David te di Ittaï: “Ale, janbe lòtbò.” Konsa Ittaï, Gatyen an te janbe avèk tout mesye pa li yo ak tout pitit ki te avèk li yo. <verse eid="2SA 15:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="2SA 15:23"/>Pandan tout peyi a t ap kriye avèk gwo vwa, tout pèp la te pase janbe. Wa a tou te pase janbe flèv Cédron an, e tout pèp la te pase janbe lòtbò vè chemen dezè a. <verse eid="2SA 15:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="2SA 15:24"/>Alò, gade byen, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">15:24 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2SA 8:17">II Sam 8:17</ref></char></note> Tsadok te parèt tou, ansanm avèk tout Levit ki t ap pote lach akò Bondye a. Epi yo te poze lach Bondye a e Abithar te monte la jiskaske tout pèp la te fin kite vil la. <verse eid="2SA 15:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="2SA 15:25"/>Wa a te di a Tsadok: “Retounen lach Bondye a nan vil la. Si mwen jwenn favè nan zye Bondye; alò, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">15:25 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 43:3">Sòm 43:3</ref></char></note> Li va mennen mwen retounen ankò pou montre mwen a Li menm e a <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">15:25 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 15:13">Egz 15:13</ref></char></note>abitasyon pa Li a. <verse eid="2SA 15:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="2SA 15:26"/>Men si Li ta di konsa:<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">15:26 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1CH 21:7">I Kwo 21:7</ref></char></note> ‘Mwen pa gen kè kontan avè w’, gade byen, men mwen, kite Li fè sa ki sanble bon pou Li menm.” <verse eid="2SA 15:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="2SA 15:27"/>Wa a te di osi a Tsadok, prèt la: “Èske se pa yon <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">15:27 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1SA 9:6-9">I Sam 9:6-9</ref></char></note> divinò ke ou ye? Retounen nan vil la anpè, de fis ou yo avèk ou, fis ou Achimaats, avèk Jonathan, fis a Abiathar a. <verse eid="2SA 15:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="2SA 15:28"/>Gade, mwen pral tann <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">15:28 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOS 5:10">Jos 5:10</ref></char></note> nan pasaj dezè a jiskaske pawòl ou rive enfòme mwen.” <verse eid="2SA 15:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="2SA 15:29"/>Pou sa, Tsadok avèk Abiathar te retounen lach Bondye a Jérusalem e te rete la. <verse eid="2SA 15:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="2SA 15:30"/>Epi David te monte pant a Mòn Oliv la. Li t ap kriye pandan li t ap monte, tèt li te kouvri e li te mache <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">15:30 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 20:2-4">És 20:2-4</ref></char></note> pye atè. Alò, nan tout moun ki te avèk li yo, chak moun te kouvri tèt yo e t ap monte avèk gwo kriye pandan yo t ap prale.<verse eid="2SA 15:30"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="2SA 15:31"/>Alò, yon moun te pale David e te di: <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">15:31 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2SA 15:12">II Sam 15:12</ref></char></note> “Achitophel se pami konplotè avèk Absalom yo.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2SA 15:31">Epi David te di: “O SENYÈ, mwen priye, redwi a foli tout konsèy a Achitophel la.”<verse eid="2SA 15:31"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="2SA 15:32"/>Li te rive pandan David t ap pwoche krèt mòn nan, kote yo adore Bondye a, ke vwala, Huschaï, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">15:32 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOS 16:2">Jos 16:2</ref></char></note> Achit la, te rankontre li avèk manto li chire ak pousyè sou tèt li. <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">15:32 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOS 16:2">Jos 16:2</ref></char></note> <verse eid="2SA 15:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="2SA 15:33"/>David te di li: “Si ou janbe lòtbò avè m; alò, ou va <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">15:33 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2SA 19:35">II Sam 19:35</ref></char></note> ankonbre m. <verse eid="2SA 15:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="2SA 15:34"/>Men si ou retounen lavil la e <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">15:34 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2SA 16:19">II Sam 16:19</ref></char></note> di a Absalom: ‘Mwen va sèvi ou, O wa a. Jan mwen te sèvi papa ou nan tan pase a, konsa, mwen va koulye a, devni sèvitè pa ou’, konsa, ou kapab vin kontrekare konsèy Achitophel la pou mwen. <verse eid="2SA 15:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="2SA 15:35"/>Èske Tsadok avèk Abiathar se pa prèt ki avèk ou la a? Pou sa, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">15:35 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2SA 17:15-16">II Sam 17:15-16</ref></char></note>nenpòt sa ou tande soti lakay wa a, ou va bay rapò a Tsadok avèk Abaithar, prèt yo. <verse eid="2SA 15:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="2SA 15:36"/>Gade byen, de fis pa yo a avèk yo la a, Achimaats, fis a Tsadok a e Jonathan, fis a Abaithar a; epi <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">15:36 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2SA 17:17">II Sam 17:17</ref></char></note> pa yo menm, ou va voye ban mwen tout bagay ke ou tande yo.”<verse eid="2SA 15:36"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="2SA 15:37"/>Konsa, Huschaï, zanmi a David la, te antre nan vil la, e Absalom te vini Jérusalem.<verse eid="2SA 15:37"/></para>
  <chapter eid="2SA 15"/>
  <chapter number="16" style="c" sid="2SA 16"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2SA 16:1"/>Alò, lè David te fin depase krèt la, vwala, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">16:1 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2SA 9:2-13">II Sam 9:2-13</ref></char></note> Tsiba, sèvitè a Méphiboscheth la te rankontre li <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">16:1 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1SA 25:18">I Sam 25:18</ref></char></note>avèk yon pè bourik avèk makout. Sou yo, te gen de-san pen, yon santèn grap rezen, yon santèn fwi gran sezon ak yon veso diven. <verse eid="2SA 16:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2SA 16:2"/>Wa a te di a Tsiba: “Poukisa ou genyen sila yo?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2SA 16:2">Epi Tsiba te di: <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">16:2 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JDG 10:4">Jij 10:4</ref></char></note> “Bourik yo se pou manm lakay wa yo monte, pen avèk fwi gran sezon an se pou jennonm yo manje e diven an se pou nenpòt moun ki fin pèdi fòs nan dezè a kab bwè.”<verse eid="2SA 16:2"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="2SA 16:3"/>Alò, wa a te di: “Epi kote <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">16:3 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2SA 9:9-10">II Sam 9:9-10</ref></char></note> fis a mèt ou a?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2SA 16:3">Epi Tsiba te di a wa a: “Men vwala, li rete Jérusalem paske li te di: ‘Jodi a, lakay Israël la va restore wayòm papa m nan a mwen menm.’”<verse eid="2SA 16:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="2SA 16:4"/>Konsa, wa a te di a Tsiba: “Men vwala, tout sa ki apatyen a Méphiboscheth se pou ou.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2SA 16:4">Epi Tsiba te di: “Mwen vin bese devan ou nèt; kite mwen twouve gras nan zye ou, O mèt mwen, wa a!”<verse eid="2SA 16:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="2SA 16:5"/>Lè Wa David te rive Bachurim, gade byen, te sòti depi la yon mesye ki sòti nan fanmi Saül <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">16:5 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2SA 19:16-23">II Sam 19:16-23</ref></char></note> ki te rele Schimeï, fis a Guéra a. Li te parèt ak pawòl madichon san rete pandan li t ap pwoche. <verse eid="2SA 16:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2SA 16:6"/>Li te jete wòch sou David, sou tout sèvitè a Wa David yo e tout mesye gran kouraj yo te sou men dwat li ak sou men goch li. <verse eid="2SA 16:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2SA 16:7"/>Konsa, Schimeï te di pandan li t ap voye madichon yo: “Sòti la, sòti la,<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">16:7 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2SA 12:9">II Sam 12:9</ref></char></note> moun ki vèse san, sanzave! <verse eid="2SA 16:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2SA 16:8"/><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">16:8 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2SA 21:1-9">II Sam 21:1-9</ref> </char></note> SENYÈ a gen tan mete sou ou tout san koule lakay Saül, nan plas kote ou te renye a! SENYÈ a te lage wayòm nan nan men fis ou, Absalom. Epi gade, ou pran nan pwòp mechanste ou, paske ou se yon nonm ki vèse san!”<verse eid="2SA 16:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="2SA 16:9"/>Alò, Abischai, fis a Tseruja a te di a wa a: “Poukisa <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">16:9 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2SA 9:8">II Sam 9:8</ref></char></note>chen mouri sa a ta dwe <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">16:9 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 22:28">Egz 22:28</ref></char></note>modi mèt mwen an, wa a? Kite mwen janbe ale koupe tèt li.” <verse eid="2SA 16:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2SA 16:10"/>Men wa a te di: “Kisa mwen gen avè w, O fis a Tseruja? Si li bay madichon, e si SENYÈ a te di li ‘Modi David’, alò, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">16:10 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ROM 9:20">Wo 9:20</ref></char></note>se kilès k ap di: ‘Poukisa ou te fè sa?’”<verse eid="2SA 16:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="2SA 16:11"/>Alò, David te di a Abischaï e a tout sèvitè li yo: “Gade, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">16:11 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2SA 12:11">II Sam 12:11</ref></char></note> fis mwen ki te sòti nan mwen an koulye a ap chache lavi m. Konbyen anplis pou Benjamit sila a? Kite li e kite li bay madichon, paske SENYÈ a te pale li. <verse eid="2SA 16:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2SA 16:12"/>Petèt SENYÈ a va gade afliksyon mwen e <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">16:12 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 23:5">Det 23:5</ref></char></note> remete m bon olye madichon pa sila a nan jou sa a.” <verse eid="2SA 16:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2SA 16:13"/>Konsa, David avèk mesye pa li yo te fè wout yo. Epi Schimeï te mache akote pant mòn nan vizavi de yo menm. Pandan li t ap prale, li te modi, li te jete wòch, e li te jete pousyè bò kote li. <verse eid="2SA 16:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2SA 16:14"/>Wa a avèk tout moun ki te avèk li yo te rive byen fatige, e yo te vin rafrechi la.<verse eid="2SA 16:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="2SA 16:15"/>Alò, Absalom avèk tout pèp la, mesye Israël yo te antre Jérusalem e Achitophel avèk li. <verse eid="2SA 16:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2SA 16:16"/>Konsa, li te vin rive lè <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">16:16 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2SA 15:37">II Sam 15:37</ref></char></note> Huschaï, Akyen an, zanmi a David la te rive kote Absalom, ke Huschaï te di: “Viv wa a! Viv wa a!”<verse eid="2SA 16:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="2SA 16:17"/>Absalom te di Huschaï: “Èske sa se fidelite ou pou zanmi ou? <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">16:17 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2SA 19:25">II Sam 19:25</ref></char></note> Poukisa ou pa t ale avèk zanmi ou an?”<verse eid="2SA 16:17"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="2SA 16:18"/>Epi Huschaï te di a Absalom: “Non, paske sila ke SENYÈ a, pèp sa a e tout mesye Israël yo te chwazi a, se pou li menm, mwen va ye, e avèk li menm, mwen va rete. <verse eid="2SA 16:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="2SA 16:19"/>Anplis de sa, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">16:19 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2SA 15:34">II Sam 15:34</ref></char></note> se kilès pou m ta sèvi? Se pa nan prezans a fis li a? Jis jan ke m te sèvi nan prezans papa ou a, konsa mwen va ye nan prezans pa w.”<verse eid="2SA 16:19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="2SA 16:20"/>Alò, Absalom te di a Achitophel: “Ban m konsèy pa w Kisa nou dwe fè?”<verse eid="2SA 16:20"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="2SA 16:21"/>Achitophel te di a Absalom: <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">16:21 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2SA 15:16">II Sam 15:16</ref></char></note> “Antre nan ti mennaj papa ou te lese pou okipe kay la; epi tout Israël va tande ke ou te fè tèt ou rayisab a papa ou. Anplis, men a tout sila ki avèk ou yo va vin ranfòse.”<verse eid="2SA 16:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="2SA 16:22"/>Konsa yo te monte yon tant anwo tèt kay la, epi Absalom te antre nan relasyon seksyèl ak tout konkibin papa l yo, devan zye a tout Israël.<verse eid="2SA 16:22"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="2SA 16:23"/>
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">16:23 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="2SA 17:14">II Sam 17:14</ref>,<ref loc="2SA 17:23">23</ref></char>
    </note>Konsèy a Achitophel te konn bay nan jou sa yo te konsidere tankou si yon moun te mande konsèy a pawòl Bondye. <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">16:23 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2SA 15:12">II Sam 15:12</ref></char></note>Se te konsa tout konsèy Achitophel te ye pou David ak Absalom.<verse eid="2SA 16:23"/></para>
  <chapter eid="2SA 16"/>
  <chapter number="17" style="c" sid="2SA 17"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2SA 17:1"/>Anplis, Achitophel te di a Absalom: “Souple, kite mwen chwazi douz-mil òm pou m kab leve kouri dèyè David aswè a menm. <verse eid="2SA 17:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2SA 17:2"/><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">17:2 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2SA 16:14">II Sam 16:14</ref></char></note> Mwen va vini sou li pandan li fatige e bouke e fè l vin sezi pou tout moun ki avèk li yo kouri ale. Konsa, se sèl wa a <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">17:2 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1KI 22:31">I Wa 22:31</ref></char></note>mwen va frape touye, <verse eid="2SA 17:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2SA 17:3"/>epi mwen va fè retounen tout moun yo a ou menm. Retou a tout moun yo depann de nonm ou chache a; answit, tout pèp la va <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">17:3 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 6:14">Jr 6:14</ref></char></note> anpè.”<verse eid="2SA 17:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="2SA 17:4"/>Konsa, plan an te fè Absalom avèk tout ansyen Israël yo kontan. <verse eid="2SA 17:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2SA 17:5"/>Alò, Absalom te di: “Alò, rele <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">17:5 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2SA 15:32-34">II Sam 15:32-34</ref></char></note> Huschaï, Akyen an tou e annou tande sa ke li gen pou di.”<verse eid="2SA 17:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="2SA 17:6"/>Lè Huschaï te rive a Absalom, Absalom te di li: “Achitophel te pale konsa. Èske nou dwe fè plan pa li a? Si se pa sa, pale.”<verse eid="2SA 17:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="2SA 17:7"/>Konsa, Huschaï te di a Absalom: <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">17:7 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2SA 16:21">II Sam 16:21</ref></char></note> “Fwa sa a, konsèy ke Achitophel te bay la, pa bon.” <verse eid="2SA 17:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2SA 17:8"/>Anplis, Huschaï te di: “Ou konnen papa ou avèk mesye pa li yo se mesye plen kouraj e fewòs, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">17:8 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="HOS 13:8">Os 13:8</ref></char></note> tankou yon lous ki pèdi pitit li nan chan. Epi papa ou gen gwo eksperyans lagè e li p ap pase nwit lan avèk pèp la. <verse eid="2SA 17:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2SA 17:9"/>Gade byen, depi koulye a, li gen tan kache nan youn nan kavèn yo oswa nan yon lòt plas; epi li va rive ke lè li tonbe sou yo nan premye atak la, ke nenpòt moun ki tande va di: ‘Gen yon masak ki fèt pami moun ki swiv Absalom yo.’ <verse eid="2SA 17:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2SA 17:10"/>Epi menm sila ki gen gwo kouraj yo, ki gen kè tankou kè a lyon yo, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">17:10 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOS 2:9-11">Jos 2:9-11</ref></char></note> va vin pèdi kouraj nèt; paske tout Israël konnen ke papa ou se yon nonm pwisan e sila ki avèk li yo se mesye vanyan. <verse eid="2SA 17:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2SA 17:11"/>Men konsèy pa m se ke tout Israël vin, anverite, rasanble bò kote ou, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">17:11 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1SA 3:20">I Sam 3:20</ref></char></note> soti nan Dan jis rive nan Beer-Schéba, tankou sab bò lanmè an gran kantite, e ke ou menm, pèsonèlman antre nan batay la. <verse eid="2SA 17:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2SA 17:12"/>Konsa, nou va vini sou li nan plas kote li kapab twouve yo, nou va tonbe sou li <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">17:12 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 110:3">Sòm 110:3</ref></char></note> tankou lawouze tonbe atè; epi konsènan li avèk tout mesye ki avèk li yo, p ap gen menm youn ki rete. <verse eid="2SA 17:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2SA 17:13"/>Si li retire li nan yon vil, alò, tout Israël va mennen kòd kote vil sila a e yo va <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">17:13 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MIC 1:6">Mi 1:6</ref></char></note> rale li nèt antre nan vale a jis nanpwen yon ti wòch ki rete.”<verse eid="2SA 17:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="2SA 17:14"/>Alò, Absalom avèk tout mesye Israël yo te di: “Konsèy Huschaï pi bon ke konsèy Achitophel la.” Paske <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">17:14 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2SA 15:31-34">II Sam 15:31-34</ref></char></note> SENYÈ a te deja detèmine pou anile bon konsèy Achitophel la, pou SENYÈ a ta kapab fè gwo dezas rive Absalom.<verse eid="2SA 17:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="2SA 17:15"/>Epi <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">17:15 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2SA 15:35-36">II Sam 15:35-36</ref> </char></note>Huschaï te di a Tsadok avèk Abiathar, prèt yo: “Sa se konsèy sa a ke Achitophel te bay Absalom avèk ansyen a Israël yo e se sa ke mwen te konseye. <verse eid="2SA 17:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2SA 17:16"/>Alò, pou sa, voye vit pale David e di: <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">17:16 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2SA 15:28">II Sam 15:28</ref></char></note> ‘Pa pase nwit lan kote ki pou janbe dlo rive nan dezè a, men fè sèten ke nou janbe, oswa wa a avèk tout moun ki avèk li yo va vin detwi.’”<verse eid="2SA 17:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="2SA 17:17"/>Alò, Jonathan avèk Achimaats te rete <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">17:17 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOS 15:7">Jos 15:7</ref></char></note> En-Rougel. Yon sèvant te gen pou ale pale yo pou yo ta ale avèti Wa David, paske yo pa t kapab kite moun wè yo antre nan vil la. <verse eid="2SA 17:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2SA 17:18"/>Men yon gason te wè yo kanmenm e te di Absalom. Pou sa, yo te pati vit rive lakay a yon mesye <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">17:18 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2SA 3:16">II Sam 3:16</ref></char></note> Bachurim ki te gen yon pwi nan lakou a, e yo te desann antre ladann. <verse eid="2SA 17:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="2SA 17:19"/>Konsa, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">17:19 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOS 2:4-6">Jos 2:4-6</ref></char></note>fanm nan te pran yon kouvèti. Li te ouvri li sou bouch pwi a, e li te gaye sereyal sou li jiskaske yo pa t konnen anyen. <verse eid="2SA 17:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="2SA 17:20"/>Alò, sèvitè a Absalom yo te vin kote fanm nan lakay li e te di: “Kote Achimaats avèk Jonathan?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2SA 17:20">Epi <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">17:20 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOS 2:3-5">Jos 2:3-5</ref></char></note> fanm nan te di yo: “Yo fin janbe dlo a.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2SA 17:20">Konsa, lè yo te chache e pa t kab jwenn yo, yo te retounen Jérusalem. <verse eid="2SA 17:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="2SA 17:21"/>Li te vin rive lè yo te fin ale ke yo te monte sòti nan pwi a, yo te ale pale Wa David e yo te di David: <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">17:21 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2SA 17:15-16">II Sam 17:15-16</ref> </char></note>“Leve, travèse dlo a byen vit paske Achitophel te bay konsèy kont ou.”<verse eid="2SA 17:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="2SA 17:22"/>Alò, David avèk tout moun ki te avèk li yo te leve janbe Jourdain an. Lè solèy te vin leve, pa t gen youn ki rete ki pa t janbe Jourdain an.<verse eid="2SA 17:22"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="2SA 17:23"/>Alò, lè Achitophel te wè ke konsèy pa li a pa t swiv, li te sele bourik li e li te leve ale lakay li nan <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">17:23 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2SA 15:12">II Sam 15:12</ref></char></note> vil li a. Li te mete lakay li an lòd e te <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">17:23 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 27:5">Mat 27:5</ref></char></note>trangle pwòp tèt li. Konsa, li te mouri e te antere nan tonm a papa li.<verse eid="2SA 17:23"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="2SA 17:24"/>Alò, David te rive <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">17:24 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 32:2-10">Jen 32:2-10</ref></char></note>Mahanaïm. Epi Absalom te travèse Jourdain an, li menm avèk tout mesye Israël yo avèk yo. <verse eid="2SA 17:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="2SA 17:25"/>Absalom te mete Amasa sou tèt lame a nan plas Joab. Alò Amasa te fis a yon mesye ki te rele Jithra, Izrayelit la, ki te antre nan Abigail, fi a <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">17:25 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1CH 2:16">I Kwo 2:16</ref></char></note>Nachasch, sè a Tseruja a, manman a Joab. <verse eid="2SA 17:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="2SA 17:26"/>Epi Israël avèk Absalom te fè kan nan peyi Galaad la.<verse eid="2SA 17:26"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="2SA 17:27"/>Alò, lè David te vini Mahanaïm, Schobi, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">17:27 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1SA 11:1">I Sam 11:1</ref></char></note>fis a Nachasch ki sòti Rabba a, a fis Ammon yo, Makir, fis a Ammiel Lodebar a ak Barzillaï, Galaadit Roguelim nan, <verse eid="2SA 17:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="2SA 17:28"/>te pote <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">17:28 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PRO 11:25">Pwov 11:25</ref></char></note> kabann yo, basen yo, po kanari yo, ble, lòj, farin, sereyal boukannen, pwa, pwa lantiy, avèk grenn boukannen, <verse eid="2SA 17:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="2SA 17:29"/>siwo myèl, bòl lèt, mouton ak fwomaj ki sòti nan twoupo a, pou David ak moun ki te avèk li yo <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">17:29 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2SA 16:2-14">II Sam 16:2-14</ref> </char></note>ta manje. Paske yo te di: “Pèp la grangou, fatige e swaf nan dezè a.”<verse eid="2SA 17:29"/></para>
  <chapter eid="2SA 17"/>
  <chapter number="18" style="c" sid="2SA 18"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2SA 18:1"/>Alò, David te konte moun ki te avèk li yo e te <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">18:1 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 18:25">Egz 18:25</ref> </char></note>plase sou yo chèf dè milye e chèf dè santèn. <verse eid="2SA 18:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2SA 18:2"/>David te voye moun yo deyò, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">18:2 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JDG 7:16">Jij 7:16</ref></char></note>yon tyè anba lòd Joab, yon tyè anba lòd Abischaï, fis a Tseruja a, frè Joab la ak yon tyè anba lòd Ittaï, Gatyen an. Epi wa a te di a moun yo: “Mwen menm va anverite, sòti avèk nou tou.”<verse eid="2SA 18:2"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="2SA 18:3"/>Men moun yo te di: <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">18:3 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2SA 21:17">II Sam 21:17</ref></char></note>“Ou pa dwe sòti; paske si nou vrèman sove ale, yo p ap okipe nou; menm si mwatye ta mouri, yo p ap okipe nou. Men valè pa w vo di-mil a nou menm; pou rezon sa a, li pi bon pou ede nou soti nan vil la.”<verse eid="2SA 18:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="2SA 18:4"/>Alò wa a te di yo: “Nenpòt sa ki sanble bon a nou menm, se sa m ap fè.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2SA 18:4">Pou sa, wa a te kanpe akote pòtay la e tout moun yo te sòti pa santèn e pa milye. <verse eid="2SA 18:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2SA 18:5"/>Wa a te bay lòd a Joab avèk Abischaï avèk Ittaï e te di: “Pou koz mwen, aji dousman avèk jennonm nan, Absalom.” Epi <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">18:5 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2SA 18:12">II Sam 18:12</ref></char></note>tout moun yo te tande lè wa a te pase lòd a tout chèf yo sou Absalom an.<verse eid="2SA 18:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="2SA 18:6"/>Alò, moun yo te antre nan chan kont Israël e batay la te fèt nan <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">18:6 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOS 17:15-18">Jos 17:15-18</ref></char></note>forè Ephraïm nan. <verse eid="2SA 18:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2SA 18:7"/>Moun Israël yo te bat la devan sèvitè a David yo e masak la te byen gwo, ven-mil òm. <verse eid="2SA 18:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2SA 18:8"/>Paske batay la te gaye sou tout teritwa peyi a e forè a te devore plis moun nan jou sa a ke nepe ta devore.<verse eid="2SA 18:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="2SA 18:9"/>Alò, Absalom te vin rankontre sèvitè a David yo. Paske Absalom te monte sou milèt li e milèt la te antre anba gwo branch a yon gwo bwadchenn. Epi <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">18:9 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2SA 14:26">II Sam 14:26</ref> </char></note>tèt li te kole rèd nan chenn nan e li te vin kwoke antre syèl avèk tè a, pandan milèt la anba li t ap kontinye ale. <verse eid="2SA 18:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2SA 18:10"/>Lè yon sèten mesye te wè sa, li te pale Joab, e te di: “Gade byen, mwen te wè Absalom pandye nan yon gwo bwadchenn.”<verse eid="2SA 18:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="2SA 18:11"/>Epi Joab te di a mesye ki te di sa a: “Gade, ou te wè l? Poukisa konsa ou pa t frape li la pou l tonbe atè? Konsa, mwen ta ba ou dis pyès ajan avèk yon senti.”<verse eid="2SA 18:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="2SA 18:12"/>Mesye a te di Joab: “Menm si mwen ta resevwa mil pyès ajan nan men m, mwen pa t ap lonje men m kont fis a wa a; paske <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">18:12 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2SA 18:5">II Sam 18:5</ref></char></note>nan tande nou, wa a te kòmande ou avèk Abischaï ak Ittaï, e te di: ‘Pwoteje pou mwen jennonm nan, Absalom!’ <verse eid="2SA 18:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2SA 18:13"/>Otreman, si m te aji nan mechanste kont lavi li (e <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">18:13 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2SA 14:19-20">II Sam 14:19-20</ref></char></note>nanpwen anyen ki kache a wa a), alò, ou menm ta kanpe lwen de sa.”<verse eid="2SA 18:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="2SA 18:14"/>Joab te di: “Mwen p ap gaspiye tan avè w isit la.” <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">18:14 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2SA 14:30">II Sam 14:30</ref></char></note>Konsa, li te pran twa frenn nan men l e li te frennen fè yo pase sou kè Absalom pandan li te toujou vivan nan mitan bwadchenn nan. <verse eid="2SA 18:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2SA 18:15"/>Epi dis jennonm ki te pote zam pou Joab yo te antoure li, yo te frape Absalom e te touye li. <verse eid="2SA 18:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2SA 18:16"/>Alò, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">18:16 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2SA 2:28">II Sam 2:28</ref></char></note>Joab te soufle twonpèt la e moun yo te retounen soti kouri dèyè Israël, paske Joab te ralanti moun yo. <verse eid="2SA 18:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2SA 18:17"/>Yo te pran Absalom, yo te jete li nan yon gwo twou vid nan mitan forè a e te <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">18:17 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 21:20-21">Det 21:20-21</ref></char></note> monte sou li yon gwo pil wòch. Epi tout Israël te sove ale, chak moun nan pwòp tant pa yo.<verse eid="2SA 18:17"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="2SA 18:18"/>Alò, Absalom, pandan lavi li <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">18:18 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1SA 15:12">I Sam 15:12</ref></char></note>te fè monte pou li menm yon gwo pilye ki nan <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">18:18 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 14:17">Jen 14:17</ref></char></note>Vale a Wa a, paske li te di: “Mwen pa gen fis pou prezève non mwen.” Konsa, li te rele pilye a pa non li e li rele Moniman Absalom jis rive jodi a.<verse eid="2SA 18:18"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="2SA 18:19"/>Alò, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">18:19 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2SA 15:36">II Sam 15:36</ref></char></note>Achimaats, fis a Tsadok la te di: “Souple, kite mwen kouri pote nouvèl la bay wa a ke SENYÈ a gen tan delivre li anba men lènmi li yo.”<verse eid="2SA 18:19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="2SA 18:20"/>Men Joab te di li: “Ou menm se pa nonm ki pou pote nouvèl la nan jou sa a, malgre ke ou va pote li yon lòt jou, men ou p ap pote li jodi a, paske fis a wa a mouri.”<verse eid="2SA 18:20"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="2SA 18:21"/>Alò, Joab te di a Etyopyen an: “Ale, pale wa a sa ou te wè a.” Konsa, Etyopyen an te bese devan Joab e te kouri ale.<verse eid="2SA 18:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="2SA 18:22"/>Alò, Achimaats, fis a Tsadok la te di yon lòt fwa a Joab: “Malgre nenpòt sa ki rive, kite mwen tou kouri dèyè Etyopyen an.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2SA 18:22">Epi Joab te di: “Poukisa ou ta kouri, fis mwen, kòmsi <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">18:22 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2SA 18:29">II Sam 18:29</ref></char></note>ou p ap twouve rekonpans pou ale a?”<verse eid="2SA 18:22"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="2SA 18:23"/>“Malgre sa ki rive”, li te di: “Mwen va kouri”.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2SA 18:23">Epi Achimaats te kouri nan wout plèn nan e te vin depase Etyopyen an.<verse eid="2SA 18:23"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="2SA 18:24"/>Alò, David te chita antre de pòtay yo; epi gadyen an te monte sou twati pòtay sou mi an. Li te leve zye li e te gade. Men vwala, yon nonm ki t ap kouri li sèl a li menm. <verse eid="2SA 18:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="2SA 18:25"/>Gadyen an te kouri pale wa a. Epi wa a te di: “Si se sèl li menm k ap vini, se bòn nouvèl nan bouch li.” Epi li te pwoche pi pre e pi pre toujou.<verse eid="2SA 18:25"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="2SA 18:26"/>Apre sa, gadyen an te wè yon lòt moun ki t ap kouri; epi gadyen an te rele gadyen pòtay la e te di: “Gade byen, gen yon lòt moun k ap kouri pou kont li.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2SA 18:26">Epi wa a te di: “Sila a tou ap pote bòn nouvèl.”<verse eid="2SA 18:26"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="2SA 18:27"/>Gadyen an te di: “Mwen kwè ke kouri a premye a sanble kouri a Achimaats, fis a Tsadok la.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2SA 18:27">Epi wa a te di: <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">18:27 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1KI 1:42">I Wa 1:42</ref></char></note>“Sa se yon bon mesye e li pote bòn nouvèl.”<verse eid="2SA 18:27"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="2SA 18:28"/>Achimaats te rele e te di a wa a: “Tout bagay sòti byen.” Epi li te bese figi atè devan wa a, e li te di: <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">18:28 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1SA 17:46">I Sam 17:46</ref></char></note>“Beni se SENYÈ a, Bondye ou a, ki te livre bay mesye ki te leve men kont mèt mwen an, wa a.”<verse eid="2SA 18:28"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="2SA 18:29"/>Wa a te di: <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">18:29 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2SA 20:9">II Sam 20:9</ref></char></note>“Èske tout bagay byen avèk jennonm nan, Absalom?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2SA 18:29">Epi Achimaats te reponn: “Lè Joab te voye sèvitè a wa a, sèvitè ou menm nan, mwen te wè yon gwo zen; men mwen pa t konnen kisa.”<verse eid="2SA 18:29"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="2SA 18:30"/>Epi wa a te di: “Mete ou akote e kanpe la.” Konsa, li te mete li akote e te kanpe tann la.<verse eid="2SA 18:30"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="2SA 18:31"/>Gade byen, Etyopyen an te rive e Etyopyen an te di: “Kite mèt mwen an, wa a resevwa bòn nouvèl; paske <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">18:31 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JDG 5:31">Jij 5:31</ref></char></note>SENYÈ a te delivre ou nan jou sa a soti nan men a tout sila ki te leve kont ou yo.”<verse eid="2SA 18:31"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="2SA 18:32"/>Alò, wa a te di a Etyopyen an: “Èske sa byen avèk jennonm nan, Absalom?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2SA 18:32">Epi Etyopyen an te reponn: <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">18:32 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1SA 25:26">I Sam 25:26</ref></char></note>“Kite lènmi a mèt mwen yo, wa a, ak tout moun ki leve kont ou pou mal yo, devni tankou jennonm sila a!”<verse eid="2SA 18:32"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="2SA 18:33"/>Wa a te sezi avèk emosyon e te monte nan chanm nan sou pòtay la pou te kriye. Epi konsa li te di pandan li t ap mache: “O fis mwen Absalom, fis mwen, fis mwen Absalom! <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">18:33 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 32:32">Egz 32:32</ref></char></note>Pito se te mwen ki te mouri olye de ou menm, O Absalom, fis mwen, fis mwen!”<verse eid="2SA 18:33"/></para>
  <chapter eid="2SA 18"/>
  <chapter number="19" style="c" sid="2SA 19"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2SA 19:1"/>Alò, li te pale a Joab: “Gade byen, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">19:1 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2SA 18:5-14">II Sam 18:5-14</ref></char></note>wa a ap kriye e fè lamantasyon pou Absalom.” <verse eid="2SA 19:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2SA 19:2"/>Viktwa a jou sa a te boulvèse vin fè dèy pou tout pèp la. Paske moun ki te tande li yo nan jou sa a te di: “Wa a ap lamante pou fis li a.”<verse eid="2SA 19:2"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="2SA 19:3"/>Konsa, moun yo te antre nan vil la nan jou sa a kòmsi an sekrè tankou yon pèp ki imilye e kouri kache pou kite batay la. <verse eid="2SA 19:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2SA 19:4"/>Wa a te <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">19:4 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2SA 15:30">II Sam 15:30</ref></char></note>kouvri figi li e te kriye fò avèk yon gwo vwa: “O fis mwen, Absalom, O Absalom, fis mwen, fis mwen!”<verse eid="2SA 19:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="2SA 19:5"/>Alò, Joab te antre nan kay la vè wa a. Li te di: “Jodi a, ou te kouvri avèk lawont tout figi a tout sèvitè ou yo, ki, jodi a, te sove lavi ou, lavi a fis ou yo ak fi ou yo, lavi a madanm ou yo ak lavi a ti mennaj ou yo, <verse eid="2SA 19:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2SA 19:6"/>akoz ou te vin renmen sila ki rayi ou yo, e rayi sila ki renmen ou yo. Paske ou te montre nan jou sa a ke prens yo avèk sèvitè ou yo pa anyen a ou menm. Paske mwen vin aprann nan jou sa a ke si Absalom te vivan e nou tout te fin mouri, ke ou ta gen kè kontan. <verse eid="2SA 19:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2SA 19:7"/>Alò, pou sa, leve ale deyò a pou pale pawòl ki dous avèk sèvitè ou yo. Paske mwen sèmante pa SENYÈ a ke si ou pa sòti deyò, anverite, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">19:7 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PRO 14:28">Pwov 14:28</ref></char></note>p ap gen yon moun k ap pase nwit lan avèk ou e sa va pi mal pou ou pase tout lòt mal ki gen tan parèt sou ou soti nan jenès ou jis rive koulye a.”<verse eid="2SA 19:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="2SA 19:8"/>Pou sa, wa a te leve chita nan pòtay la. Lè yo te pale tout pèp la e te di: “Men vwala, wa a chita nan pòtay la,” alò, tout pèp la te vini devan wa a. Alò, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">19:8 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2SA 18:17">II Sam 18:17</ref></char></note>Israël te fin sove ale, chak moun nan pwòp tant pa yo. <verse eid="2SA 19:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2SA 19:9"/>Tout pèp la t ap fè kont pami tout tribi Israël yo, e t ap di: <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">19:9 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2SA 8:1-14">II Sam 8:1-14</ref></char></note>“Wa a te delivre nou soti nan men a lènmi nou yo e te sove nou soti nan men a Filisten yo; men koulye a, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">19:9 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2SA 15:14">II Sam 15:14</ref></char></note>li gen tan sove ale kite peyi a devan Absalom. <verse eid="2SA 19:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2SA 19:10"/>Malgre sa, Absalom, ke nou te onksyone sou nou an, te mouri nan batay la. Alò, pou sa, poukisa nou rete san pale nan afè mennen wa a fè l tounen an?”<verse eid="2SA 19:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="2SA 19:11"/>Epi Wa David te voye kote Tsadok ak Abiathar, prèt yo, e te di: “Pale avèk ansyen Juda yo e di: ‘Poukisa se nou ki dènye pou mennen fè wa a tounen lakay li a, depi pawòl a tout Israël la gen tan rive vè wa a, menm kote lakay li? <verse eid="2SA 19:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2SA 19:12"/>Nou menm se frè m; <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">19:12 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2SA 5:1">II Sam 5:1</ref></char></note>nou se zo a zo mwen e chè a chè mwen. Poukisa konsa nou ta dwe dènye pou mennen wa a fè l tounen?’ <verse eid="2SA 19:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2SA 19:13"/>Di Amasa: ‘Èske ou pa zo a zo mwen e chè a chè mwen? Ke Bondye ta fè sa pou mwen e menm plis si se pa ou menm ki va chèf lame devan mwen nèt <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">19:13 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2SA 3:27-39">II Sam 3:27-39</ref></char></note>nan plas Joab.’” <verse eid="2SA 19:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2SA 19:14"/>Konsa, li te vire kè tout mesye Juda yo <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">19:14 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JDG 20:1">Jij 20:1</ref></char></note>tankou se te yon sèl moun, jiskaske yo te voye vè wa a e te di: “Retounen, ou menm avèk tout sèvitè ou yo.”<verse eid="2SA 19:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="2SA 19:15"/>Alò, wa a te retounen e te vin jis nan Rivyè Jourdain an. Epi Juda te vini <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">19:15 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOS 5:9">Jos 5:9</ref></char></note>Guilgal pou rankontre wa a, pou mennen wa a travèse Jourdain an. <verse eid="2SA 19:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2SA 19:16"/>Epi <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">19:16 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2SA 16:5-13">II Sam 16:5-13</ref></char></note>Schimeï, fis a Guéra a, Benjamit ki sòti Bachurim nan te fè vit vin desann avèk mesye Juda yo pou rankontre Wa David. <verse eid="2SA 19:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2SA 19:17"/>Te gen mil mesye Benjamin avèk li, avèk <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">19:17 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2SA 16:1-4">II Sam 16:1-4</ref></char></note>Tsiba, sèvitè lakay Saül la, kenz fis li yo avèk ven sèvitè yo avèk li; epi yo te prese rive nan Jourdain an avan wa a. <verse eid="2SA 19:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2SA 19:18"/>Alò, yo te kontinye travèse kote pou janbe a pou fè travèse fanmi a wa a; epi pou fè sa ki bon nan zye li.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2SA 19:18">Epi Schimeï, fis a Guéra a te tonbe ba devan wa a pandan li t ap prepare pou travèse Jourdain an. <verse eid="2SA 19:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="2SA 19:19"/>Konsa, li te di a wa a: <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">19:19 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1SA 22:15">I Sam 22:15</ref></char></note>“Pa kite mèt mwen konsidere mwen kòm koupab, ni sonje mal ke sèvitè ou te fè nan jou lè mèt mwen an, wa a, te sòti Jérusalem, pou wa a ta pran sa a kè. <verse eid="2SA 19:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="2SA 19:20"/>Paske sèvitè ou konnen ke mwen te peche. Pou sa, gade byen, mwen te rive la jodi a, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">19:20 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2SA 16:5">II Sam 16:5</ref></char></note>premyèman nan tout kay Joseph la pou ale desann rankontre mèt mwen an, wa a.”<verse eid="2SA 19:20"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="2SA 19:21"/>Men Abischaï, fis a Tseurja a te di: “Èske Schimeï pa ta dwe mete a lanmò pou sa, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">19:21 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 22:28">Egz 22:28</ref></char></note>akoz li te modi onksyone a SENYÈ a?”<verse eid="2SA 19:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="2SA 19:22"/>Epi David te di: “Kisa mwen gen pou fè avèk nou, O fis a Tseruja yo, pou nou ta nan jou sila a devni advèsè mwen? <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">19:22 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1SA 11:13">I Sam 11:13</ref></char></note>Èske okenn moun ta mete a lanmò an Israël jodi a?” Paske èske mwen pa konnen ke se mwen ki wa sou Israël jodi a? <verse eid="2SA 19:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="2SA 19:23"/>Wa a te di a Schimeï: <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">19:23 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1KI 2:8">I Wa 2:8</ref></char></note>“Ou p ap mouri.” Konsa wa a te sèmante a li menm.<verse eid="2SA 19:23"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="2SA 19:24"/>Epi<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">19:24 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2SA 9:6-10">II Sam 9:6-10</ref></char></note>Méphiboscheth, fis a Saül la te desann rankontre wa a. Li pa t okipe pye li, ni taye moustach li, ni lave rad li, depi wa a te pati a jis rive jou ke li te retounen lakay li anpè a. <verse eid="2SA 19:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="2SA 19:25"/>Se te lè li te vini Jérusalem pou rankontre wa a ke wa a te di li: <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">19:25 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2SA 16:17">II Sam 16:17</ref></char></note>“Poukisa ou pa t ale avè m, Méphiboscheth?”<verse eid="2SA 19:25"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="2SA 19:26"/>Konsa, li te reponn: “O mèt mwen, wa a, sèvitè mwen an te twonpe m. Paske sèvitè ou a te di: ‘Mwen va sele yon bourik pou mwen menm pou m kab monte sou li pou ale avèk wa a,’ <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">19:26 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2SA 9:3">II Sam 9:3</ref></char></note>akoz sèvitè ou a bwete. <verse eid="2SA 19:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="2SA 19:27"/>Anplis, li te pale vye bagay a sèvitè ou a mèt mwen, wa a, men mèt mwen an, wa a, se <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">19:27 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2SA 14:17-20">II Sam 14:17-20</ref></char></note>tankou zanj Bondye a. Pou sa, fè sa ki bon nan zye ou. <verse eid="2SA 19:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="2SA 19:28"/>Paske tout manm lakay papa m pa t plis ke moun mouri devan mèt mwen an, wa a. <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">19:28 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2SA 9:7-13">II Sam 9:7-13</ref></char></note>Malgre ou te mete sèvitè ou pami sila ki te manje sou pwòp tab pa ou. Ki dwa mwen gen pou m ta plenyen anplis a wa a?”<verse eid="2SA 19:28"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="2SA 19:29"/>Konsa, wa a te di li: “Poukisa ou pale toujou nan enterè pa w? Mwen gen tan pran desizyon, ‘Ou avèk Ziba va divize tè a.’” <verse eid="2SA 19:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="2SA 19:30"/>Méphiboscheth te di a wa a: “Kite li menm vin pran tout pou li menm, akoz mèt mwen, wa a, gen tan retounen nan pwòp kay li.”<verse eid="2SA 19:30"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="2SA 19:31"/>Alò <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">19:31 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2SA 17:27-29">II Sam 17:27-29</ref></char></note>Barzillaï, Gadit la te vin desann soti Roguelim e li te ale nan Jourdain an avèk wa a pou akonpanye li travèse Jourdain an. <verse eid="2SA 19:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="2SA 19:32"/>Alò, Barzillaï te granmoun anpil, avèk laj a katre-ventan. Li te bay soutyen a wa a pandan li te rete Mahanaïm, paske li te yon nonm byen enpòtan. <verse eid="2SA 19:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="2SA 19:33"/>Wa a te di a Barzillaï: “Vin travèse avèk mwen e mwen va ba ou soutyen Jérusalem bò kote mwen.”<verse eid="2SA 19:33"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="2SA 19:34"/>Men Barzillaï te di a wa a: <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">19:34 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 47:8">Jen 47:8</ref></char></note>“Se pou konbyen de tan ke m ap viv toujou pou m ta monte ak wa a Jérusalem? <verse eid="2SA 19:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="2SA 19:35"/>Mwen menm, koulye a, mwen nan <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">19:35 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 90:10">Sòm 90:10</ref></char></note>katre-ventan daj. Èske mwen kapab distenge antre sa ki bon ak sa ki mal? Oswa èske sèvitè ou a kapab goute sa ke m manje, oswa sa ke m bwè? Oswa èske mwen kapab ankò tande vwa lè gason ak fi ap chante? Alò, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">19:35 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2SA 15:33">II Sam 15:33</ref></char></note>poukisa sèvitè ou ta dwe devni yon chaj anplis a mèt mwen an, wa a? <verse eid="2SA 19:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="2SA 19:36"/>Sèvitè ou ta sèlman pito travèse Jourdain an avèk wa a. Poukisa wa a ta dwe ban m rekonpans avèk byenfezans sila a? <verse eid="2SA 19:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="2SA 19:37"/>Souple, kite sèvitè ou retounen, pou m kab mouri nan pwòp vil pa m, toupre tonm a papa m avèk manman m. Malgre sa, men sèvitè ou, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">19:37 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1KI 2:7">I Wa 2:7</ref></char></note>Kimham; kite li travèse avèk mèt mwen an, wa a e fè pou li sa ki bon nan zye ou.”<verse eid="2SA 19:37"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="2SA 19:38"/>Wa a te reponn: “Kimham va travèse avè m e mwen va fè pou li sa ki bon nan zye pa w. Nenpòt sa ke ou vle m fè m ap fè l pou ou.”<verse eid="2SA 19:38"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="2SA 19:39"/>Tout moun yo te travèse Jourdain an e wa a te travèse tou. Epi wa a te <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">19:39 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="RUT 1:14">Rt 1:14</ref></char></note>bo Barzillaï. Li te beni li e li te retounen nan plas li. <verse eid="2SA 19:39"/><verse number="40" style="v" sid="2SA 19:40"/>Koulye a, wa a te avanse rive Guilgal, Kimham te kontinye avèk li. Epi tout pèp Juda a avèk <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">19:40 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2SA 19:9-10">II Sam 19:9-10</ref></char></note>la mwatye nan pèp Israël la te akonpanye wa a. <verse eid="2SA 19:40"/><verse number="41" style="v" sid="2SA 19:41"/>Epi vwala, tout mesye Israël yo te vin kote wa a e te di a wa a: <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">19:41 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2SA 19:11-12">II Sam 19:11-12</ref></char></note>“Poukisa frè nou yo, mesye Juda yo te vin vòlè ou? Yo te pati avè w, yo te mennen wa a avèk tout lakay li ak tout mesye David yo avèk li, vin janbe Jourdain an.”<verse eid="2SA 19:41"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="2SA 19:42"/>Epi tout mesye Juda yo te reponn mesye Israël yo: “Akoz <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">19:42 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2SA 19:12">II Sam 19:12</ref></char></note>wa a toupre fanmi a nou. Poukisa konsa nou vin fache akoz afè sila a? Èske nou te manje yon bagay sou kont a wa a, oubyen èske yon bagay te vin separe bannou?”<verse eid="2SA 19:42"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="2SA 19:43"/>Men mesye Israël yo te reponn mesye Juda yo e te di: <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">19:43 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2SA 5:1">II Sam 5:1</ref></char></note>“Nou gen dis pati nan wa a; pou sa, nou osi gen plis pati nan David pase ou! Poukisa konsa, ou vin meprize nou? Èske se pa t konsèy pa nou premyèman pou fè wa a tounen?” Men pawòl a Juda yo te pi rèd pase pawòl a Israël yo.<verse eid="2SA 19:43"/></para>
  <chapter eid="2SA 19"/>
  <chapter number="20" style="c" sid="2SA 20"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2SA 20:1"/>Alò, te gen yon <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">20:1 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2SA 16:7">II Sam 16:7</ref></char></note>sanzave ki te la ki te rele Schéba, fis a Bicri, yon Benjamit. Konsa, li te soufle twonpèt la e te di: <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">20:1 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1KI 12:16">I Wa 12:16</ref></char></note>“Nou pa gen anyen nan David, ni nou pa gen eritaj nan fis Jesse a. Tout moun rive nan tant pa li yo, O Israël!”<verse eid="2SA 20:1"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="2SA 20:2"/>Konsa, tout mesye Israël yo te sispann swiv David, e yo te swiv Schéba, fis a Bicri a. Men mesye Juda yo te rete lwayal a wa pa yo a, soti nan Jourdain an, jis rive Jérusalem.<verse eid="2SA 20:2"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="2SA 20:3"/>David te rive kote lakay li Jérusalem. Epi <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">20:3 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2SA 15:16">II Sam 15:16</ref></char></note>wa a te pran dis fanm sa yo, ti mennaj ke li te kite pou okipe kay la. Li te mete yo sou siveyans e te bay yo manje, men li pa t antre nan yo. Konsa, yo te rete fèmen jis rive jou ke yo te mouri an e te viv tankou vèv.<verse eid="2SA 20:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="2SA 20:4"/>Alò, wa a te di a <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">20:4 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2SA 17:25">II Sam 17:25</ref></char></note>Amasa: “Rele fè sòti pou mwen mesye Juda yo avan twa jou e ou menm, vin prezan isit la.”<verse eid="2SA 20:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="2SA 20:5"/>Konsa, Amasa te ale rele mesye Juda yo, men li te <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">20:5 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1SA 13:8">I Sam 13:8</ref></char></note>pran reta plis tan ke li te dwe pran an. <verse eid="2SA 20:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2SA 20:6"/>Epi David te di a <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">20:6 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2SA 21:17">II Sam 21:17</ref></char></note>Abischaï: “Koulye a Schéba, fis a Bicri a, va fè nou plis mal ke Absalom. Pran sèvitè mèt ou yo e kouri dèyè li, pou li pa twouve pou kont li vil ki ranfòse pou chape devan zye nou.”<verse eid="2SA 20:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="2SA 20:7"/>Konsa, mesye Abischaï yo te sòti dèyè li, ansanm avèk Keretyen yo, Peletyen yo ak tout mesye vanyan yo. Epi yo te kite Jérusalem pou kouri dèyè Schéba, fis a Bicri a. <verse eid="2SA 20:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2SA 20:8"/>Lè yo te la nan gwo wòch ki <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">20:8 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2SA 2:13">II Sam 2:13</ref></char></note>Gabaon an, Amasa te vin rankontre yo. Alò Joab te abiye an vètman militè e sou li, te gen yon sentiwon avèk yon nepe nan fouwo li ki te tache nan senti li; epi pandan li t ap avanse, nepe a te vin tonbe parèt. <verse eid="2SA 20:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2SA 20:9"/>Joab te di Amasa: “Èske sa byen avèk ou, frè m?” Epi <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">20:9 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 26:49">Mat 26:49</ref></char></note>Joab te kenbe Amasa pa bab li avèk men dwat pou bo li. <verse eid="2SA 20:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2SA 20:10"/>Men Amasa pa t veye kont nepe ki te nan men Joab la. Konsa, li te <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">20:10 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2SA 2:23">II Sam 2:23</ref></char></note>frape li nan vant avèk li e zantray li te vide tonbe atè e san frape l ankò, li te mouri. Alò Joab avèk Abischaï, frè li a, te kouri dèyè Schéba, fis a Bicri a. <verse eid="2SA 20:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2SA 20:11"/>Alò, akote li, te kanpe youn nan jennonm a Joab yo, ki te di: “Nenpòt moun ki pou Joab e nenpòt moun ki pou David, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">20:11 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2SA 20:13">II Sam 20:13</ref></char></note>kite li swiv Joab.”<verse eid="2SA 20:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="2SA 20:12"/>Men Amasa te kouche tòde vire nan san li nan mitan granchemen an. Epi lè nonm nan te wè ke tout moun te kanpe, li te deplase Amasa soti nan granchemen an rive nan chan an e li te jete yon vètman sou li lè li te wè ke tout moun ki te pase kote li te vin kanpe. <verse eid="2SA 20:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2SA 20:13"/>Depi li te rete sou granchemen an, tout mesye yo te pase ale dèyè Joab pou kouri dèyè Schéba, fis a Bicri a. <verse eid="2SA 20:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2SA 20:14"/>Alò, li te pase nan tout tribi Israël yo jis rive Abel, menm jis nan Beth-Maaca ak tout Berit yo. Yo te rasanble ansanm pou te ale dèyè li tou. <verse eid="2SA 20:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2SA 20:15"/>Yo te vin fè syèj sou li nan Abel Beth-Maaca. <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">20:15 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2KI 19:32">II Wa 19:32</ref></char></note>Yo te monte yon ran syèj kont vil la. Li te kanpe rive nan mi ranpa e tout moun ki te avèk Joab yo t ap kraze pou yo fè mi an tonbe.<verse eid="2SA 20:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="2SA 20:16"/>Epi yon fanm lespri te rele soti nan vil la: “Koute, koute! Souple di Joab: ‘Vin isit la pou m kab pale avèk ou.’ Koute pawòl a sèvant ou an.” Epi li te reponn: “M ap koute.” <verse eid="2SA 20:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2SA 20:17"/>Konsa, li te pwoche li e fanm nan te di: “Èske se Joab ke ou ye?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2SA 20:17">Epi li te reponn: “Se mwen”.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2SA 20:17">Alò, li te di li: “Koute pawòl a sèvant ou an.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2SA 20:17">Epi li te reponn: “M ap koute.” <verse eid="2SA 20:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2SA 20:18"/>Epi li te pale e te di: “Lontan yo te konn di: ‘Yo va anverite mande konsèy nan Abel,’ e se konsa, yo te rezoud pwoblèm nan. <verse eid="2SA 20:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="2SA 20:19"/>Mwen pami sila ki pezib e fidèl an Israël yo. W ap chache detwi yon vil, menm yon manman an Israël. Poukisa ou ta anglouti tout eritaj SENYÈ a?”<verse eid="2SA 20:19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="2SA 20:20"/>Joab te reponn: “Lwen de sa, lwen de mwen pou mwen ta anglouti, oswa detwi! <verse eid="2SA 20:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="2SA 20:21"/>Se pa konsa ka a ye! Men yon nonm soti nan peyi ti mòn Ephraïm nan, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">20:21 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2SA 20:2">II Sam 20:2</ref></char></note> Schéba, fis a Bicri a, selon non li, li te leve men li kont Wa David. Sèlman, lonje bannou li e mwen va kite vil la.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2SA 20:21">Epi fanm nan te di a Joab: “Gade byen, se tèt li m ap jete ba ou sou mi an.”<verse eid="2SA 20:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="2SA 20:22"/>Alò, fanm lespri a te vin kote tout pèp la. Epi yo te koupe tèt a<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">20:22 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2SA 20:1">II Sam 20:1</ref></char></note>Schéba, fis Bicri a e te jete li bay Joab. Konsa, li te soufle twonpèt la e yo te lèse kite vil la. Chak moun te ale kote tant pa yo. Joab, anplis, te retounen kote wa a Jérusalem.<verse eid="2SA 20:22"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="2SA 20:23"/>
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">20:23 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="2SA 8:16-18">II Sam 8:16-18</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Alò, Joab te sou tèt tout lame Israël la e Benaja, fis a Jehojada a te sou Keretyen yo avèk Peletyen yo; <verse eid="2SA 20:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="2SA 20:24"/>epi Adoram te sou travay fòse a e <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">20:24 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1KI 4:3">I Wa 4:3</ref></char></note>Josaphat, fis a Achilud la te grefye a; <verse eid="2SA 20:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="2SA 20:25"/>epi Scheja te sekretè a e Tsadok avèk <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">20:25 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1KI 4:4">I Wa 4:4</ref></char></note>Abiathar te prèt; <verse eid="2SA 20:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="2SA 20:26"/>epi Ira, Jayirit la te yon prèt osi pou David.<verse eid="2SA 20:26"/></para>
  <chapter eid="2SA 20"/>
  <chapter number="21" style="c" sid="2SA 21"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2SA 21:1"/>Alò, te gen yon gwo grangou nan jou a David yo pandan twazan, ane apre ane. Epi <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">21:1 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NUM 27:21">Nonb 27:21</ref></char></note>David te chache prezans a SENYÈ a. SENYÈ a te di: “Se akoz Saül ak kay sanglan li an, akoz li te mete Gabawonit yo a lanmò.”<verse eid="2SA 21:1"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="2SA 21:2"/>Pou sa, wa a te rele Gabawonit yo pou te pale yo. (Alò, Gabawonit yo pa t nan fis Israël yo men yo te nan retay Amoreyen yo e <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">21:2 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOS 9:3-20">Jos 9:3-20</ref></char></note>fis Israël yo te fè yon akò avèk yo. Men Saül te chache touye yo nan zèl li genyen pou fis a Juda yo avèk Israël yo.) <verse eid="2SA 21:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2SA 21:3"/>Konsa, David te di a Gabawonit yo: “Kisa mwen ta dwe fè pou nou? Epi kijan mwen kapab fè ekspiyasyon, pou nou kapab vin beni <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">21:3 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1SA 26:19">I Sam 26:19</ref></char></note>eritaj SENYÈ a?”<verse eid="2SA 21:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="2SA 21:4"/>Alò, Gabawonit yo te di li: <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">21:4 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NUM 35:31-32">Nonb 35:31-32</ref> </char></note>“Nou pa sou afè ajan, ni lò avèk Saül, ni lakay li, ni pou nou ta mete okenn moun a lanmò an Israël.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2SA 21:4">Epi li te di: “Mwen va fè pou nou nenpòt sa ke nou mande.”<verse eid="2SA 21:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="2SA 21:5"/>Pou sa, yo te di a wa a: <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">21:5 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2SA 21:1">II Sam 21:1</ref> </char></note>“Nonm ki te vin manje nou an e ki te fè plan pou detwi nou nèt la rache nou soti nan lizyè Israël la, <verse eid="2SA 21:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2SA 21:6"/>kite sèt mesye soti nan fis li yo vin bay a nou menm. E nou va pann yo devan SENYÈ a nan Guibea pou Saül, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">21:6 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1SA 10:24">I Sam 10:24</ref> </char></note>sila ki te chwazi pa SENYÈ a.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2SA 21:6">Epi wa a te di: “Mwen va bay yo.”<verse eid="2SA 21:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="2SA 21:7"/>Men wa a te bay pwotèj a Méphiboscheth, fis a Jonathan an, fis a Saül la, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">21:7 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1SA 20:12-17">I Sam 20:12-17</ref></char></note>akoz sèman a SENYÈ a ki te fèt antre yo, antre David ak fis a Saül la, Jonathan. <verse eid="2SA 21:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2SA 21:8"/>Konsa, wa a te pran de fis a Ritspa yo avèk fi a Ajja a, Armoni ak Méphiboscheth ke li te fè pou Saül la, senk fis a Mérab yo, fi a Saül la, ke li te fè pou Adriel, fis a Barzillaï a, Meyolayit la; <verse eid="2SA 21:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2SA 21:9"/>Epi li te livre yo nan men a Gabawonit yo e yo te pandye yo nan mòn nan devan SENYÈ a, jiskaske yo sèt te tonbe ansanm. Yo te mete a lanmò nan premye jou a rekòlt la, nan <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">21:9 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 9:31-32">Egz 9:31-32</ref></char></note>kòmansman rekòlt lòj la.<verse eid="2SA 21:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="2SA 21:10"/>
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">21:10 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="DEU 21:23">Det 21:23</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Epi Rizpa, fi a Ajja a te pran twal sak e te ouvri li sou wòch la, soti nan kòmansman rekòlt la jiskaske li te fè lapli sou yo soti nan syèl la. <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">21:10 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1SA 17:44-46">I Sam 17:44-46</ref></char></note>Li pa t kite ni zwazo syèl yo vin poze sou yo nan lajounen, ni bèt chan yo pandan lannwit. <verse eid="2SA 21:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2SA 21:11"/>Lè li te pale a David sa ke Rizpa, fi a Ajja a, ti mennaj a Saül la te fè a, <verse eid="2SA 21:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2SA 21:12"/>alò, David te ale pran <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">21:12 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1SA 31:11-13">I Sam 31:11-13</ref></char></note>zo a Saül ak zo a Jonathan, fis li a soti nan men a mesye Jabès-Galaad la, ki te vòlè yo nan laplas Beth-Schan kote Filisten yo te pandye yo nan jou ke Filisten yo te frape Saül nan Guilboa a. <verse eid="2SA 21:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2SA 21:13"/>Li te mennen zo a Saül ak zo a Jonathan yo monte, fis li soti la e yo te ranmase zo a sila ki te pandye yo. <verse eid="2SA 21:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2SA 21:14"/>Yo te antere zo a Saül yo avèk Jonathan, fis li nan peyi Benjamin nan <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">21:14 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOS 18:28">Jos 18:28</ref></char></note>Tséla, nan tonm a Kis, papa li. Konsa, yo te fè tout sa ke wa a te kòmande yo. Apre sa, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">21:14 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2SA 24:25">II Sam 24:25</ref></char></note>Bondye te satisfè akoz lapriyè pou peyi a.<verse eid="2SA 21:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="2SA 21:15"/>Alò, lè <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">21:15 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2SA 5:17-25">II Sam 5:17-25</ref></char></note>Filisten yo te fè lagè ankò avèk Israël, David te desann avèk sèvitè li yo. Epi pandan yo t ap goumen kont Filisten yo, David te vin bouke. <verse eid="2SA 21:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2SA 21:16"/>Epi Jischbi-Benob ki te <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">21:16 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NUM 13:22-28">Nonb 13:22-28</ref></char></note>pami desandan a jeyan yo, avèk yon lans ki te peze twa-san sik an bwonz, te gen yon nepe nèf nan senti l e li te gen entansyon pou l ta touye David. <verse eid="2SA 21:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2SA 21:17"/>Men <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">21:17 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2SA 20:6-10">II Sam 20:6-10</ref></char></note>Abischaï, fis a Tseruja a te ede li, li te frape Filisten an pou te touye li. Epi mesye David yo te fè ve a li e te di: “Wa David, ou p ap sòti avèk nou ankò nan batay la pou ou pa vin etenn lanp Israël la.”<verse eid="2SA 21:17"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="2SA 21:18"/>
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">21:18 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="1CH 20:4-8">I Kwo 20:4-8</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Alò, li te vin rive apre sa ke te gen lagè ankò avèk Filisten yo nan Gob. Epi Sibbecaï, Oushatit la te frape Saph, ki te pami desandan a jeyan yo. <verse eid="2SA 21:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="2SA 21:19"/>Te gen gè avèk Filisten yo ankò Gob e Elchanan, fis a Jaaré-Oreguim nan Bethléhem te touye Goliath, moun Gath la. <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">21:19 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1SA 17:7">I Sam 17:7</ref></char></note>Shaf lans li an te tankou travès lan a yon machin yo konn tise. <verse eid="2SA 21:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="2SA 21:20"/>Te gen lagè avèk Gath ankò, kote te gen yon mesye gran tay avèk sis dwèt nan chak men ak sis zòtèy nan chak pye, venn-kat antou. Li menm osi te ne de <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">21:20 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2SA 21:16-18">II Sam 21:16-18</ref></char></note>jeyan yo. <verse eid="2SA 21:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="2SA 21:21"/>Lè li te leve tèt li kont Israël, Jonathan, fis a Schimea a, frè David la, te frape li. <verse eid="2SA 21:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="2SA 21:22"/>Se <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">21:22 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1CH 20:8">I Kwo 20:8</ref></char></note>kat sila yo ki te ne de jeyan nan Gath yo, e yo te tonbe pa men David e pa men a sèvitè li yo.<verse eid="2SA 21:22"/></para>
  <chapter eid="2SA 21"/>
  <chapter number="22" style="c" sid="2SA 22"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2SA 22:1"/>David te pale pawòl a chan sila yo<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">22:1 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 18:2-50">Sòm 18:2-50</ref></char></note>a SENYÈ a nan jou ke SENYÈ a te delivre li soti nan men a tout lènmi li yo ak nan men a Saül. <verse eid="2SA 22:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2SA 22:2"/>Li te di:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="2SA 22:2">
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">22:2 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="PSA 31:3">Sòm 31:3</ref> </char>
    </note>“SENYÈ a se wòch mwen,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="2SA 22:2">
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">22:2 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="PSA 31:3">Sòm 31:3</ref> </char>
    </note>fòterès mwen ak liberatè mwen;<verse eid="2SA 22:2"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="2SA 22:3"/>Bondye mwen an, wòch mwen an, nan sila</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="2SA 22:3">mwen twouve pwotèj la;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="2SA 22:3">boukliye e kòn delivrans mwen,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="2SA 22:3">sitadèl mwen ak refij mwen.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="2SA 22:3">
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">22:3 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="DEU 32:4-37">Det 32:4-37</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Se konsa mwen va sove devan ledmi mwen yo.<verse eid="2SA 22:3"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="2SA 22:4"/>Mwen rele a SENYÈ a, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">22:4 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 48:1">Sòm 48:1</ref></char></note>ki merite lwanj.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="2SA 22:4">Se konsa mwen sove de lènmi mwen yo.<verse eid="2SA 22:4"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="2SA 22:5"/>Paske <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">22:5 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 93:4">Sòm 93:4</ref></char></note>volas lanmò te antoure mwen;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="2SA 22:5">gran flèv destriksyon yo te monte sou mwen nèt.<verse eid="2SA 22:5"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="2SA 22:6"/>
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">22:6 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="PSA 116:3">Sòm 116:3</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Kòd a sejou lanmò te antoure mwen;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="2SA 22:6">pèlen lanmò yo te menase m.<verse eid="2SA 22:6"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="2SA 22:7"/>
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">22:7 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="PSA 116:4">Sòm 116:4</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Nan gran twoub mwen,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="2SA 22:7">mwen te rele SENYÈ a.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="2SA 22:7">Wi, mwen te rele a Bondye mwen an.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="2SA 22:7">Soti nan tanp Li an, Li te tande vwa m.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="2SA 22:7">Kri sekou mwen te anndan zòrèy Li.<verse eid="2SA 22:7"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="2SA 22:8"/>Latè te tranble e souke.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="2SA 22:8">
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">22:8 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JOB 26:11">Job 26:11</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Fondasyon syèl la t ap tranble.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="2SA 22:8">Yo te sombre, akoz Li te fache.<verse eid="2SA 22:8"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="2SA 22:9"/>Lafimen te monte sòti nan nen L.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="2SA 22:9">
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">22:9 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="PSA 97:3">Sòm 97:3</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Dife soti nan bouch Li a te devore.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="2SA 22:9">Chabon te fèt pa li.<verse eid="2SA 22:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="2SA 22:10"/>Anplis, Li te rale bese syèl yo e te desann.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="2SA 22:10">Yon <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">22:10 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 97:2">Sòm 97:2</ref></char></note>tenèb byen pwès te anba pye L yo.<verse eid="2SA 22:10"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="2SA 22:11"/>Li te monte sou yon cheriben,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="2SA 22:11">Li te vole.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="2SA 22:11">Li te parèt sou <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">22:11 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 104:3">Sòm 104:3</ref></char></note>zèl a van an.<verse eid="2SA 22:11"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="2SA 22:12"/>
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">22:12 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JOB 36:29">Job 36:29</ref> </char>
    </note> Li te fè tenèb la yon tant Ki antoure Li,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="2SA 22:12">yon vwa dlo, nwaj pwès syèl yo<verse eid="2SA 22:12"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="2SA 22:13"/>soti nan gran klète devan L,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="2SA 22:13">
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">22:13 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="2SA 22:9">II Sam 22:9</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Bout chabon dife yo vin limen.<verse eid="2SA 22:13"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="2SA 22:14"/>SENYÈ a te <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">22:14 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOB 37:2-5">Job 37:2-5</ref></char></note>eklate depi nan syèl la,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="2SA 22:14">e vwa Pli Wo a te reponn.<verse eid="2SA 22:14"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="2SA 22:15"/>Li te lanse <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">22:15 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 32:23">Det 32:23</ref></char></note>flèch pou te gaye yo.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="2SA 22:15">Loray! E yo te sove ale.<verse eid="2SA 22:15"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="2SA 22:16"/>Kanal lanmè yo te vin parèt.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="2SA 22:16">Fondasyon mond lan<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">22:16 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 15:8">Egz 15:8</ref> </char></note> te dekouvri nèt,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="2SA 22:16">pa repwoch SENYÈ a,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="2SA 22:16">ak fòs vann a ki soti nan ne l.<verse eid="2SA 22:16"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="2SA 22:17"/>
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">22:17 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="PSA 144:7">Sòm 144:7</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Li te voye soti anwo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="2SA 22:17">Li te pran m.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="2SA 22:17">Li te rale mwen sòti nan pil dlo yo.<verse eid="2SA 22:17"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="2SA 22:18"/>Li te delivre mwen devan lènmi m byen fò,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="2SA 22:18">Soti nan sila ki te rayi mwen yo.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="2SA 22:18">Paske yo te twò fò pou mwen.<verse eid="2SA 22:18"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="2SA 22:19"/>Yo te kanpe parèt devan m nan jou gran doulè a,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="2SA 22:19">
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">22:19 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="PSA 23:4">Sòm 23:4</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Men SENYÈ a te soutyen mwen.<verse eid="2SA 22:19"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="2SA 22:20"/>Anplis, Li te mennen m nan yon kote byen laj.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="2SA 22:20">Li te fè m chape, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">22:20 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2SA 15:26">II Sam 15:26</ref></char></note>paske Li te kontan anpil avè m.<verse eid="2SA 22:20"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="2SA 22:21"/>
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">22:21 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="1SA 26:23">I Sam 26:23</ref>
      </char>
    </note>SENYÈ a te rekonpanse mwen selon ladwati mwen.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="2SA 22:21">Selon men pwòp mwen, Li te fè m twouve rekonpans.<verse eid="2SA 22:21"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="2SA 22:22"/>Paske mwen te kenbe chemen SENYÈ a.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="2SA 22:22">Mwen pa t aji avèk mechanste kont Bondye mwen an.<verse eid="2SA 22:22"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="2SA 22:23"/>
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">22:23 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="DEU 6:6-9">Det 6:6-9</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Paske tout òdonans Li yo te devan m.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="2SA 22:23">Règleman Li yo, mwen pa t janm kite.<verse eid="2SA 22:23"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="2SA 22:24"/>Anplis, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">22:24 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EPH 1:4">Ef 1:4</ref></char></note>mwen te san fot devan L.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="2SA 22:24">Mwen te rete lib de inikite mwen.<verse eid="2SA 22:24"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="2SA 22:25"/>Pou sa, SENYÈ a te rekonpanse m.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="2SA 22:25">
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">22:25 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="2SA 22:21">II Sam 22:21</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Selon ladwati mwen,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="2SA 22:25">Selon jan mwen pwòp devan zye Li.<verse eid="2SA 22:25"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="2SA 22:26"/>
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">22:26 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="MAT 5:7">Mat 5:7</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Avèk sila de bon kè yo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="2SA 22:26">Ou montre bon kè Ou.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="2SA 22:26">Avèk sila ki san fot yo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="2SA 22:26">Ou parèt san fot.<verse eid="2SA 22:26"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="2SA 22:27"/>
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">22:27 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="MAT 5:8">Mat 5:8</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Avèk sila ki san tach yo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="2SA 22:27">Ou montre jan Ou san tach,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="2SA 22:27">Epi avèk sila ki kwochi,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="2SA 22:27">Ou vin parèt avèk entèlijans.<verse eid="2SA 22:27"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="2SA 22:28"/>
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">22:28 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="EXO 3:7-8">Egz 3:7-8</ref>
      </char>
    </note> Ou fè sekou a sila ki aflije yo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="2SA 22:28">men zye Ou rete sou sila ki ògeye yo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="2SA 22:28">pou Ou fè yo bese.<verse eid="2SA 22:28"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="2SA 22:29"/>Paske se ou ki lanp mwen, O SENYÈ.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="2SA 22:29">Konsa, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">22:29 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1KI 11:36">I Wa 11:36</ref></char></note>SENYÈ a vin klere tout tenèb mwen.<verse eid="2SA 22:29"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="2SA 22:30"/>Paske avèk Ou, Mwen kapab kouri sou yon ekip sòlda.<verse eid="2SA 22:30"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="2SA 22:31"/>
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">22:31 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="DEU 32:4">Det 32:4</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Pou Bondye, chemen pa li a san fot.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="2SA 22:31">Pawòl SENYÈ a fin fè prèv.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="2SA 22:31">Li pwoteje tout sila yo ki kache nan Li.<verse eid="2SA 22:31"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="2SA 22:32"/>
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">22:32 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="1SA 2:2">I Sam 2:2</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Paske se kilès Bondye ye,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="2SA 22:32">Sof ke SENYÈ a?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="2SA 22:32">Epi kilès ki se yon woche,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="2SA 22:32">Sof ke Bondye pa nou an?<verse eid="2SA 22:32"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="2SA 22:33"/>
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">22:33 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="1SA 2:2">I Sam 2:2</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Bondye se sitadèl fòs mwen.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="2SA 22:33">Li fè chemen m san fot.<verse eid="2SA 22:33"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="2SA 22:34"/>Li fè pye m tankou pye a sèf,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="2SA 22:34">ki fè m chita nan plas ki wo.<verse eid="2SA 22:34"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="2SA 22:35"/>Li enstwi men m yo pou batay la,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="2SA 22:35">Pou bra mwen kab koube banza fèt an Bwonz.<verse eid="2SA 22:35"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="2SA 22:36"/>Ou te osi ban mwen Boukliye Sali Ou a,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="2SA 22:36">e se soutyen Ou ki fè m pwisan.<verse eid="2SA 22:36"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="2SA 22:37"/>
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">22:37 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="2SA 22:20">II Sam 22:20</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Ou elaji pla pye mwen anba m,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="2SA 22:37">e pye m pa janm chape.<verse eid="2SA 22:37"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="2SA 22:38"/>Mwen te kouri dèyè lènmi mwen yo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="2SA 22:38">e mwen te <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">22:38 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 15:9">Egz 15:9</ref></char></note>detwi yo.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="2SA 22:38">Mwen pa t vire fè bak jiskaske mwen te fin manje nèt.<verse eid="2SA 22:38"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="2SA 22:39"/>Epi mwen te devore yo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="2SA 22:39">mwen te kraze yo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="2SA 22:39">Jiskaske yo pa t janm leve.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="2SA 22:39">Konsa, yo te <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">22:39 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 4:3">Mat 4:3</ref></char></note>tonbe anba pye mwen.<verse eid="2SA 22:39"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="2SA 22:40"/>Paske Ou te kouvri senti m ak fòs pou batay la.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="2SA 22:40">Ou te soumèt anba m <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">22:40 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 44:5">Sòm 44:5</ref></char></note>sila ki te leve kont mwen yo.<verse eid="2SA 22:40"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="2SA 22:41"/>Ou te osi <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">22:41 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 23:27">Egz 23:27</ref></char></note>fè lènmi m yo vire do ban mwen,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="2SA 22:41">Epi mwen te detwi sila ki te rayi mwen yo.<verse eid="2SA 22:41"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="2SA 22:42"/>
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">22:42 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ISA 17:7-8">És 17:7-8</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Yo te gade, men nanpwen moun ki te pou te sove yo;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="2SA 22:42">menm anvè SENYÈ a, men Li pa t reponn yo.<verse eid="2SA 22:42"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="2SA 22:43"/>
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">22:43 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="2KI 13:7">II Wa 13:7</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Alò mwen te fè poud ak yo</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="2SA 22:43">tankou pousyè tè a.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="2SA 22:43">
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">22:43 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ISA 10:6">És 10:6</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Mwen te kraze e te foule yo</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="2SA 22:43">Tankou kras labou lari.<verse eid="2SA 22:43"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="2SA 22:44"/>Ou te osi delivre mwen sòti</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="2SA 22:44">nan rebelyon ak zen pèp mwen an.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="2SA 22:44">Ou te kenbe m kòm chèf sou nasyon yo,<verse eid="2SA 22:44"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="2SA 22:45"/>Etranje yo abese devan m.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="2SA 22:45">Depi yo tande, yo obeyi.<verse eid="2SA 22:45"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="2SA 22:46"/>Etranje yo pèdi fòs.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="2SA 22:46">
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">22:46 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="1SA 14:11">I Sam 14:11</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Yo sòti tranblan nan kote kache yo.<verse eid="2SA 22:46"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="47" style="v" sid="2SA 22:47"/>SENYÈ a vivan!</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="2SA 22:47">Beni, se wòch mwen an!</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="2SA 22:47">Egzalte, se <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">22:47 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2SA 22:3">II Sam 22:3</ref></char></note>Bondye, wòch sali mwen an.<verse eid="2SA 22:47"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="48" style="v" sid="2SA 22:48"/>Menm Bondye ki egzekite vanjans pou mwen an,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="2SA 22:48">
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">22:48 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="PSA 144:2">Sòm 144:2</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Li ki rale fè desann lòt pèp yo anba m nan,<verse eid="2SA 22:48"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="49" style="v" sid="2SA 22:49"/>Ki osi fè m sòti devan lènmi mwen yo.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="2SA 22:49">Wi, Ou menm fè m leve anwo <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">22:49 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 44:5">Sòm 44:5</ref></char></note>sila</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="2SA 22:49">Ki vin leve kont mwen yo.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="2SA 22:49">Ou ban m sekou devan moun ki vyolan yo.<verse eid="2SA 22:49"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="50" style="v" sid="2SA 22:50"/>Pou sa, mwen va ba Ou remèsiman,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="2SA 22:50">O SENYÈ, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">22:50 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ROM 15:9">Wo 15:9</ref></char></note>pami nasyon yo.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="2SA 22:50">Mwen va chante lwanj a non Ou.<verse eid="2SA 22:50"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="51" style="v" sid="2SA 22:51"/>Li se yon gran sitadèl delivrans pou wa Li a,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="2SA 22:51">ki <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">22:51 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 89:24">Sòm 89:24</ref></char></note>montre lanmou dous a onksyone pa Li a,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="2SA 22:51">Menm a <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">22:51 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 144:10">Sòm 144:10</ref></char></note>David avèk desandan pa li yo, jis pou tout tan.”<verse eid="2SA 22:51"/></para>
  <chapter eid="2SA 22"/>
  <chapter number="23" style="c" sid="2SA 23"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2SA 23:1"/>Alò, sila yo se dènye pawòl a David yo.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="2SA 23:1">David, fis a Jesse a deklare,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="2SA 23:1">Mesye ki te leve anwo a deklare,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="2SA 23:1">
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">23:1 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="PSA 89:20">Sòm 89:20</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Sila ki onksyone pa Bondye a Jacob la,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="2SA 23:1">Chantè dous Israël la,<verse eid="2SA 23:1"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="2SA 23:2"/>Nan mwen, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">23:2 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 22:43">Mat 22:43</ref></char></note>Lespri SENYÈ a te pale,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="2SA 23:2">Pawòl pa Li te sou lang mwen.<verse eid="2SA 23:2"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="2SA 23:3"/>Bondye a Israël la te di,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="2SA 23:3">
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">23:3 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="2SA 22:2-32">II Sam 22:2-32</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Wòch Israël la te pale mwen,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="2SA 23:3">Sila ki renye sou lèzòm avèk ladwati Li a,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="2SA 23:3">ki renye avèk lakrent Bondye yo,<verse eid="2SA 23:3"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="2SA 23:4"/>Se tankou <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">23:4 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JDG 5:31">Jij 5:31</ref></char></note>limyè maten lè solèy la leve,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="2SA 23:4">Yon maten san nwaj, lè zèb tounèf</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="2SA 23:4">Vin sòti nan tè a nan solèy apre lapli.<verse eid="2SA 23:4"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="2SA 23:5"/>Vrèman, se pa konsa lakay mwen ye avèk Bondye?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="2SA 23:5">Paske <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">23:5 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2SA 7:12-16">II Sam 7:12-16</ref></char></note>Li te fè yon akò k ap dire nèt avè m,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="2SA 23:5">An lòd nan tout bagay e byen solid.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="2SA 23:5">Pou tout sali mwen avèk tout dezi mwen,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="2SA 23:5">èske, anverite, Li p ap fè l grandi?<verse eid="2SA 23:5"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="2SA 23:6"/>Men <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">23:6 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 13:41">Mat 13:41</ref></char></note>sanzave yo, yo chak va pouse</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="2SA 23:6">jete deyò tankou raje pikan.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="2SA 23:6">Konsa, pèsòn p ap kab pran yo an men.<verse eid="2SA 23:6"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="2SA 23:7"/>Men nonm nan ki touche yo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="2SA 23:7">dwe ame avèk fè ak shaf lans.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="2SA 23:7">Kèlkeswa, yo va vin <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">23:7 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 3:10">Mat 3:10</ref></char></note>brile nèt avèk dife,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="2SA 23:7">nan plas kote yo ye a.<verse eid="2SA 23:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="2SA 23:8"/>Sila yo se <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">23:8 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1CH 11:11">I Kwo 11:11</ref></char></note>non a mesye vanyan ki te pou David yo: Joscheb-Basschébeth, Tachkemonit lan, youn nan ofisye prensipal yo. Avèk lans li ui-sant òm te mouri yon sèl kou yo. <verse eid="2SA 23:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2SA 23:9"/>Apre li menm, se Éléazar, fis a <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">23:9 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1CH 27:4">I Kwo 27:4</ref></char></note>Dodo a, Achochit la. Li te youn nan twa gèrye ki te, ansanm ak David yo, ki te konfwonte Filisten ki te rasanble pou batay yo, lè lòt mesye Israël yo te fè bak yo. <verse eid="2SA 23:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2SA 23:10"/><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">23:10 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1CH 11:13">I Kwo 11:13</ref></char></note>Li te leve frape Filisten yo jiskaske men li te fatige e te kole a nepe a. Konsa, SENYÈ a te fè parèt yon gran viktwa nan jou sa a. Pèp la te swiv li sèlman pou piyaje mò yo. <verse eid="2SA 23:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2SA 23:11"/>Alò, apre li se te Schamma, fis Agué a, yon <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">23:11 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2SA 23:33">II Sam 23:33</ref></char></note>Ararit. Filisten yo te rasanble nan yon ekip kote yon moso tè te plen avèk pwa lantiy e pèp la te kouri devan Filisten yo. <verse eid="2SA 23:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2SA 23:12"/>Men li te kanpe pran pozisyon li nan mitan chan an pou defann tè a. Li te frape Filisten yo; epi <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">23:12 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2SA 23:10">II Sam 23:10</ref></char></note>SENYÈ a te fè vini yon gran viktwa. <verse eid="2SA 23:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2SA 23:13"/>Alò, twa nan trant mesye pifò yo te desann kote David nan tan rekòlt la kote <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">23:13 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1SA 22:1">I Sam 22:1</ref></char></note>kavèn Adullam nan pandan ekip Filisten an t ap fè kan nan <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">23:13 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2SA 5:18">II Sam 5:18</ref> </char></note>vale Rephaïm nan. <verse eid="2SA 23:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2SA 23:14"/>Nan tan sa a, David te la <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">23:14 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1SA 22:4">I Sam 22:4</ref></char></note>nan fò a, pandan ganizon Filisten an te Bethléhem. <verse eid="2SA 23:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2SA 23:15"/><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">23:15 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1CH 11:17">I Kwo 11:17</ref></char></note>David te gen yon anvi, e li te di: “Men kijan mwen ta kontan si yon moun ta ban m dlo pou bwè ki sòti nan pwi Bethléhem akote pòtay la!” <verse eid="2SA 23:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2SA 23:16"/><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">23:16 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1CH 11:18">I Kwo 11:18</ref></char></note>Konsa, twa mesye vanyan sa yo te pete antre nan kan Filisten yo. Yo te rale dlo nan pwi Bethléhem ki te akote pòtay la, e yo te pote li bay David. Malgre sa, li te refize bwè l, men li te vide li bay SENYÈ a. <verse eid="2SA 23:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2SA 23:17"/>Konsa, li te di: “Lwen de mwen O SENYÈ! <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">23:17 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LEV 17:10">Lev 17:10</ref></char></note>Èske m ta bwè san a mesye ki te mete lavi yo nan gwo danje a?” Pou sa, li pa t bwè li. Se zèv sila yo ke twa mesye vanyan sa yo te fè. <verse eid="2SA 23:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2SA 23:18"/><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">23:18 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2SA 10:10-14">II Sam 10:10-14</ref></char></note>Abischaï, frè a Joab la, fis a Tseruja a, te <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">23:18 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1CH 11:20-21">I Kwo 11:20-21</ref></char></note>chèf a trant yo. Li te voye lans li kont twa san moun, li te touye yo, e li te gen yon non ki vin rekonèt menm jan ak twa yo. <verse eid="2SA 23:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="2SA 23:19"/>Li te pi onore pami trant yo. Konsa, li te devni chèf yo. Malgre sa, li pa t rive nan nivo a twa yo. <verse eid="2SA 23:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="2SA 23:20"/>Alò, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">23:20 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2SA 8:18">II Sam 8:18</ref></char></note>Benaja, fis a Jehojada a, fis a yon mesye vanyan nan Kabtséel, ki te fè zak byen fò, li te touye de fis a Ariel yo nan Moab. Anplis, li te desann e te touye yon lyon nan mitan a yon fòs yon jou pandan lanèj t ap tonbe. <verse eid="2SA 23:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="2SA 23:21"/>Li te touye yon Ejipsyen, yon mesye mèvèy. Alò, Ejipsyen an te gen yon lans nan men li, men li te desann kote li avèk yon gwo baton e li te sezi lans lan soti nan men Ejipsyen an e te touye li avèk pwòp lans li an. <verse eid="2SA 23:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="2SA 23:22"/>Bagay sa yo, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">23:22 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2SA 23:20">II Sam 23:20</ref></char></note>Benaja, fis a Jehojada a te fè e non l te gen repitasyon menm jan ak twa mesye vanyan yo. <verse eid="2SA 23:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="2SA 23:23"/>Li te onore pami trant yo, men li pa t rive nan nivo a twa yo. Epi David te plase li kòm chèf sou gad li. <verse eid="2SA 23:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="2SA 23:24"/><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">23:24 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2SA 2:18">II Sam 2:18</ref></char></note>Asaël, frè a Joab la te pami trant yo; Elchanan, fis a Dodo a Bethléhem, <verse eid="2SA 23:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="2SA 23:25"/><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">23:25 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1CH 11:27">I Kwo 11:27</ref></char></note>Schamma, Awodit la, Élika, Awodit la, <verse eid="2SA 23:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="2SA 23:26"/>Hélets, Peletyen an, Ira, fis a Ikkesch la, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">23:26 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2SA 14:2">II Sam 14:2</ref></char></note>Tekoyit la, <verse eid="2SA 23:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="2SA 23:27"/>Abiézer, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">23:27 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOS 21:18">Jos 21:18</ref></char></note>Anatotyen an, Mebunnaï, Oushatyen an, <verse eid="2SA 23:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="2SA 23:28"/>Tsalmon, Achoachit la, Marahaï, Netofayit la. <verse eid="2SA 23:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="2SA 23:29"/><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">23:29 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1CH 11:30">I Kwo 11:30</ref></char></note>Héleb, fis a Baana a, Netofayit la, Ittaï, fis a Rabaï a nan <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">23:29 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOS 18:28">Jos 18:28</ref></char></note>Guibea, fis a Benjamin yo, <verse eid="2SA 23:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="2SA 23:30"/>Benaja, a <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">23:30 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JDG 12:13">Jij 12:13</ref></char></note>Pirathon, Hiddaï a Nachalé-Gaasch. <verse eid="2SA 23:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="2SA 23:31"/>Abi-Albon, Abatyen an, Azmaveth, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">23:31 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2SA 3:16">II Sam 3:16</ref></char></note>Bakoumit lan, <verse eid="2SA 23:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="2SA 23:32"/>Eliachba, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">23:32 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOS 19:42">Jos 19:42</ref></char></note>Shaalbonit lan, Bené-Jaschen avèk Jonathan, <verse eid="2SA 23:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="2SA 23:33"/>Schamma a Harar, Achaim, fis a Scharar a, Araryen an, <verse eid="2SA 23:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="2SA 23:34"/>Éliphéleth, fis a Achasbaï a, fis a Maakatyen an, Éliam, fis a Achitophel la nan Guillo Éliphéleth, fis a Achasbaï a nan Guillo. <verse eid="2SA 23:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="2SA 23:35"/>Hetsraï a Carmel. Paaraï, Arab la. <verse eid="2SA 23:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="2SA 23:36"/>Jijueal, fis a Nathan an nan Tsoba, Bani a Gad, <verse eid="2SA 23:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="2SA 23:37"/>Tsélek, Amonit lan, Naharaï nan Beéroth la, pòtè zam a Joab yo, fis a Tsuerja a. <verse eid="2SA 23:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="2SA 23:38"/>Ira a Jéther. <verse eid="2SA 23:38"/><verse number="39" style="v" sid="2SA 23:39"/>Urie, Etyen an: an total, trann-sèt òm.<verse eid="2SA 23:39"/></para>
  <chapter eid="2SA 23"/>
  <chapter number="24" style="c" sid="2SA 24"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2SA 24:1"/>Alò, kòlè SENYÈ a te brile ankò kont Israël e li te pwovoke David kont yo pou di: <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">24:1 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1CH 27:23-24">I Kwo 27:23-24</ref></char></note>“Ale konte moun Israël avèk Juda yo.” <verse eid="2SA 24:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2SA 24:2"/>Wa a te di a Joab, chèf lame ki te avèk li a: “Ale, koulye a, atravè tout tribi Israël yo, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">24:2 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JDG 20:1">Jij 20:1</ref></char></note>soti nan Dan jis rive Beer-Schéba e anrejistre pèp la pou m kab konnen nonb de moun yo.”<verse eid="2SA 24:2"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="2SA 24:3"/>Men Joab te di a wa a: “Alò, ke SENYÈ a ta kapab ajoute san fwa anplis kantite moun ke yo ye a, pandan zye a mèt mwen an, wa a, kab toujou wè. Men poukisa mèt mwen an, wa a, twouve plezi nan bagay sila a?”<verse eid="2SA 24:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="2SA 24:4"/>Men pawòl a wa a te pran plas kont Joab, e kont chèf lame yo. Pou sa, Joab avèk chèf lame yo te sòti nan prezans wa a pou anrejistre pèp Israël la. <verse eid="2SA 24:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2SA 24:5"/>Yo te travèse Jourdain an pou te fè kan <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">24:5 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 2:36">Det 2:36</ref></char></note>Aroër, sou bò dwat vil la ki nan mitan vale Gad la, ak vè Jaezer. <verse eid="2SA 24:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2SA 24:6"/>Epi yo te vini Galaad, nan peyi Thachthim-Hodschi, yo te rive Danjaan ak kote <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">24:6 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOS 19:28">Jos 19:28</ref></char></note>Sidon an. <verse eid="2SA 24:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2SA 24:7"/>Epi yo te rive nan <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">24:7 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOS 19:29">Jos 19:29</ref></char></note>fòterès Tyr la, nan tout vil a Evyen yo ak Kananeyen yo; epi yo te sòti nan sid Juda, nan Beer-Schéba. <verse eid="2SA 24:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2SA 24:8"/>Konsa, lè yo te fin pase nan tout peyi a, yo te vini Jérusalem nan fen nèf mwa e ven jou. <verse eid="2SA 24:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2SA 24:9"/>Epi Joab te bay nimewo anrejistreman pèp la bay wa a. Te gen an Israël, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">24:9 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1CH 21:5">I Kwo 21:5</ref></char></note>ui-san-mil mesye vanyan ki te kapab rale nepe e mesye nan Juda yo te senk-san-mil.<verse eid="2SA 24:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="2SA 24:10"/>Koulye a, kè <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">24:10 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1SA 24:5">I Sam 24:5</ref></char></note>David te vin twouble lè li te fin konte pèp la. Konsa, David te di a SENYÈ a: “Mwen te fè gwo peche nan sa mwen te fè a. Men koulye a, O SENYÈ, souple retire inikite a sèvitè Ou a, paske mwen te aji nan foli.”<verse eid="2SA 24:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="2SA 24:11"/>Lè David te leve nan maten, pawòl SENYÈ a te vini a <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">24:11 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1SA 22:5">I Sam 22:5</ref></char></note>pwofèt Gad la, vwayan David la, e li te di: <verse eid="2SA 24:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2SA 24:12"/>“Ale pale avèk David: ‘Konsa SENYÈ a di: “Mwen ap ofri ou twa bagay; chwazi pou ou menm youn nan yo, pou m fè ou.”’”<verse eid="2SA 24:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="2SA 24:13"/>Konsa, Gad te rive kote David e li te di li: “Èske <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">24:13 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1CH 21:12">I Kwo 21:12</ref></char></note>sèt ane gwo grangou va rive ou nan peyi ou? Oswa èske ou va sove ale pandan twa mwa devan lènmi ou yo pandan y ap kouri dèyè ou? Oswa èske va gen twa jou gwo epidemi nan peyi ou? Alò konsidere e wè ki repons mwen va pote bay Sila ki te voye mwen an.”<verse eid="2SA 24:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="2SA 24:14"/>Epi David te di a Gad: “Mwen nan gwo pwoblèm. Annou tonbe nan men a SENYÈ a, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">24:14 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 51:1">Sòm 51:1</ref></char></note>paske mizerikòd Li gran; men pa kite mwen tonbe nan men a lòm.”<verse eid="2SA 24:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="2SA 24:15"/>Konsa, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">24:15 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1CH 21:14">I Kwo 21:14</ref></char></note>SENYÈ a te voye yon epidemi sou Israël jis rive nan maten nan lè chwazi a e swasann-di-mil moun nan pèp la soti Dan jis rive Beer-Schéba te mouri. <verse eid="2SA 24:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2SA 24:16"/><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">24:16 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 12:23">Trav 12:23</ref></char></note>Lè zanj lan te lonje men li vè Jérusalem pou detwi li, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">24:16 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 32:14">Egz 32:14</ref></char></note>SENYÈ a te repanti de gwo malè a. Li te di a zanj ki te detwi pèp la: “Sa ase! Koulye a, lache men ou!” Epi zanj SENYÈ a te akote glasi a Aravna a, Jebizyen an.<verse eid="2SA 24:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="2SA 24:17"/>Konsa, David te pale a SENYÈ a lè li te wè zanj ki t ap frape pèp la. Li te di: “Gade byen, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">24:17 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2SA 24:10">II Sam 24:10</ref></char></note>se mwen ki te peche a, se mwen ki te fè mal la. Men mouton sila yo, kisa yo te fè? Souple, kite men Ou vin kont mwen, ak kont lakay papa m.”<verse eid="2SA 24:17"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="2SA 24:18"/>Konsa, Gad te rive kote David nan jou sa menm, e li te di li: “Ale monte, bati yon lotèl a SENYÈ a sou glasi Aravna a, Jebizyen an.”<verse eid="2SA 24:18"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="2SA 24:19"/>David te monte pa pawòl a Gad la, jis jan ke SENYÈ a te kòmande a. <verse eid="2SA 24:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="2SA 24:20"/>Aravna te gade anba e te wè wa a avèk sèvitè li yo ki t ap travèse bò kote li. Epi Aravna te parèt deyò e li te bese figi li jiska atè devan wa a. <verse eid="2SA 24:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="2SA 24:21"/>Alò, Aravna te di: “Poukisa mèt mwen, wa a, te vin kote sèvitè li a?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2SA 24:21">David te reponn: “Pou achte glasi a nan men ou, pou m kab bati yon lotèl bay SENYÈ a, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">24:21 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NUM 16:44-50">Nonb 16:44-50</ref></char></note>pou epidemi an kab vin sispann sou pèp la.”<verse eid="2SA 24:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="2SA 24:22"/>Aravna te di a David: “Kite mèt mwen an, wa a, pran sa li wè ki bon nan zye li, e ofri li. Gade, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">24:22 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1SA 6:14">I Sam 6:14</ref></char></note>men bèf pou ofrann brile a, bwa kabwèt yo avèk jouk bèf yo pou bwa dife a. <verse eid="2SA 24:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="2SA 24:23"/>Tout bagay, O wa, Aravna ap bay wa a.” Epi Aravna te di a wa a: “Ke SENYÈ a, Bondye ou a, kapab kontan avèk ou.”<verse eid="2SA 24:23"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="2SA 24:24"/>Sepandan, wa a te di a Aravna: “Non, men mwen va, anverite, achte li pou yon pri. Paske mwen p ap ofri ofrann brile bay SENYÈ a, Bondye mwen an ki pa koute m anyen.” Konsa, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">24:24 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1CH 21:24-25">I Kwo 21:24-25</ref></char></note>David te achte glasi a avèk bèf yo pou senkant sik ajan. <verse eid="2SA 24:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="2SA 24:25"/>David te bati la yon lotèl bay SENYÈ a e li te ofri ofrann brile yo avèk ofrann lapè yo. <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">24:25 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2SA 21:14">II Sam 21:14</ref></char></note>Konsa, SENYÈ a te kontan akoz lapriyè pou peyi a, e epidemi an te vin sispann an Israël.<verse eid="2SA 24:25"/></para>
  <chapter eid="2SA 24"/>
</usx>
